msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@CULTURE_REAVER@SUBCULTURE@FEDERATE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Your people believe that all nations are stronger together; through strength and diplomacy, all shall share in the prosperity of their Federation:[bulletlist][bullet/]Gain {GLOBAL.FavorsConcept.Hyperlink} from defeating <<m:{GLOBAL.MarauderConcept.Hyperlink}>>, destroying <<m:{GLOBAL.InfestationConcept.Hyperlink}>>, and maintaining {GLOBAL.PactOfVassalageLvl3Concept.Hyperlink} with <<m:{GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink}>>. Use {GLOBAL.FavorsConcept.Hyperlink} to improve the {GLOBAL.HouseInfluenceConcept.Hyperlink} of your Vassals, rush War Coordination, trade with <<m:{GLOBAL.IndependentCityConcept.Hyperlink}>>, and recruit from {GLOBAL.RequestMilitaryAidConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Units recruited from {GLOBAL.RequestMilitaryAidConcept.Hyperlink} gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FEDERATE_LEVY.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Your units gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FEDERATE_SOLDIER.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@EMPIRESANDASHES@CULTURE_REAVER@SUBCULTURE@FEDERATE@DISCUSSION_DECLARATIONOFDEBT@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Utilize Favors to keep another {GLOBAL.LeaderConcept.Hyperlink} at bay:[bulletlist][bullet/]A modifier that slowly increases towards {RelationValue}[goodRelation/] will be added to your [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EmpireRelationConcept]relations[/hyperlink] with the Ruler. [bullet/]While the Declaration lasts, the affected player will not have any grudge affecting the relation for any of their <<m:{GLOBAL.CasusBelliConcept.Hyperlink}>> towards you.[bullet/]Maintaining a declaration costs {cost} upkeep per {GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}, which increases by {costScale} for each additional declaration.[bullet/]Declarations can be made and ended through <<m:{GLOBAL.PronouncementsConcept.Hyperlink}>>."

