msgstr "Defender heroes:[bulletlist][bullet/]Have {YDGAARDS_TRADE_HP_LOSS>BONUS>HitPoints} maximum <<m:{GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Base attacks have a base {GILDED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.GILDED.Hyperlink} for {GILDED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBATPROPERTIES_TACTICAL@YDGAARD01@NAME"
msgstr "Ydgaard's Golden Guardians"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBATPROPERTIES_TACTICAL@YDGAARD02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Defenders have:[bulletlist][bullet/]{YDGAARD_ARCANUM_GOLD_SUNDERING_DEFENSE>DEF_MOD>Armor} {GLOBAL.DefenseConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]{YDGAARD_ARCANUM_GOLD_SUNDERING_DEFENSE>REDUCTION>Physical} {GLOBAL.PhysicalResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBATPROPERTIES_TACTICAL@YDGAARD02@NAME"
msgstr "Gold Sundering"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBATPROPERTIES_TACTICAL@YDGAARD03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Attackers have a base {GILDED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.GILDED.Hyperlink} for {GILDED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>> on attacks. Increased for Single Shots."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBATPROPERTIES_TACTICAL@YDGAARD03@NAME"
msgstr "Gilded Blessing"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBATPROPERTIES_TACTICAL@YSARIEL01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]Each turn, all units lose {amount} {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Defenders:[bulletlist][bullet/]Gain +{amount2}% damage for each level of {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink} below Neutral.[bullet/]Have {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FIERCE.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist][/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBATPROPERTIES_TACTICAL@YSARIEL01@NAME"
msgstr "Ysariel's Sorrow"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBATPROPERTIES_TACTICAL@YSARIEL02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "At the start of combat, {amount} <<m:{GLOBAL.UNITS.IMMOLATED_SOUL.Hyperlink}>> join the attackers."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBATPROPERTIES_TACTICAL@YSARIEL02@NAME"
msgstr "Tortured Souls"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBATPROPERTIES_TACTICAL@YSARIEL03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]Attackers gain +{amount} {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink} at the start of combat.[bullet/]Ysariel's Sorrow no longer removes {amount2} {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink} each turn.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBATPROPERTIES_TACTICAL@YSARIEL03@NAME"
msgstr "Uplift"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBATPROPERTIES_TACTICAL@ZAETHYL01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Every {turn} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}>>, several <<m:{GLOBAL.UNITS.LIVING_VINE_UNIT.Hyperlink}>> are summoned on random positions which last for {turn} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}>> on the defender's side."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBATPROPERTIES_TACTICAL@ZAETHYL01@NAME"
msgstr "Grasping Flora"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBAT_PROPERTY@ARCANUM_NIMUE@SUMMON"
msgstr "Aid of Nature"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@COMBAT_PROPERTY@ARCANUM_NIMUE@SUMMON@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A {GLOBAL.UNITS.FLORAL_STINGER.Hyperlink} joins your side during the battle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1175_15984@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1175_15984@NAME"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1175_15984@SUB_HEADER"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1175_15990@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1175_15990@NAME"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1175_15990@SUB_HEADER"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1252_196@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "During the Second Age, the <<m:{GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> of the crumbled [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle of Evermore[/hyperlink] created Shrouded Isles to hide their most valued secrets. They must be explored to unravel the mysterious disturbances shaking the island."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1252_196@NAME"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1252_196@SUB_HEADER"
msgstr "Explore the Shrouded Isles on Evermore."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1252_249@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "There is an Eldritch Leviathan from the ancient times sleeping beneath Evermore. As it slowly awakens, more and more of its body parts will resurface as Landmarks on the map."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1252_249@NAME"
msgstr "The Eldritch Leviathan"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1252_249@SUB_HEADER"
msgstr "Build Astral anchors before the Leviathan fully awakens. Time until the next Landmark appears:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1252_249@SUB_HEADER_INVERTED"
msgstr "Protect the Landmarks, so the Leviathan can fully awaken..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1252_680@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} rebels and their Fey allies are under assault by the {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} servants of the {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Ham Binger has become the leading figure of this resistance and must be protected at all cost."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1252_680@NAME"
msgstr "Burrows Besieged"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1252_680@SUB_HEADER"
msgstr "The defensive lines of the rebellion are holding."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1252_807@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The seasons are unusually potent on this realm, causing constant change and turmoil."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1252_807@NAME"
msgstr "Warped Seasons"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CRISIS@1252_807@SUB_HEADER"
msgstr "It is spring time. During this season:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@CUSTOM_RACE@FIREBRAND_HELLION@NAME"
msgstr "Firebrand Hellions"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@DISPLAYDESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unravel the Hidden Powers of the Cosmos in Age of Wonders 4: Secrets of the Archmages. Follow the footsteps of Athla's renowned Wizard Kings. Discover the secret arts they learned and face the perils left in their wake as they ventured through the most infamous Worlds of the Astral Sea."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@DISPLAYNAME"
msgstr "Age of Wonders 4: Secrets of the Archmages"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@DUATHA_SHROUDED_ARCANUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@FAILURE"
msgstr "The spellwarped torrents slip beyond your control as the Fey mists swell."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@DUATHA_SHROUDED_ARCANUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@HEADER"
msgstr "You reach out to subdue the spellwarped aura of this place:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@DUATHA_SHROUDED_ARCANUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The seasonal torrents bend to your will, and the Fey mists disperse."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@DUATHA_SHROUDED_ARCANUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@FAILURE"
msgstr "Enraged, Magbar breaks through your attempts and attacks!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@DUATHA_SHROUDED_ARCANUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@HEADER"
msgstr "Draw on the forces of nature to soothe this furious {EventUnit}:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@DUATHA_SHROUDED_ARCANUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@SUCCESS"
msgstr "Stilled, though afraid, Magbar warms up to you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@DUATHA_SHROUDED_PORTAL@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@FAILURE"
msgstr "The {EventUnit} shakes <<o:EventUnit>> head and then attacks your troops."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@DUATHA_SHROUDED_PORTAL@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to resolve the riddle by presenting the answer in action:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@DUATHA_SHROUDED_PORTAL@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The mighty Guardian humbly acknowledges you answer."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@EMPIRE_CORE@REALM_TRAITS@EXPENDABLE_HORDES@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Life is cheap in this realm, and with that comes a near limitless supply of recruits. However, elites and powerful monsters are in turn much harder to come by.[br/][bulletlist][bullet/]Tier 1 [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UnitConcept]Units[/hyperlink] have their recruitment costs in <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>> decreased by {percentage} in <<m:{GLOBAL.CityConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Tier 1 Units gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.EXPENDABLE.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Tier 3 and higher Units have their recruitment costs in Cities increased by {percentage2}.[/bulletlist]"

