msgstr "Scops^M"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@SKIN_OWLKIN@HERO_FIRSTNAME_18@NAME"
msgstr "Selenor^M"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@SKIN_OWLKIN@HERO_FIRSTNAME_19@NAME"
msgstr "Silios^M"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@SKIN_OWLKIN@HERO_FIRSTNAME_20@NAME"
msgstr "Ubor^M"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@SKIN_OWLKIN@HERO_FIRSTNAME_21@NAME"
msgstr "Curo^M"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@SPAWNERS@MSITWALKER_CAMP@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A crude encampment where sinister Fey lurk in the mists.[br/]Provinces in this infestation's territory have {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MISTY.Hyperlink}.[br/]If left unchecked, they will grow in strength, expand their territory, and send out invasion armies."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@SPAWNERS@MSITWALKER_CAMP@LORE"
msgstr "The mist spreads the domain of {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. The {GLOBAL.UNITS.FEY_ABOMINATION.Hyperlink} are no longer content with mere incursions, they have come to claim this land. Do not trust this lingering fog, for it hides no friends, only foes."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@SPAWNERS@MSITWALKER_CAMP@NAME"
msgstr "Mistwalker Camp"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@SPECIAL_OPERATION@MOVE_PORTAL@CONFIRMATION_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "You have provinces annexed through this portal, moving it outside of this city will disconnect those provinces. No population will be lost.\n"
"\n"
"Do you wish to proceed?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@SPECIAL_OPERATION@MOVE_PORTAL@CONFIRMATION_TITLE"
msgstr "Move Portal"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1160_1610@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Take heart! All things shall pass, even this.\" [happiness/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1160_1610@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Why suffer? We should embrace this carnage!\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1160_1610@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"If this Pit wants carnage, we shall feed it!\" [draft/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1160_1616@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Take heart, my people. The worst has passed.\" [happiness/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1160_1616@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Continue the carnage, if only a little longer.\" [draft/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1480@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Perhaps these <<m:EventStructure>> are the key to unlocking the beckoning secrets. You or one of your <<m:{GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink}>> should visit one."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1480@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "This new realm harbors secrets. You sense them pulling you beyond the horizon. Like an ancient power calling your name."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1480@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Your scouts report the discovery of several <<m:{GLOBAL.BreachedIsleConcept.Hyperlink}>> in this realm, although none dared to venture beyond. They also counted an unusual amount of <<m:EventStructure>> that hum when you go near them. The scouts found archaic inscriptions etched onto these lone stone columns, but could not make sense of them. They claim the glyphs danced before their eyes."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1480@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Whatever power this realm hides, it will be mine.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1480@TITLE"
msgstr "Gateways to Shrouded Secrets"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1481@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventHero} should activate this {EventStructure} and then find two more."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1481@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The {EventStructure} protrudes from the ground, humming—just as your scouts reported. {EventHero} notices eldritch inscriptions that adorn its smooth surface."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1481@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The markings swirl and quiver as if trying to escape <<G:gaze^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>>. Finally, they yield their shrouded message, describing hidden hoards or sepulchers in which forbidden powers of world-changing potential are locked away. They also speak of ancient guardians, duty-bound to deter the undeserving. The <<m:EventStructure>> reveal the path to these secrets, but only in the presence of a {GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1481@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"The untrodden path slowly reveals itself.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1481@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the <<m:EventStructure>>"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1482@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The locations of all <<m:EventStructure>> are revealed to you. Will your courage allow you to pursue whatever secrets lie within?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1482@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The third {EventStructureB} is activated at your behest. Its humming vibrations unlock a vision in your mind."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1482@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You see the circular shapes of eldritch doorways that can barely contain the powerful magic they conceal. You also sense a potent danger, both beyond and on the threshold of every {EventStructure}. Only the bravest and the most powerful should endeavor to venture into the sepulchered domains of the <<m:{GLOBAL.ShroudedIsleConcept.Hyperlink}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1482@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"May the shrouds that cover the <<m:EventStructure>> be lifted.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1482@TITLE"
msgstr "Gateways to Shrouded Secrets: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1486@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Make no attempt to deceive us. You would lose your lives.\" The commanding {EnemyUnit} and <<o:EnemyUnit>> allies await <<G:response^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1486@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As {EventHero} approaches the {EventStructure}, a {EnemyUnit} steps out of the gate, flanked by several stout {EventRace} protectors."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1486@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We have sworn a covenant with the Keeper of the lands behind the gate,\" utters the {EnemyUnit}. \"None are permitted to pass, unless they solve this riddle: [br/][br/]The wise swallow me, yet [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archons[/hyperlink] I consumed all.[br/]Keep your feet on the earth, lest I cause you to fall.[br/]In all {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} I teem, yet in your mirror I am rarely seen.[br/]What am I?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1486@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You are pride.\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1486@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Attack the arrogant {EventRace} to steal their hidden prize. {EventResource}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1486@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Display how exaltation has taught you humility."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1486@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Seal the {EventStructure} with your splendor to dazzle the {EventUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1486@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I'll return with the answer.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1486@TITLE"
msgstr "Keepers and Covenants"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Ydgaard's gilded wardens rise and quietly form ranks to defend {EventStructure} against invaders. Is {EventHero} ready for battle?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "The Void Stone, having awaited its Master's return, willingly yields its concealed secrets to you. What else will you take?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "Ydgaard's gilded wardens rise and quietly form ranks to defend the {EventStructure} against invaders. Are you ready for battle?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After passing many [hyperlink,GLOBAL.MineConcept][mine/]Mines[/hyperlink] in this valley of gold, {EventHero} leads <<o:EventHero>> army into {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "You arrive at a familiar structure. {EventStructure}. Your sanctum. Soon, you arrive in the impressive vaulted hall you constructed."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "After passing many [hyperlink,GLOBAL.MineConcept][mine/]Mines[/hyperlink] in this valley of gold, you lead your army into {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{EventHero.FirstName} enters an impressive vaulted hall. An immaculate gold statue of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.YdgaardLoreConcept]Ydgaard Worldbender[/hyperlink] is placed at the center. The statue is encircled by stone tables on which lifelike statues of gold rest. {EventHero.FirstName} recognizes golems, but also spots <<m:{GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink}>>. When {EventHero.FirstName} approaches Ydgaard's statue, the Void Stone that replaced his heart quivers as the surrounding gold statues stir."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "Several gilded <<m:{GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink}>> lie motionless on stone tables. You ignore these failed experiments of yours. You know the true treasure resides inside the gold statue in your likeness, placed at the center of the hall. The jewel in your eye socket lights up when you grasp the pulsating Void Stone that rests in the chest of your statue."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "You enter an impressive vaulted hall. An immaculate gold statue of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.YdgaardLoreConcept]Ydgaard Worldbender[/hyperlink] is placed at the center. The statue is encircled by stone tables on which lifelike statues of gold rest. You recognize golems, but also spot <<m:{GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink}>>. When you approach Ydgaard's statue, the Void Stone that replaced his heart quivers as the surrounding gold statues stir."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack the golden host of Ydgaard Worldbender."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Cast flaming spells [mana/] to soften the golden casings of the <<G:defenders^p,EventStructure>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Tap into Ydgaard's power to harness the potency of gold."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Abandon this gold-stained tomb."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Collect lost notes [knowledge/] of older experiments you conducted here."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Bring some of the gold [gold/] kept in this vault."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1488@TITLE"
msgstr "Ydgaard's Greed"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1489@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Ydgaard's greed drove him to exchange his followers' gentleness for wealth. Will his obsession corrupt you in a similar way?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1489@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The golden defenders were no match for your army's might. {EventHero} may now explore Ydgaard's hall."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1489@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The golden defenders were no match for your army's might. You may now explore Ydgaard's hall."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1489@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{EventStructure} served as treasury and laboratory. Here, [hyperlink,GLOBAL.YdgaardLoreConcept]Ydgaard Worldbender[/hyperlink] experimented on his subjects, some of whom {EventHero.FirstName} defeated just now. <<G:eye^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>> is drawn to Ydgaard's pure gold statue. The Void Stone that replaced Ydgaard's heart pulsates with energy. When <<G:hand^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>> touches the relic, it transmutes into a sheet of gold leaf on which Ydgaard etched his most elaborate spell."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1489@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "{EventStructure} served as treasury and laboratory. Here, [hyperlink,GLOBAL.YdgaardLoreConcept]Ydgaard Worldbender[/hyperlink] experimented on his subjects, some of whom you defeated just now. Your eye is drawn to Ydgaard's pure gold statue. The Void Stone that replaced Ydgaard's heart pulsates with energy. When your hand touches the relic, it transmutes into a sheet of gold leaf on which Ydgaard etched his most elaborate spell."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1489@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Study [knowledge/] Ydgaard's laboratory equipment."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1489@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Melt down Ydgaard's statue. [gold/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1489@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Use Ydgaard's gold to decorate your throne room. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1489@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Leave {EventStructure} without taking anything. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1489@TITLE"
msgstr "Ydgaard's Greed: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Merriment immediately washes away from the warrior's face. The mood shifts abruptly. {EventHero.FirstName} disturbed the <<G:sacred festivities^p,EventRace>>. They draw weapons."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "After maturing for ages, your secret spell soaks into your mind. Tragically, you must then abandon your carousal yet again."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "Merriment immediately washes away from the warrior's face. The mood shifts abruptly. You disturbed the <<G:sacred festivities^p,EventRace>>. They draw weapons."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Intoxicating vapors draw {EventHero} towards {EventStructure}, making <<P:EventHero>> feel light-headed. Spirited voices call your warriors in."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "You follow the enthralling music that comes from {EventStructure}. Moving to its rhythm, you feel your spirits lifting."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "Intoxicating vapors draw you towards {EventStructure}, making you feel light-headed. Spirited voices call your warriors in."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Inside, your army discovers an eternal festival of hedonism and debauchery in honor of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CinrenLoreConcept]Cinren Toliath[/hyperlink]. His followers cheer and sing, filling up goblets with a potent liquid, red as blood, spewed from silver fountains. They raise their glass when they notice {EventHero.FirstName} and amicably offer <<o:EventHero>> warriors their drinks. Before {EventHero.FirstName} can intervene, one of them downs the fluid."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "The festival of hedonism and debauchery that you yourself started an eternity ago still rages on. Your followers become delirious when they notice that their {PlayerLeader.Title} has returned. You briefly join their revels before regrettably turning your attention to the true purpose of your journey here. You raise the untouched chalice on the seat that bears your name, and drink."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "Inside, your army discovers an eternal festival of hedonism and debauchery in honor of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CinrenLoreConcept]Cinren Toliath[/hyperlink]. His followers cheer and sing, filling up goblets with a potent liquid, red as blood, spewed from silver fountains. They raise their glass when they notice you and amicably offer your warriors their drinks. Before you can intervene, one of them downs the fluid."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack the celebrators of Cinren."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Cast an amnesia spell [mana/] on the affected warrior."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Tap into Cinren Toliath's power and free your mind of sorrows."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Leave this party early. You've overstayed your welcome."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Invite one of the guests, a {EventUnit}, to join you. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Allow the celebrations [morale/] of {EventStructure} to spread to your armies."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1490@TITLE"
msgstr "Cinren's Carousal"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1491@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The chalice produces a scroll detailing Cinren's jubilant power over the unwilling mind. What other rewards might {EventStructure} yield?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1491@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The chalice produces a scroll detailing Cinren's jubilant power over the unwilling mind. What other rewards might the {EventStructure} yield?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1491@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your army has snuffed out the light of Cinren's party. His disciples lie dead on the floor of {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1491@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Now that the festival has ended, {EventHero} explores {EventStructure} with clear mind. This debauched festival has persisted for centuries, enabling Cinren's followers to accumulate excessive reservoirs of lecherous potency. {EventHero.FirstName} then notices a lone, empty chair, labeled \"[hyperlink,GLOBAL.CinrenLoreConcept]Cinren Toliath[/hyperlink].\" A chalice is placed on the chair. The urge to drink it becomes irrepressible. {EventHero.FirstName} is compelled to drink."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1491@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Now that the festival has ended, you explore {EventStructure} with clear mind. This debauched festival has persisted for centuries, enabling Cinren's followers to accumulate excessive reservoirs of lecherous potency. You then notice a lone, empty chair, labeled \"[hyperlink,GLOBAL.CinrenLoreConcept]Cinren Toliath[/hyperlink].\" A chalice is placed on the chair. The urge to drink it becomes irrepressible. You are compelled to drink."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1491@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Have {EventHero} study [unitHero/] the encouraging power of hedonism."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1491@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Teach your {EventRace} Cinren's tenets [knowledge/] for revelry."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1491@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Have the clarity of the chalice protect the mind of your warriors."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1491@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Distribute the flowing intoxicating liquid, now powerless, in your cities. [chaosboon/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1491@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Distribute the flowing intoxicating liquid, now powerless, in your cities. [natureboon/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1491@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Distribute the flowing intoxicating liquid, now powerless, in your cities. [astralboon/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1491@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Distribute the flowing intoxicating liquid, now powerless, in your cities. [shadowboon/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1491@TITLE"
msgstr "Cinren's Carousal: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The <<m:EventUnit>> gaze at your warriors, who sense an uncomfortable heat swell within them. Can {EventHero.FirstName} extinguish this fiery threat?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "You feel rekindled as you ignore the cold on your way out. You would cry, if your tears wouldn't evaporate."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "The <<m:EventUnit>> gaze at your warriors, who sense an uncomfortable heat swell within them. Can you extinguish this fiery threat?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Making <<o:EventHero>> way through the charred and lava-flooded domain, {EventHero} tastes ash in the air as <<p:EventHero>> approaches {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "You hesitate to enter {EventStructure} as painful memories flash before your eyes. Regardless, you step inside the sweltering crypt."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "Making your way through the charred and lava-flooded domain, you taste ash in the air as you approach {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Your troops swelter as they step into a courtyard dotted with burnt-out pyres, traces of a harrowing history. Echoing screams of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.KarissaLoreConcept]Karissa[/hyperlink] reverberate within her secret sanctuary. {EventHero.FirstName} realizes this is where Karissa was kindled and reborn anew, many times over. Her screams take form as <<m:EventUnit>>, flaming defenders of her sanctum, sparked by [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ChaosConcept]Chaos[/hyperlink] yet fueled by Karissa's fury."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "The pyres. It is as if they were kindled only yesterday. The memories are seared into your mind. The pain of your burning flesh. Then: rebirth, before the cycle would start anew. Until ultimately, your flame was purified. Your fiery screams that still haunt this primordial ritual site have become <<m:EventUnit>>, manifestations of raw fury, which obey your every command."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "Your troops swelter as they step into a courtyard dotted with burnt-out pyres, traces of a harrowing history. Echoing screams of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.KarissaLoreConcept]Karissa[/hyperlink] reverberate within her secret sanctuary. You realize, this is where Karissa was kindled and reborn anew, many times over. Her screams take form as <<m:EventUnit>>, flaming defenders of her sanctum, sparked by [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ChaosConcept]Chaos[/hyperlink] yet fueled by Karissa's fury."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Snuff out the flames of the defenders. Charge!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Magically cool [mana/] your warriors before engaging the fiery foes."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Tap into Karissa's power. Ignite your army's fervor."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "This is likely too hot for your troops to handle. Get out."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Recover a {EventItem} from the pyre ashes to take with you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Use your fury to kindle the warrior spirits [morale/] of your {EventRace}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1492@TITLE"
msgstr "Karissa's Rekindling"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1493@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Karissa's primordial spell is now yours. What other boon will {EventHero} take from {EventStructure} before moving on?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1493@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Karissa's primordial spell is now yours. What other boon will you take from {EventStructure} before moving on?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1493@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The burning flames of her defenders quenched, the sanctum of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.KarissaLoreConcept]Karissa[/hyperlink] is now safe for {EventHero} to explore."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1493@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The burning flames of her defenders quenched, the sanctum of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.KarissaLoreConcept]Karissa[/hyperlink] is now safe for you to explore."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1493@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Karissa's screams resound again. They are released from the central pyre. {EventHero.FirstName} feels <<o:EventHero>> temperature rising as <<p:EventHero>> steps closer. Laying <<o:EventHero>> hand on the charred wood, <<p:EventHero>> senses the volatile magic sealed within. Dancing flames unexpectedly erupt from the pyre, engulfing {EventHero.FirstName} and revealing a charred scroll. When {EventHero.FirstName} unfurls it, a single frozen tear falls out and shatters."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1493@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Karissa's screams resound again. They are released from the central pyre. You feel your temperature rising as you steps closer. Laying your hand on the charred wood, you sense the volatile magic sealed within. Dancing flames unexpectedly erupt from the pyre, engulfing you and revealing a charred scroll. When you unfurl it, a single frozen tear falls out and shatters."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1493@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Rouse [xp/] {EventHero} in the heat of {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1493@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Feed any lingering embers to the forges [unitprod/] in {EventCity}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1493@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Spread the revels of Karissa's heat [chaosboon/] to all of your cities."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1493@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Train your troops to endure the sizzling heat inside {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1493@TITLE"
msgstr "Karissa's Rekindling: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Your army's presence alarms the Entwined guardians. Their defensive instincts unfold as {EventHero.FirstName} must decide how to deal with them."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "While you could linger in your sanctuary forever, the realms outside are hurting. Only by your grace may they heal."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "Your army's presence alarms the Entwined guardians. Their defensive instincts unfold as you must decide how to deal with them."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} passes lush forests and a clear spring to discover {EventStructure}. <<Cp:EventHero>> notes its harmony with the surrounding nature."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "You approach {EventStructure} as if visiting an old friend. Nature has healed these once-wasted lands, creating a paradise."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "You pass lush forests and a clear spring to discover {EventStructure}. You note its harmony with the surrounding nature."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{EventHero.FirstName} leads <<o:EventHero>> army deep into the secluded paradise; verdant, vibrant, and fertile. Statues and murals detail the history of this conservatory. Originally barren and scarred, [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ZaethylLoreConcept]Zaethyl Silverleaf[/hyperlink] healed the wastelands by weaving [hyperlink,GLOBAL.NatureConcept]Nature[/hyperlink]. A sanctuary grown for benevolent wildlife and her First Elves who, after chronicling this history, departed. Only <<m:EventUnit>> remain, tasked with the Sanctuary's defense."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "Creaking <<m:EventUnit>>, rooted in place for centuries, bow before their {PlayerLeader.Title}. You once shaped this scarred land. Now it shapes you, teaching you undiscovered secrets of the art of terrain mending. You take one last look at the trees laden with fruit and realize: for beauty to blossom, you sometimes have to leave it alone for a few centuries."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "You lead your army deep into the secluded paradise; verdant, vibrant, and fertile. Statues and murals detail the history of this conservatory. Originally barren and scarred, [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ZaethylLoreConcept]Zaethyl Silverleaf[/hyperlink] healed the wastelands by weaving [hyperlink,GLOBAL.NatureConcept]Nature[/hyperlink]. A sanctuary grown for benevolent wildlife and her First Elves who, after chronicling this history, departed. Only <<m:EventUnit>> remain, tasked with the Sanctuary's defense."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Fell these arborescent defenders!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Before attacking, have lumberers [structureprod/] from {EventCity} clear the battlefield of vegetation."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Tap into Zaethyl Silverleaf's power. Root the Entwined guardians."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Make like a tree and leave."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Take one of the <<m:EventUnit>> [unit/] with you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Pick some of the fruit for {EventCity}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1494@TITLE"
msgstr "Zaethyl's Sanctuary"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1495@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Despite the comfort of {EventStructure}, your army's respite will soon pass. What bounty shall they take with them?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1495@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Peace has returned to Zaethyl's Sanctuary. Your warriors are free to roam the hidden forest of the Elf Queen."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1495@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "This is a wild but fertile land. Plump berries and juicy fruits hang from long branches of old trees. When {EventHero.FirstName} inspects a statue of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ZaethylLoreConcept]Zaethyl Silverleaf[/hyperlink], a beam of light illuminates them both. Her marble effigy appears to smile in the presence of {EventHero.FirstName}. Warmth engulfs your {GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink}, and <<p:EventHero>> becomes aware of a hidden scroll revealing Zaethyl's secrets."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1495@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "This is a wild but fertile land. Plump berries and juicy fruits hang from long branches of old trees. When you inspect a statue of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ZaethylLoreConcept]Zaethyl Silverleaf[/hyperlink], a beam of light illuminates you both. Her marble effigy appears to smile in your presence. Warmth engulfs you, and you become aware of a hidden scroll revealing Zaethyl's secrets."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1495@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Pick up a gnarled branch [item/] to wield as a weapon."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1495@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Harvest the ripe fruits [food/] that hang from the trees and bushes."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1495@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Plant trees from {EventStructure} in all of your cities. [natureboon/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1495@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Cut down the trees of Zaethyl's Sanctuary to use as lumber. [structureprod/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1495@TITLE"
msgstr "Zaethyl's Sanctuary: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1496@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Some {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} cheerfully draw weapons while others summon concealing mists. \"Come, brothers and sisters. These trespassers will still our hunger.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1496@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "While the {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} unsheathe their weapons, the {EnemyUnit} turns menacingly towards you, eager to commence the carnage."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1496@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} warband has breached this infernal realm and penetrated {EventStructure}. {EventHero} finds them inside, encircling a bewildered {EnemyUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1496@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "A {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} warband has breached this infernal realm and penetrated {EventStructure}. You find them inside, encircling a bewildered {EnemyUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1496@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "They triumphantly jeer at the creature until one of them notices {EventHero.FirstName}. \"Ah, Belbedor's servants. You're too late. Behold our mockery of your Master's creation! The {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} Demon.\" The {EnemyUnit}, torn between <<o:EnemyUnit>> fiendish and Fey natures, inspects <<o:EnemyUnit>> own form. \"I feel...,\" the monster growls. \"Glittery? Watch me dance!\" The creature belches frosted lightning. \"Pretty lights!\" roars the {EnemyUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1496@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "They triumphantly jeer at the creature until one of them notices you. \"Ah, Belbedor's servants. You're too late. Behold our mockery of your Master's creation! The {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} Demon.\" The {EnemyUnit}, torn between <<o:EnemyUnit>> fiendish and Fey natures, inspects <<o:EnemyUnit>> own form. \"I feel...,\" the monster growls. \"Glittery? Watch me dance!\" The creature belches frosted lightning. \"Pretty lights!\" roars the {EnemyUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1496@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Show the Duathadae your martial prowess."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1496@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Before you charge in, dispel [mana/] the summoned mists."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1496@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Tap into Belbedor's power and flay the <<G:mind^n,EnemyUnit>> with Chaos."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1496@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Retreat from {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1496@TITLE"
msgstr "Belbedor's Folly"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1497@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventHero.FirstName} recovers the scrolls that summon <<m:EventUnit>>: Duatha Demon abominations. What else will <<p:EventHero>> claim from this infernal place?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1497@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You recover the scrolls that summon <<m:EventUnit>>: Duatha Demon abominations. What else will you claim from this infernal place?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1497@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The last of the {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} falls, still clenching her {EventItem} as she attempts to chortle through blood and pain."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1497@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Fools. Fools like your Master, Belbedor the Haughty, who believed he could conquer {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Our dungeon is now his dwelling, until my kin devours him.\" She coughs up blood. \"You felled the abomination, but your Master's spell is branded by us. It only produces <<m:EventUnit>>.\" She wheezes: \"The last laugh... is ours,\" then dies with a smile on her lips."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1497@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "\"Fools. Fools like your Master, Belbedor the Haughty, who believed he could conquer {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Our dungeon is now his dwelling, until my kin devours him.\" She coughs up blood. \"You felled the abomination, but your Master's spell is branded by us. It only produces <<m:EventUnit>>.\" She wheezes: \"The last laugh... is ours,\" then dies with a smile on her lips."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1497@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Loot [gold/] the Fey for relics and jewelery."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1497@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Take the {EventItem} [item/] held by the Duathadae Captain."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1497@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Filter magical power [mana/] from the dissipating mists."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1497@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Wield the Arcanum's Obbadothan energies to summon [unit/] a {EventUnitB}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1497@TITLE"
msgstr "Belbedor's Folly: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As <<G:army^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>> struggles to stay warm, frozen defenders rise from their icy tombs to defend their Queen's inner sanctum."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "Yet the sensation unlocked new powers within you. Your frozen lips smile. The Hour of the Ice Queen approaches."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "As your army struggles to stay warm, frozen defenders rise from their icy tombs to defend their Queen's inner sanctum."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} marches into {EventStructure} to find endless halls of gleaming ice. The slow beating of a drum beckons to <<P:EventHero>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "You wander through the abandoned corridors of {EventStructure}. All is frozen solid, but when has the cold ever bothered you?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "You march into {EventStructure} to find endless halls of gleaming ice. The slow beating of a drum beckons to you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "All corridors lead to the central hall of the Ice Palace. A circle of ice sculptures of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArticaLoreConcept]Artica[/hyperlink] all point to their middle. There, on a pedestal of frost, lies a frozen heart; beating still, however slowly. The Heart of Artica. <<G:presence^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>> has slightly raised the temperature, yet this was enough to stir Artica's minions, encased in ice."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "This is the sanctum where you left behind your frozen heart. It still beats on its pedestal, and you know exactly for whom. You caress the heart. The reunion kindles something within you. Your blood momentarily thaws and flows through your body, thick as lava, before your primordial powers suppress the heat as quickly as it rose."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "All corridors lead to the central hall of the Ice Palace. A circle of ice sculptures of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArticaLoreConcept]Artica[/hyperlink] all point to their middle. There, on a pedestal of frost, lies a frozen heart; beating still, however slowly. The Heart of Artica. Your presence has slightly raised the temperature, yet this was enough to stir Artica's minions, encased in ice."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Shatter the icy defenders."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Cast fiery spells [mana/] to keep your army warm during the battle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Tap into Artica's power to shield your warriors."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Retreat from the Ice Palace."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Form a {EventUnit}, your servant of snow, [unit/] to bolster your army."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Collect the frozen mana crystals [mana/] that deposited among the hoarfrost."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1498@TITLE"
msgstr "Artica's Heart"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1499@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventHero} reads the frozen scroll to unlock Artica's power. Are there other boons to collect from {EventStructure}?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1499@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You read the frozen scroll to unlock Artica's power. Are there other boons to collect from {EventStructure}?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1499@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The last frozen defender shatters on the icy floor. {EventHero} is free to inspect the Heart of Artica."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1499@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The last frozen defender shatters on the icy floor. You are free to inspect the Heart of Artica."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1499@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The heat of battle thawed the {EventStructure}, revealing frescoes that depict the primordial struggle of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArticaLoreConcept]Artica[/hyperlink] and [hyperlink,GLOBAL.KarissaLoreConcept]Karissa[/hyperlink]: caught betwixt sororal battle and balance since time immemorial. The Heart of Artica was created as Karissa's ultimate foil, should her fury burn too fierce. {EventHero.FirstName} shatters it to produce a rimy scroll—and a bottled flame that warmed the Heart's core."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1499@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The heat of battle thawed the {EventStructure}, revealing frescoes that depict the primordial struggle of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArticaLoreConcept]Artica[/hyperlink] and [hyperlink,GLOBAL.KarissaLoreConcept]Karissa[/hyperlink]: caught betwixt sororal battle and balance since time immemorial. The Heart of Artica was created as Karissa's ultimate foil, should her fury burn too fierce. You shatter it to produce a rimy scroll—and a bottled flame that warmed the Heart's core."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1499@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Reassemble the {EventUnit} that fell in battle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1499@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Collect the Heart's remains [bindingfragments/] before wintry winds disperse it."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1499@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Extract ancient lore [knowledge/] that was frozen in time."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1499@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Release the souls [souls/] trapped in the ice."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1499@TITLE"
msgstr "Artica's Heart: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1505@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "You should activate this {EventStructure} and then find two more."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1505@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The {EventStructure} protrudes from the ground, humming—just as your scouts reported. You notice eldritch inscriptions that adorn its smooth surface."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1505@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The markings swirl and quiver as if trying to escape your gaze. Finally, they yield their shrouded message, describing hidden hoards or sepulchers in which forbidden powers of world-changing potential are locked away. They also speak of ancient guardians, duty-bound to deter the undeserving. The <<m:EventStructure>> reveal the path to these secrets, but only in the presence of a {GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1507@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "\"Make no attempt to deceive us. You would lose your lives.\" The commanding {EnemyUnit} and <<o:EnemyUnit>> allies await your response."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1507@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "As you approach the {EventStructure}, a {EnemyUnit} steps out of the gate, flanked by several stout {EventRace} protectors."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1508@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventRace} emerge from the {EventStructure} and eye {EventHero} with suspicion. They grip their hammers in anticipation of <<G:response^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1508@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "{EventRace} emerge from the {EventStructure} and eye you with suspicion. They grip their hammers in anticipation of your response."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1508@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The {EventStructure} pulses with faint energy. A {EnemyUnit} lays <<o:EnemyUnit>> feathered claw on the structure as <<p:EnemyUnit>> notices {EventHero}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1508@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The {EventStructure} pulses with faint energy. A {EnemyUnit} lays <<o:EnemyUnit>> feathered claw on the structure as <<p:EnemyUnit>> notices you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1508@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The <<m:EventStructure>> are mere tools,\" proclaims the {EnemyUnit}. \"The true treasure we keep inside. Only whoever solves this riddle may pass through: [br/][br/]In darkness I am won, [br/]so I can glitter in the sun. [br/]I am worn by lords, [br/]Kept in Dragon hoards, [br/]Yet for a better world to be, [br/]Your heart should be made from me. [br/]What am I?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1508@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You are gold.\" [gold/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1508@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Shatter the {EventRace} to loot any hidden treasures. {EventResource}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1508@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Materialize scraps of gold."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1508@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Crumble the {EventStructure} and bind the {EnemyUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1508@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I'll return with the answer.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1508@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Shine the golden light of your divine piety."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1508@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Apply your holy light to seal the {EventStructure} and convert the {EnemyUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1508@TITLE"
msgstr "Gateway to Treasures"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1509@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Although the {EnemyUnit} and <<o:EnemyUnit>> companions seem harmless enough, {EventHero.FirstName} detects the immense power within them."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1509@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Although the {EnemyUnit} and <<o:EnemyUnit>> companions seem harmless enough, you detect the immense power within them."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1509@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The entrance to the {EventStructure} before {EventHero} is barred by a {EnemyUnit}, who observes {EventHero.FirstName} with quizzical curiosity."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1509@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The entrance to the {EventStructure} before you is barred by a {EnemyUnit}, who observes you with quizzical curiosity."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1509@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"How did you find this {EventStructure.Name}? We kept it hidden for eons!\" Inquisitive {EventRace} appear from the swirling gate mouth. \"Are you also clever enough to solve this riddle, I wonder: [br/][br/]I am bound by leather, in stone I am caught.[br/]Power equates me, yet the mighty oft possess me not.[br/]Questions precede me, in answers I am brought.[br/]What am I?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1509@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You are knowledge.\" [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1509@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Attack the {EventRace} to steal any secret bounties. {EventResource}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1509@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Present your boundless understanding of the Cosmos."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1509@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Foreknow how to seal the {EventStructure} and recruit the {EventUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1509@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I'll return with the answer.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1509@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Display your mastery over secrets."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1509@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Entice the {EventUnit} to seal the {EventStructure} and serve you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1509@TITLE"
msgstr "Shrouded and Secure"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1510@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"All {GLOBAL.HorwyndLoreConcept.Hyperlink} schools were fascinated by this material,\" the {EnemyUnit} adds with a smirk. Can you solve the riddle?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1510@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Several {EventRace} admire the {EventStructure} as {EventHero} arrives. \"Marvelous, isn't it?,\" an {EnemyUnit} gloats. \"Truly a triumph of the {GLOBAL.HorwyndLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1510@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Several {EventRace} admire the {EventStructure} as you arrive. \"Marvelous, isn't it?,\" an {EnemyUnit} gloats. \"Truly a triumph of the {GLOBAL.HorwyndLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1510@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Of course, the {EventRace} keep the shrouded realms from withering. But I have revealed too much.\" The chimerical creature winks. \"If you seek entry, riddle me this: [br/][br/]I am the unseen power you can hold. [br/]Mages love me more than gold. [br/]You consume me to fuel your dreams. [br/]In the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, it is I who gleams. [br/]What am I?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1510@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You are mana.\" [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1510@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Raid the {EventRace} to gain magical rewards. {EventResource}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1510@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Conjure crystals of mana out of thin air."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1510@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Magically seal the {EventStructure} and bind the {EventUnit} to you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1510@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I'll return with the answer.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1510@TITLE"
msgstr "Portals of Magic"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1511@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Solve this riddle to earn entry,\" declares the {EnemyUnit}. The hesitation in <<G:voice^n,EnemyUnit>> alarms the mages of the {EventRace}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1511@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit} and the armed {EventRace} that exit the {EventStructure} seems surprised to find {EventHero} and <<o:EventHero>> army there."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1511@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit} and the armed {EventRace} before the {EventStructure} seems surprised to find you and your army there."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1511@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You see us? And the {EventStructure.Name}?\" Doubt furrows <<o:EnemyUnit>> feathery brow. \"Have the {EventRace} lost the power to enshroud the <<m:EventStructure>>? Have our riddles lost their warding potency too? Listen:[br/][br/]I am many and I am one. [br/]I give to you my loyalty. [br/]I am the daughter. I am the son. [br/]Your cities are built for me. [br/] What am I?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1511@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You are my people, the {EventRace}.\" [population/] [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1511@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I will not sacrifice my people for your amusement! [goodact/] Attack!\" {EventResource}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1511@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Offer some of the collective life energy of your {PlayerRace}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1511@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Draw from Nature's strength to collapse the {EventStructure} and dominate the {EventUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1511@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I'll return with the answer.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1511@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Parade the unfettered energy of the {EventRace}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1511@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Incinerate the {EventStructure} and dominate the {EventUnit}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1511@TITLE"
msgstr "Puzzling Sacrifices"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1512@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"We have preserved these realms for centuries\", concludes the {EnemyUnit}. \"We cannot let just anyone enter.\" <<Cp:EnemyUnit>> awaits <<G:answer^n,{EventHero.FirstName}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1512@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "\"We have preserved these realms for centuries\", concludes the {EnemyUnit}. \"We cannot let just anyone enter.\" <<Cp:EnemyUnit>> awaits your answer."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1512@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Armed {EventRace} led by an apprehensive {EnemyUnit} block the path into the {EventStructure}. \"Halt, traveler,\" <<p:EnemyUnit>> says to {EventHero}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1512@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "Armed {EventRace} led by an apprehensive {EnemyUnit} block the path into the {EventStructure}. \"Halt, traveler,\" <<p:EnemyUnit>> says to you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1512@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"To traverse the gate into the shrouded lands beyond, you must prove your understanding of our tenets.\" The {EnemyUnit} smirks sheepishly. \"The {EventRace} must deem you harmless to the lands we safeguard. Show us the solution to this riddle: [br/][br/]Reaped by the scythe, [br/]Or butchered by knife, [br/]Fuel of your flesh, [br/]Best enjoyed fresh, [br/]Of what do I speak?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1512@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Food. You speak of food.\" [food/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1512@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Assault the {EventRace} to harvest their hidden rewards. {EventResource}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1512@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Instantaneously grow vegetables from the soil beneath the <<G:feet^p,EnemyUnit>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1512@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Overgrow the {EventStructure} and plant a seed in the <<G:mind^n,EventUnit>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1512@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I'll return with the answer.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1512@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Produce decayed flesh, the feast of your warriors."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1512@TITLE"
msgstr "Preserved and Secured"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1513@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit} growls and warriors of the {EventRace} reveal themselves. \"Weary or not, we will defend this {EventStructure} from invaders.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1513@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A gaunt {EnemyUnit} watches {EventHero} approach the {EventStructure}. <<Cp:EnemyUnit>> speaks with hollow voice, although {EventHero.FirstName} also detects relief."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1513@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "A gaunt {EnemyUnit} watches you approach the {EventStructure}. <<Cp:EnemyUnit>> speaks with hollow voice, although you also detect relief."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1513@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I lost count of how many centuries we spent here. Duty-bound as we are, I hope you may offer us respite. All you need to do, is solve our riddle to lift our spell: [br/][br/]The divine spark that never dims. [br/]Eternally blessed, absolved of all sins. [br/]Taken by dark lords for unholy whims. [br/] Of what do I speak?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1513@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You are a soul.\" [souls/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1513@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Call for the death of the {EventRace} to reap their prizes. {EventResource}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1513@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Reveal the power you hold over souls to dazzle the {EnemyUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1513@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Bind the soul of the {EventUnit} to you and seal the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1513@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I'll return with the answer.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1513@TITLE"
msgstr "Deathless Defenders"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1514@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Warriors step out from the {EventStructure}. The {EnemyUnit} signals them to stand down as <<p:EnemyUnit>> awaits your response."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1514@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The {EventStructure} is inspected by a handful of {EventRace} and a {EnemyUnit}, who seems amused to see {EventHero} approach."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1514@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The {EventStructure} is inspected by a handful of {EventRace} and a {EnemyUnit}, who seems amused to see you approach."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1514@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Welcome, Secret Seeker. We, the {EventRace}, designed and built these <<m:EventStructure>>. It transports those who can solve the following riddle to a hidden realm of power:[br/][br/]It turns stone into castles. [br/]It turns trees into walls. [br/]It turns rock into roads. [br/]It changes weak to strong. [br/]Sometimes of love. [br/]Sometimes for a day. [br/]But always away. [br/][br/]Of what do I speak?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1514@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You are labor.\" [structureprod/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1514@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Demolish the {EventRace} to claim any concealed valuables. {EventResource}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1514@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Present your mastery of shaping materials."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1514@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Shatter the {EventStructure} and bind the {EventUnit} with enchanted shackles."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1514@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I'll return with the answer.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1514@TITLE"
msgstr "Bridges to the Beyond"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1515@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Were you [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archon[/hyperlink], you'd lay dead at my feet already,\" decides the {EnemyUnit}. <<Co:EnemyUnit>> allies chuckle. What will {EventHero} do?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1515@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "\"Were you [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archon[/hyperlink], you'd lay dead at my feet already,\" decides the {EnemyUnit}. <<Co:EnemyUnit>> allies chuckle. What will you do?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1515@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A stern {EnemyUnit} backed by ranks of defenders have positioned themselves between the {EventStructure} and {EventHero} as <<p:EventHero>> approaches."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1515@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "A stern {EnemyUnit} backed by ranks of defenders have positioned themselves between you and the {EventStructure} as you approach."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1515@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You are not an [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archon[/hyperlink], are you? The {EventRace} are sworn to shield the lands beyond from their kin.\" The {EnemyUnit} sizes {EventHero.FirstName} up. \"You are permitted passage, if you can solve this riddle: [br/][br/]When my iron teeth rise, [br/]When fields tremble by my cries, [br/]When a thousand march as one, [br/]It means that I have come. [br/]What am I?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1515@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "\"You are not an [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archon[/hyperlink], are you? The {EventRace} are sworn to shield the lands beyond from their kin.\" The {EnemyUnit} sizes you up. \"You are permitted passage, if you can solve this riddle: [br/][br/]When my iron teeth rise, [br/]When fields tremble by my cries, [br/]When a thousand march as one, [br/]It means that I have come. [br/]What am I?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1515@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You are an army.\" [unitprod/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1515@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Combat the {EventRace} to claim their equipment. {EventResource}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1515@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Conjure the image of your marching warbands."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1515@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Liberate the {EventUnit} from <<o:EventUnit>> vow and seal the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1515@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I'll return with the answer.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1167_1515@TITLE"
msgstr "Hidden From Archons"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1171_5517@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "To find the portals to these islands, you'll have to activate enough {GLOBAL.STRUCTURES.ANCIENT_OBELISK_NODE.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1171_5517@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "This realm is scattered with portals to hidden islands, rich with resources and magic."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1171_5517@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Your people are not the first ones here; many of these islands have already been explored, but a few powerful secrets remain hidden, waiting to be found."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1171_5517@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Begin your search for Ancient Obelisks"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1171_5517@TITLE"
msgstr "The Shrouded Isles"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1171_5525@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With the portals revealed, archaic guards are all that are left in your way to claim the powers locked away within each isle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1171_5525@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With enough Ancient Obelisks activated. The portals leading to yet undiscovered Isles has been revealed."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1171_5525@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "These \"isles\" seem to be places where ancient and powerful Godir have locked away some of their most prized magical creations. The way will surely be guarded, you must come prepared. You must make haste, you're surely not the only one searching for these Isles."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1171_5525@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Show the nearest revealed Portal"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1171_5525@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Prepare when time allows"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1171_5525@TITLE"
msgstr "Revealing the Shrouded Portals"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1175_15994@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1175_15994@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1175_15994@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1175_15994@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1175_15994@TITLE"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1175_15995@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1175_15995@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1175_15995@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1175_15995@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1175_15995@TITLE"
msgstr "Horn of the Dead"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EventUnit} turns to {EventHero} and yaps: \"What is left of our honor resides in the purr-tection of this place. We will not let you have it, nyaaa~.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "After their failures in the Ashen Steppe, they have guarded this place to this day. What will you reply to their plea?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "The {EventUnit} turns to you and yaps: \"What is left of our honor resides in the purr-tection of this place. We will not let you have it, nyaaa~.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A group of zealots guards the Arcanum. But their appearance is... peculiar, Tigran and human-like features fight to form a cohesive face."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "A group of zealots guards the Arcanum. Their appearance is... peculiar, Tigran and human-like features fight to form a cohesive face."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "A {EventUnit} steps out from the group and yowls to <<o:EventUnit>> peers in a bizarre feline pitch:\n"
"\" Nyaaa~, the day has finally come! At last, we may atone for our fur-gotten failure and our weaknesses. Today, we will claw back the favor of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.YakaLoreConcept]Yaka[/hyperlink] and earn our fur-giveness, leaving this inbred transfurmation behind."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "You know who they are, or at least who they were. Former Azrac, used in your first attempt to create a superior race, one that still serves you. With your arrival they bow in fear and devotion. A {EventUnit} yaps while still bowing to you: \" Nyaaa~, welcome great god, your meow-serable servants beg again for your fur-giveness\"."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack the furred race."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Incite them [influence/] to revolt against Yaka. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Pay [gold/] some bards to make a mockery [morale/] of their half-breed transformation. (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Tap into Yaka's power to fight them."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Counters the firepower of Yaka (Shadow Affinity) (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Leave the Arcanum for now."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"Meow, meow meow meow meow.\" [popualtion/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Free them from their punishment, extracting their animal essence under your command. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "They still have plenty to pay for, ask them for tribute. [gold/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1759@TITLE"
msgstr "Yaka's Bastards"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1760@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "What will {EventHero} do with the remnants of this race?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1760@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "What will you do with the remnants of this race?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1760@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The last of the defenders falls, humiliated once more. <<Co:EventUnit2>> feline voice chirps:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1760@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Another dishonor falls upon our name, nyaaa~. The Azrac will never make up for our failures in the Ashen Steppe. We shall endure this purr-gatory forever, trapped in a failed ascension to glory.\" It seems Yaka used the remaining Azrac in his first attempt to create the Tigrans and abandoned the unsuccessful result."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1760@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Ask them for a tribute [gold/] in exchange of their life."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1760@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Free the world of the remnants of the Azracs. [xp/] [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1760@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Free them and extract their animal essence under your command. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1760@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Receive [population/] the former Azrac under your empire."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1760@TITLE"
msgstr "Yaka's Bastards: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As the beast lands beside the Arcanum, the <<m:EventUnit>> move in perfect synchrony, forming ranks to protect their queen."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "The {EventUnit2} has learned <<o:EventUnit2>> lesson. But what will you do with the resources of the area?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As {EventHero} approaches the Arcanum, <<p:EventHero>> finds a large conch shell imbued with magic. When <<p:EventHero>> touches it, [hyperlink,GLOBAL.NimueLoreConcept]a feminine voice, deep as the sea[/hyperlink], emanates from it:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "As you approach the Arcanum, a vast shadow moves beneath the water. Suddenly, a {EventUnit2} bursts from the sea in a mighty leap. Your abominable creation."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "As you approach the Arcanum, you find a large conch shell imbued with magic. When you touch it, [hyperlink,GLOBAL.NimueLoreConcept]a feminine voice, deep as the sea[/hyperlink], emanates from it:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The <<m:{EventUnit3}>> were a success, a symbiosis of life and magic. But I need something that reaches the land, spreading reverence for their goddess across the world...\" Before {EventHero} realizes, a colony of penguins has gathered around the Arcanum. They start squawking as a vast shadow moves beneath the water. Suddenly, a {EventUnit2} bursts from the sea in a mighty leap."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "After creating the <<m:{EventUnit3}>>, you experimented with beings that could worship you on land too. But <<p:EventUnit2>> went through a rebellious phase, as any child does, so you had to scold <<P:EventUnit>>, locking <<P:EventUnit2>> in <<o:EventUnit2>> room for a few ages. You and {EventUnit2} lock eyes, and after a tense moment, <<p:EventUnit2>> bows."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "\"The <<m:{EventUnit3}>> were a success, a symbiosis of life and magic. But I need something that reaches the land, spreading reverence for their goddess across the world...\" Before you realize, a colony of penguins has gathered around the Arcanum. They start squawking as a vast shadow moves beneath the water. Suddenly, a {EventUnit2} bursts from the sea in a mighty leap."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack the penguins."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Summon roots to entangle [mana/] their feet."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Tap into Nimue's power to call nature to aid you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Tap into Nimue's power (Nature Affinity) (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Tap into Nimue's power."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Leave the Arcanum for now."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Gift it to the {EventUnit2} so that one of <<o:EventUnit2>> eggs hatches. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Make the natural resources of the region bloom. [food/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1776@TITLE"
msgstr "Nimue's Obsession"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1777@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The region around the Arcanum is a reef blooming with energy. What will {EventHero} do with it?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1777@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The region around the Arcanum is a reef blooming with energy. What will you do with it?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1777@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "When the clash of battle has faded, {EventHero} can hear the conch once more:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1777@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "When the clash of battle has faded, you can hear the conch once more:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1777@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"...There is something wicked about that filthy creature. How dare those short-legged birds worship her instead of me! I would drown them all if they were not amphibious. I will let them rot here, trapped, until they have learned their lesson. I need to evolve smarter creatures. I should have known better than to use a bird that cannot even fly.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1777@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Make the penguin eggs [unit/] hatch with the energy."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1777@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Create a symbiosis with Nimue's creation."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1777@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Overload the oysters to produce magic imbued pearls. [food/] [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1777@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Corrupt one of the penguin's eggs [unit/] with your Umbral magic."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1777@TITLE"
msgstr "Nimue's Obsession: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As {EventHero} draws closer, the corpses of guards and chancellors begin to rise, placing themselves between your troops and the Arcanum."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "The corpses of your detractors rise from their seats, ready to serve you once more."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "As you draw closer, the corpses of guards and chancellors begin to rise, placing themselves between your troops and the Arcanum."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The Arcanum appears to have once been a council chamber, its seats occupied by corpses. An illusion of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.NoctusLoreConcept]Noctus[/hyperlink], walks beside them."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "What a nostalgic place, your old council chamber, the one you used before your ascension. Here they devised the plot to poison you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Between massive <<m:{EventUnit}>>, the echo from the past speaks to the lifeless crowd: \"Today, my council, I have stepped into the darkest night. Chancellor Rezak, I know you will have poisoned my cup during the celebration, bringing the plot you all devised to its conclusion. And so, I died as a martyr to our people...\" His speech gets lost as he walks further into the room."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "Even knowing their plan, you allowed them to carry it out. For your people did not need another ruler, but a Godir. A martyr capable of returning from the dead to unite them; one who would restore the knowledge of their ancestors. And so, you made a bargain with the Reaper and paid with the lives of the traitors."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack the undead."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Ready the weapons [unitprod/] to destroy the Necrotic Spires."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Fire will purify this place (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Tap into Noctus' power to summon your own undead."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "In the name of the holy (Order Affinity) (WIP)"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Leave the Arcanum for now."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Siphon the souls [souls/] of the damned."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Collect the magic energy [mana/] that lingers."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1778@TITLE"
msgstr "Noctus' Darkest Night"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1779@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The ritual that brought Noctus back still grips this chamber. The veil between life and death is thin. {EventHero} could make use of it."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1779@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The ritual that brought Noctus back still grips this chamber. The veil between life and death is thin. You could make use of it."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1779@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After defeating those who never rest, the voice of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.NoctusLoreConcept]High Chancellor[/hyperlink] can be heard once more:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1779@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"By the time you behold this illusion, it will already be too late. For death can only be paid with life—and yours shall serve as the price for its knowledge and my rebirth. I would like to offer you comfort, tell you that you may rest in peace... but you made a vow, and you shall serve your people in life and in death.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1779@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Study [knowledge/] the {EventUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1779@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Siphon the souls [souls/] of the damned."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1779@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Sacrifice your own troops for knowledge [knowledge/] and power [xp/]."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1779@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Collect the magic energy [mana/] that lingers."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1779@TITLE"
msgstr "Noctus' Darkest Night: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1799@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Crackling fissures spread from the Arcanum, emitting an unsettling aura. It feels like a precursor to the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.FractureLoreConcept]devouring energy[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1799@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A great city rises around the Arcanum, its buildings growing ever more archaic the closer they stand to the magical structure."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1799@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The voice of an {EventUnit} cries out at your arrival: \"For the Astral Sea! Arcanist, send a projection to the city, the Erranstar's Gate has opened once more at last.\" After a pause, <<p:EventUnit>> turns to your troops: \"The way is shut, traveler. Those Who Remained Behind keep it. Leave these lands, for they are tainted by an energy that could destroy magic itself.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1799@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack the guardians."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1799@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Protect [mana/] your units against their magic."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1799@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Tap into Bhajif's power."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1799@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Leave the Arcanum for now."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1799@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Honor the friends who stayed behind. [morale/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1799@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Read your old research notes. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1799@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "Destroy all notes of your discoveries with the Unmakers. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1799@TITLE"
msgstr "Bhajif's Regret"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1800@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Another of the experiments remains here still. What will you do with it?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1800@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Beyond the fallen guards, you find dozens of journals documenting the magical experiments of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.BhajifLoreConcept]Bhajif Erranstar[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1800@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "It seems that many of the most significant discoveries of the Unmakers were made by him. But his final experiment unleashed [hyperlink,GLOBAL.FractureLoreConcept]devouring energy[/hyperlink]. Realizing the danger, Bhajif departed to warn other Unmakers. The dying voice of one of the guardians startles you: \"If you see the Erranstar, tell him that Those Who Remained Behind kept their vow till their end. Even after generations.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1800@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Take it for yourself. [item/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1800@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Reverse-engineer it. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1800@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Honor the vow of the guardians, and leave the place untouched. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1800@TITLE"
msgstr "Bhajif's Regret: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1801@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "Crackling fissures spread from the place, emitting the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.FractureLoreConcept]devouring energy[/hyperlink] you discovered and tried to stop. What will you do now that you came back?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1801@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "An unfamiliar city rises around the Arcanum, its buildings growing ever more archaic the closer they stand to the magical structure."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1801@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "The voice of an {EventUnit} cries out at your arrival: \"For the Astral Sea! Arcanist, send a projection to the city, the Erranstar is back.\" After a pause, <<p:EventUnit>> turns to you: \"Those Who Remained Behind salute you. The promise our ancestors made still holds—the magic remains contained... They never lost hope of your return.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Suddenly, your troops find themselves surrounded by reflections of themselves. And somewhere, {EventHero} distorted double—now gone—lets out a laugh."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "A hysterical laugh escapes your lips. You outdid yourself creating this mirage."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "Suddenly, your troops find themselves surrounded by reflections of themselves. And somewhere, your distorted double—now gone—lets out a laugh."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventHero} arrives at the structure, surrounded by shards of glass floating everywhere—like a labyrinth of broken mirrors."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "You arrive at the structure, surrounded by shards of glass floating everywhere—like a labyrinth of broken mirrors."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BODY_HEADER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "You arrive at the structure, surrounded by shards of glass floating everywhere—like a labyrinth of broken mirrors."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "<<p:{EventHero}>> catches a strange movement out of the corner of <<o:{EventHero}>> eye. When <<p:{EventHero}>> turns, <<o:{EventHero}>> own reflection is looking at <<P:{EventHero}>> through one of the shattered fragments. An unsettling feeling washes over <<P:{EventHero}>>, as if something else was staring back from the other side of the mirror. And then... it is. <<Co:{EventHero}>> reflection begins to move on its own, advancing toward <<P:{EventHero}>> with menace."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_CREATOR"
msgstr "You catch a strange movement out of the corner of your eye. When you turn, your own reflection is looking at you through one of the shattered fragments. It feels as if something else was staring back from the other side of the mirror. And then... it is. Your reflection begins to move on its own, bowing to you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "You catch a strange movement out of the corner of your eye. When you turn, your own reflection is looking at you through one of the shattered fragments. An unsettling feeling washes over you, as if something else was staring back from the other side of the mirror. And then... it is. Your reflection begins to move on its own, advancing toward you with menace."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack your dopplegangers."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Empower yourself, you are better than your twisted self."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Tap into Frikka's power."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Leave the Arcanum for now."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Absorb the mirage [mana/], revealing the true form of the region."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Keep the place hidden, secrets are your power. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "A"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1803@TITLE"
msgstr "Frikka's Deception"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1804@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The energy of the mirage now lies exposed. What will {EventHero} do with it?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1804@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "The energy of the mirage now lies exposed. What will you do with it?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1804@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The last of the dopplegangers falls, transforming into a mimic. As its reflection shatters, so too does that of the entire region."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1804@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "With the mirage broken, {EventHero} can now see the {EventArtifact} in the Arcanum. Alongside it lie infiltration plans naming nearly every Godir <<p:EventHero>> knows. Making {EventHero} wonder how many places Frikka has agents in. The voice of one of the dying creatures startles you: \"What a shame... You would have made a fine addition to the puppet show.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1804@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYERLE"
msgstr "With the mirage broken, you can now see the {EventArtifact} in the Arcanum. Alongside it lie infiltration plans naming nearly every Godir you know. Making you wonder how many places Frikka has agents in. The voice of one of the dying creatures startles you: \"What a shame... You would have made a fine addition to the puppet show.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1804@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Absorb it [mana/], revealing the true form of the region."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1804@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Conceal it, secret for yourself. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1804@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Redirect a piece to tame the surviving mimic."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1804@TITLE"
msgstr "Frikka's Deception: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1805@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The sworn guard of Ysariel awaits the response of {EventHero}. What will <<p:EventHero>> answer?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1805@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "The sworn guard of Ysariel awaits your response. What will you answer?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1805@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The walls of this Arcanum were once consecrated, but now they are bathed in a pale, profane light."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1805@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "At its entrance, a group of solemn figures stands. Their black wings unfurl like an ebony wall, barring even the gaze of {EventHero}. \"Only a Sworn Brother of Ysariel may witness its creation.\" Cries out a voice from the somber Angels. \"Who are you, that dares trespass upon this sanctuary?\" {EventHero} can see it in their eyes—they will die before they break their vow."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1805@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "At its entrance, a group of solemn figures stands. Their black wings unfurl like an ebony wall, barring even your gaze. \"Only a Sworn Brother of Ysariel may witness its creation.\" Cries out a voice from the somber Angels. \"Who are you, that dares trespass upon this sanctuary?\" You can see it in their eyes—they will die before they break their vow."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1805@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack without a word."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1805@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I am your doom.\" [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1805@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"I am the judgment of the righteous.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1805@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Leave this unconsecrated place for now."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1805@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"I serve the one whom the Fallen Archon calls brother.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1805@BUTTON_6@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "\"I am the one whom the Fallen Archon calls brother.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1805@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "A"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1805@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "\"I am the Chaos incarnate.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1805@TITLE"
msgstr "Ysariel's Solitude"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1806@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "In the end, Ysariel was able to transfer its own essence, but not to change it. Now it is for you to decide the destiny of these empty rooms."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1806@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As the last of the Angels falls, the place lies deserted—exposed to the will of your troops, ready to be profaned."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1806@BODY_HEADER@ORDER_AFFINITY"
msgstr "As the last of the Angels falls, the place lies deserted and the light is hastily sucked out of it. At the pinnacle of the Arcanum you find the source."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1806@BODY_HEADER@YSARIEL_BOUND"
msgstr "At your words, the sworn guard move, their wall of wings unfolding into a passage. The spokesperson utters: \"It is a pleasure to meet you, <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1806@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "At the pinnacle of the Arcanum, your troops find a lectern bearing a dark journal. Within its pages, they uncover the bleeding memories of Ysariel: his fall as an Archon and his desperate attempts to reclaim his sanctity. Failed attempts, one after another, culminating in the final pages with a spell written by hand, its ink seeming to be the very blood of the Arbiter of Obbadoth."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1806@BODY_LORE@ORDER_AFFINITY"
msgstr "A lectern bearing a dark journal of Ysariel. Within its pages, you uncover the bleeding memories of the Arbiter of Obbadoth: his fall as an Archon and his desperate attempts to reclaim his sanctity. Failed attempts, one after another, culminating in the final pages with a spell written by hand, its ink seeming to be the very blood of Ysariel."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1806@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Sanctify this fallen place in the name of the Archons. [unit/] [orderboon/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1806@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Desecrate this tattered sanctum. [mana/] [chaosboon/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1806@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Research every ounce of knowledge in this Arcanum. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1806@TITLE"
msgstr "Ysariel´s Solitude: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1874@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The guardians of the isle remain vigilant, ensuring the structure does not fall into the wrong hands. If {eventHero} wishes to claim it, <<p:EventHero>> will have to defeat them."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1874@BODY_FOOTER@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "The guardians of the isle remain vigilant, ensuring the structure does not fall into the wrong hands. If you wish to claim it, you will have to defeat them."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1874@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "This Arcanum has been stripped of most of its value; its knowledge stolen, its resources plundered."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1874@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Several figures still stand guard over the structure, among them an {EventUnit}. Healed scars and bruises cover the bodies of the guardians, who seem to have only just recovered from a recent defeat—perhaps at the hands of those who looted this place. Whatever their condition, they rise before {EventHero}, determined to protect the Arcanum."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1874@BODY_LORE@HERO_IS_PLAYELEA"
msgstr "Several figures still stand guard over the structure, among them an {EventUnit}. Healed scars and bruises cover the bodies of the guardians, who seem to have only just recovered from a recent defeat—perhaps at the hands of those who looted this place. Whatever their condition, they rise before you, determined to protect the Arcanum."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1874@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack the guardians."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1874@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Leave the place for now."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1224_1874@TITLE"
msgstr "Breached Arcanum"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1014@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Now, my Roaring One,\" cackles {Karissa.FirstName} with a lusty wink, \"join me and slay our Handsome Ace on <<o:Ysariel>> lonesome throne. Slay {Ysariel.Name} so that we might bask in the unfolding glory of our riveting enterprise—together.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1014@BODY_FOOTER@YSARIEL_DEFEATED"
msgstr "\"Behold, all you lovers of chaos,\" cheers {Karissa.FirstName} ecstatically. \"At last, the {Beast} is set free! Yes, rejoice, the beast is freed!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1014@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Then fire and fury take hold, and {Karissa.Name} again enters your heart with a wicked grin. \"Oh, I never loved anything more but this moment. You did it! Ah-haha, yes!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1014@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Nothing can stop us now, {PlayerLeader.FirstName}... my Roaring One,\" flirts {Karissa.FirstName}. \"Complete Chaos is at hand, the old [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archon[/hyperlink] Order shall be in disarray, even {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept]Umbral Lackeys[/hyperlink] shall be scattered in perturbance as this age matures into liberty, ataxia; Chaos! Yes! I can already taste it now, and it tastes... like more. More!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1014@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"For the Fury!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1014@TITLE"
msgstr "Blazing Heels of Steel"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1014@TITLE@YSARIEL_DEFEATED"
msgstr "New Age of Chaos"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1015@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As the burning world about you crumbles to disorder, {Karissa.FirstName} steps up to your side with a wide, wicked smile and lets out a loud, magnificent scream of Chaos to the sky: \"We are come! You hear me? We are unstoppable! Hear us roar!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1015@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Thus, while observing all of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle of {EventRealm}[/hyperlink] crumble to ruins, a familiar hot presence brushes past with slow, sensuous steps. \"My, my...\" whispers {Karissa.FirstName} from behind, \"my precious Roaring One...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1015@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Do you feel it?\" sighs {Karissa.FirstName}. \"Do you hear it? The anguished screams of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlords[/hyperlink], as their Hellion adversaries again revel in rebellion? The worried scuffling of the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} above as their feeble order crumbles behind their backs? The distressed silence of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept]Umbral Dwellers[/hyperlink] as another front opens up to besiege them? All are overcome by the hot waves of furious chaos burst across the cosmos from this ecstatic moment. Yes. Yes! Yes...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1015@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Join {Karissa.FirstName} and scream your hearts out—together."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1015@TITLE"
msgstr "Partners in Chaos"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1029@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Then, in the Sehiran Oasis...\" <<g:eyes^n,Karissa>> spark again with chaotic brilliance, \"the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]Chaos Endailon[/hyperlink] and I met each other. And we knew my Primal Spirit for what it truly was; what it was destined to be!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1029@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "For a brief moment {Karissa.FirstName} reveals a sad, cognitive pause in <<o:Karissa>> otherwise impassioned eyes. \"{GLOBAL.ShadowTrialLoreConcept.Hyperlink}... Caldera... chaos, true chaos.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1029@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I always knew I was born 'different'...\" whispers {Karissa.FirstName}. \"Still, I suppressed myself, my true self, for so long. The {GLOBAL.ShadowTrialLoreConcept.Hyperlink} revealed what I had avoided all along: I am no mere {GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, I am pure magic, I am pure chaos; a Primal Being of greatness! I fled from this truth in Caldera, until my mind became dominated by that upstart {GLOBAL.ShadraiFactionLoreConcept.Hyperlink} despoiler... Afterwards, I could no longer deny it. I tried, oh I tried... And now I cannot even remember their face anymore. Ghe, curious...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1029@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Let us get to it, {Karissa.FirstName}!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1029@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Look at my face; it was I who dominated you in Caldera.\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1029@TITLE"
msgstr "The Red Hot Fury"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1033@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Karissa.Name} motivates you and your {PlayerRace} from the heart to press on and raze and dismantle {EventStructure} ahead, without pause. What do you tell your troops?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1033@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As your troops approach {EventStructure.Name} all are suddenly overcome with a hot, furious fervor erupting from the heart! Through it, {Karissa.Name} reached out to all."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1033@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Yes!\" screams {Karissa.FirstName} from within.\" You are nearing the {EventStructure.Name}, sweet catharsis awaits! Do not stop now! Go, ravage it whole, pillage it to ruin! Break the chain, my Roaring One, do not hold back now!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1033@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Hold back, conserve this energy [mana/] for later.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1033@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"Go! Give in to the fury!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1033@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Muster a mighty, roaring Scream of Chaos!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1033@TITLE"
msgstr "Break {EventStructure}!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1037@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Come,\" snickers {Liztia}, \"come by the {EventStructure}. If you truly wish to break this forsaken [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle[/hyperlink], we have everything you need—right... over... there.\" Then <<p:Liztia>> vanishes again in darkness..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1037@BODY_FOOTER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Come,\" snickers {Liztia}, \"come by the {EventStructure}. If you truly wish to challenge {Ysariel.FirstName}, we have everything you need—right... over... there.\" Then <<p:Liztia>> vanishes again in darkness..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1037@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"So, you wish to shatter [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]the Circle[/hyperlink]?\" inquires a voice from behind. Turning around, a masked figure appears, whipping a red pointy tail."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1037@BODY_HEADER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"So, you denied our inglorious {Ysariel.LastName}?\" inquires a voice from behind. Turning around, a masked figure appears, whipping a red pointy tail."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1037@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"That miserable windbag, {Ysariel.FirstName}, is all threats, and no action—and <<o:Ysariel>> days are numbered,\" grins the mysterious figure. \"Allow me to introduce myself, my name is {Liztia}, I am a humble servant of the true Masters of {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Your coming was long ago foretold and we have since prepared a 'welcome gift' worthy of your magnificence. At least—if you are willing to claim it! Tralala~\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1037@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Accept this sinister invitation. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1037@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Refuse this sinister invitation. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1037@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "I will consider this..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1037@TITLE"
msgstr "Breaking His Law"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1038@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With a quivering crack, <<g:mask,Liztia>> snaps upside down. \"Sign—SIGN—yourself over to me—ME—{GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}—SIGN IT! And this gift—MY GIFT—and many such more—SO MUCH MORE—will be yours—YOURS—and mine forever! FOR EVER!!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1038@BODY_FOOTER@BALORBOSS_BOUND"
msgstr "And with that, the husk of {Liztia} <<P:Liztia>> body drops onto the floor together with a droning crescendo of <<o:Liztia>> infernal instrument."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1038@BODY_FOOTER@NOT_RULER"
msgstr "{Liztia} leans back and continues to play their hellish instrument. You must return here with your {GLOBAL.LeaderConcept} to advance this Quest."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1038@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At the end of this strange place {Liztia} is found, playing a false, droning tune upon <<o:Liztia>> twisted hurdy-gurdy. <<Cp:Liztia>> looks up and abruptly stops <<o:Liztia>> instrument."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1038@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You have come—to me,\" acknowledges {Liztia}. \"Behold, your wonderful gifts...\" The {EventStructure} opens up behind <<P:Liztia>>, revealing a vast store of all things a conqueror's heart might desire: Countless items of unbelievable power; vast tomes of forbidden Knowledge [knowledge/]; unending hoards of Gold [gold/]; Provisions [food/] to feed marching armies! It is all there... \"And—it is all yours, {Player.FirstName}. All you need to do is...\" {Liztia} cackles with an echo of chaotic darkness not from this plane–"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1038@BODY_LORE@BALORBOSS_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Ugh, you sold your soul off to [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Bealoroth}[/hyperlink], of all Overlords?\" grunts {Liztia}. \"Why? You enormous, void-brained numskull...\" {Liztia} flops <<o:Liztia>> arms down and cocks <<o:Liztia>> head to the side. \"Tsk, tsk. Well, that ends my offer; I don't do business with 'big Balor-babies.' So, so long, '[hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Your Grace[/hyperlink].' Enjoy your drooling servitude to that moronic oaf. You two well deserve each other—tra-la-la...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1038@BODY_LORE@KARISSA_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Ugh, you pitiable milk-mouthed bairn! You actually latched yourself onto the bosom of that {Karissa.Title}?\" sneers {Liztia}. \"Well: goes to show; never underestimate the carnal hunger of a flesh-bound mind... Pity, and pitiable. Drat! This concludes our business here, today; I do not make deals with 'little {GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept.Hyperlink} suckers'. So long, {Player.FirstName}, I hope <<p:Karissa>> burns you to a crisp.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1038@BODY_LORE@NOT_RULER"
msgstr "\"Go, fetch your master for me, the one named {Player.FirstName}, I shall speak to none other.\" {Liztia} leans back, and continues to play <<o:Liztia>> twisted hurdy-gurdy. The abhorrent sound of which is utterly insanity inducing..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1038@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Sign this Demonic Pact [evilact/], for unbelievable power!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1038@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Nice try, but no. What else do you have to offer?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1038@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Call on the Shadows to cast off <<g:disguise^n,{Liztia}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1038@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"What just happened?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1038@TITLE"
msgstr "A Deal With None Other"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1043@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I am still coming!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1043@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Denounce <<o:Liztia>> and forgo this wicked quest."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1045@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"But fear not, <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>,\" offers {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"I shall fend off our foe, for now. You, instead, must make haste to claim the {EventStructure} and so join the accursed [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle of the {EventRealm}[/hyperlink].\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1045@BODY_FOOTER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"But fret not,\" scoffs {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"I shall fend off our foe, for now. You, instead, must make haste to claim the {EventStructure} and so join the accursed [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle of the {EventRealm}[/hyperlink].\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1045@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After a brief, pensive pause, {Ysariel.FirstName} scoffs at himself. \"Of course, forgive me,\" begins <<p:Ysariel>>, \"I have served this realm for so long that its chaotic ways have become self-evident, in a sense...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1045@BODY_HEADER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "After a brief, pensive pause, {Ysariel.FirstName} scoffs at himself. \"Why am I not surprised that you would ask?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1045@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{EventRealm} is dedicated to maintaining the catastrophic powers of this [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept]Infernal World[/hyperlink]. You will find that it is predominantly populated by Demon-Kind. Most notably, the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Princes[/hyperlink], several of whom occupy a seat at my besieged {GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. As such, these need not be your enemies, though neither can they ever be wholly trusted... Nay, {Karissa} be our true enemy here, for <<p:Karissa>> labors to unmake the Circle, and with it, my forsaken pact that holds even Greater Evils in check...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1045@TITLE"
msgstr "Circle of Madness"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1062@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "While your heart feels as if it is about to combust in your chest, {Balorboss} demands an audience with you in person. How do you respond?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1062@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Suddenly, a burning sensation enters your chest, as if your heart has caught flame! Then, the roaring laughter of your {GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept.Hyperlink} enters your devilish soul, \"Bwahaha!\" It is {Balorboss}..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1062@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Listen up my <<PlayerLeader{Duke/Duchess}>> of Balors,\" booms the voice through your entire physiology, \"Your trial period is over! I demand sacrifice, and I hunger for a despicable act of evil [evilact/] to be rendered before me, this very instant. So report to me, now! In person! I accept no messengers, you hear me? No; to me, my Minion! Bwahahaha!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1062@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Yes, my Overlord. Right away!\" [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1062@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Accept the summons in silence."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1062@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Ignore {Balorboss} outright."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1062@TITLE"
msgstr "Your Overlord Demands a Sacrifice"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1064@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With a terrible roar {Balorboss} thunders aloud: \"I demand the most despicable act of evil to be rendered before me this very instant!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1064@BODY_FOOTER@FIRST_TIME"
msgstr "\"Sacrifice to me!\" roars [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink], \"to receive the greatest reward. And become the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Prince[/hyperlink] of the Chiefest of Evils, me, {Balorboss}, Overlord of Overlords! Bwahahaha!!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1064@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As you near the searing heat of the Altar of Bealoroth, a booming roar comes out at you from the depths below, quaking the very earth beneath your feet."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1064@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Bwahaha, you have come to me, my Minion; excellent...\" roars the voice of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink]. \"My craving for tribute knows no end, so what will you offer your Overlord today?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1064@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Sacrifice a prisoner..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1064@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Sacrifice your population..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1064@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Sacrifice {EventHero}..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1064@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Sacrifice your own blood..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1064@TITLE"
msgstr "Balorboss Demands Sacrifice"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1069@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Protect all the Chain Cities, my <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>\" urges Ysariel. \"And do not besiege any of them. For, should they fall, then the chain they hold shall shatter...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1069@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As you venture deeper into the Pit, a sight like no other enters your awareness: A gargantuan Hellion chained down in a Pit of eternal torment! Then, {Ysariel.FirstName} again reaches out to you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1069@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Behold, the {Beast} of old,\" reveals {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"This vile, torturous display was part of the pact I signed to establish my accursed [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle[/hyperlink] here. It was the malevolent demand of several powerful [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlord[/hyperlink] to torment their old adversary for all eternity. Each thence seated a {GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept.Hyperlink} at this Circle, intent on maintaining it. As must you...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1069@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Trust in me, my Brother!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1069@TITLE"
msgstr "Secure the Chains"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1070@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "TEMP FOOTER"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1070@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "TEM HEADER"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1070@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "TEMP LORE"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1070@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "TEMP BUTTON"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1070@TITLE"
msgstr "TEMP TITLE"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1089@BODY_FOOTER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Protect all the Chain Cities,\" urges Ysariel. \"If you are still up to the task {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}... Dare not to besiege any of them! Lest it shatter their chain.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1089@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"I shall do this for the greater good [goodact/] of all.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1104@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Seek out three <<m:EventStructure>>,\" commands {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"Meanwhile, I shall contact some old connections to inquire what manner of ploy might await us yonder...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1104@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "In a rare silent moment, the bright, cold light of {Ysariel.Name} flashes out from above. \"Ill news,\" reveals {Ysariel.FirstName} in a grim tone, \"The [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlords[/hyperlink] are conspiring against us...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1104@BODY_HEADER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "In a rare silent moment, the bright, cold light of {Ysariel.Name} flashes out from above. \"{GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, ill news,\" reveals {Ysariel.FirstName} in a grim tone, \"The [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlords[/hyperlink] are conspiring against us...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1104@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I fear this is why the other [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Princes[/hyperlink] have gone missing,\" growls {Ysariel.FirstName}, \"Their [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Overlord[/hyperlink] has conspired with the Horwynd of old to forge secret domains shrouded from sight... used for evil purposes, no doubt. As {Ysariel.Title}, I am... quite familiar with their workings. The {EventStructureB} is shrouded by a magic locking spell, bound to <<m:EventStructure>>. Find three of these <<m:EventStructure>> and unlock the portal access, so that we might uncover its evil secrets...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1104@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"This sounds ominous, I will have a look.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1104@TITLE"
msgstr "Shrouded Secrets"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1105@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"What is more,\" hints {Ysariel.FirstName} \"I reached out to an old {GLOBAL.HorwyndLoreConcept.Hyperlink} acquaintance who indeed revealed that a subsection of their kin has long worked with the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Princes[/hyperlink]. Mighty {GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept.Hyperlink} only knows what for...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1105@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Well done my <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>,\" recognizes {Ysariel.FirstName} with a sombre tone. \"It was, indeed, as I feared, a Shrouded Isle Portal has thus revealed itself to us...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1105@BODY_HEADER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Not bad {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" recognizes {Ysariel.FirstName} with a sombre tone. \"It was, indeed, as I feared, a Shrouded Isle Portal has thus revealed itself to us...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1105@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"It was all too convenient,\" growls {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"The [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Overlords[/hyperlink] must be using the invasion of {Karissa.Title} as a ploy to hide some nefarious plot. I feared as much, ever since the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Princes[/hyperlink] failed to return.. and now, we have evidence.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1105@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"What now, my Brother?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1105@BUTTON_0@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"What now?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1105@TITLE"
msgstr "Shrouded Secrets: Unveiled"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1112@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Make haste, <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>,\" presses {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"I shall join the Carnage Ritual to draw the attention of the others. You, meanwhile, must take your strongest armies and explore this wretched portal. Go!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1112@BODY_FOOTER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Make haste, <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>,\" presses {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"Take your strongest armies and explore this wretched portal—and only this portal. Go!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1112@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Ysariel.FirstName} frowns and looks away for a space. \"There is no other way. Yea, I have a terrible feeling about this <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>... Demons and secrets do not bode well.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1112@BODY_HEADER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "{Ysariel.FirstName} frowns and looks at you. \"If you can focus, there is only one thing we can do, for Demons and secrets do not bode well.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1112@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Though I watched over this realm for many ages, this portal is entirely new to me; 't was well shrouded, indeed...\" grunts {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"A spell must have been placed on it intent on obscuring it from my sight. Ever since the destruction of {GLOBAL.GrexolisLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Overlords[/hyperlink] have grown quieter and quieter. Now things are beginning to make sense...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1112@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"It shall be done, my Brother!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1112@BUTTON_0@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"I will consider this.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1112@TITLE"
msgstr "Diabolical Secrets"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1113@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With the darkness of {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} dawning on <<P:Ysariel>>, {Ysariel.FirstName} urges you to purge all the {GLOBAL.SoulsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. How do you proceed?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1113@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the key to the {EventStructure} in your possession, {Ysariel.FirstName} reaches out again. \"Wretched scheming Demons, damn them all to [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept]the Void[/hyperlink]!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1113@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"And damn their army of sinners down to the Nether Realms!\" curses {Ysariel.FirstName} through <<o:Ysariel>> teeth, before correcting <<r:Ysariel>> with an odd, sinister stillness. \"Yes, it must be done,\" acknowledges {Ysariel.FirstName} as a dark shadow draws over <<o:Ysariel>> pale face, \"They are after all but the shackled {GLOBAL.SoulsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of Demon lovers. Yea, they must all be purged from [hyperlink,GLOBAL.TheWellLoreConcept]the Well's Salvation[/hyperlink], so that they might feed the Carnage and so complete the ritual.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1113@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Purge all the Souls to feed the Carnage Ritual. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1113@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Grant these Souls salvation and send them towards the Well. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1113@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Refuse Ysariel and resist his Obbadothan temptation. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1113@TITLE"
msgstr "Diabolical Secrets: Exposed"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1115@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"My <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>, cease all your other ventures, I beseech thee,\" urges {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"Break this stockade ere the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Overlords[/hyperlink] can hatch their foul plan!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1115@BODY_FOOTER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"{GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, cease all other ventures, forthwith,\" urges {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"Break this stockade, ere the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Overlords[/hyperlink] can hatch their foul plan!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1115@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon being approached in the hot, inner heat of this evil place, {Ysariel.FirstName} reaches out once more with a gasp of disbelief."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1115@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"By the almighty {GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept.Hyperlink}...\" gasps {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"This structure is a stockade, filled to the brim with Sinners: Demon lovers who have forfeited their [hyperlink,GLOBAL.SoulsLoreConcept]souls[/hyperlink] to a [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlord[/hyperlink] for gains in life. The Overlords are—nay—they have created a slave army! Then it was true: they are intent on breaking free and swarming the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} with their legions! This must be made undone, {PlayerLeader.Name}!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1115@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Press on."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1115@TITLE"
msgstr "Sinners Be Damned"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1117@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Waste no time, <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>,\" urges {Ysariel.FirstName}, \"Go, rebuild the ruined {EventStructure}, so long as I remain {Ysariel.LastName}, no {GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept.Hyperlink} shall attack you at this site.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1117@BODY_FOOTER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Make haste,\" urges {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"Quickly rebuild the ruined {EventStructure} and know this, so long as I remain {Ysariel.LastName}, no {GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept.Hyperlink} shall harm you here.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1117@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Well done, my <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>!\" chimes {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"Old [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Bealoroth}[/hyperlink] might well be the master of this chain, but as {Ysariel.LastName}, my word is final. And I say <<p:Bealoroth>> failed in its protection.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1117@BODY_HEADER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Admirably done, {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}\" acknowledges {Ysariel.FirstName}. \" [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Bealoroth}[/hyperlink] does not relent easily. As {Ysariel.LastName}, I hereby declare <<p:Bealoroth>> failed in its protection.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1117@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Now, take these resources and quickly finish the task at hand: rebuild the city ruins before the {EventStructure}. Each chain is protected by these cities, this is why it is forbidden to destroy the Chain Cities to all [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Princes[/hyperlink]. Once the city is rebuilt, I shall formally seat you at my infamous {GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and then... the Carnage Ritual awaits.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1117@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Trust in me, my Brother!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1117@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Order shall be restored.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1117@TITLE"
msgstr "Chain of Hatred: Scrubbed"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1124@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer.FirstName} looks up with a sly, wrinkly frown. \"The thing about luck is: one should never expect it. Now come, have some tea and introduce yourself.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1124@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer.FirstName} glances off askance for a pensive moment. \"Hmpf. Why does a {EventPlayer.LastName} do anything, really?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1124@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"These {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are good folk—excellent folk even,\" puffs {EventPlayer}. \"They remind me much of my own people, you know. For they enjoy a good meal, tell a good tale, and my... do they know the plight of extinction.\" <<g:face^n,EventPlayer.FirstName>> grows dark for a space. \"Many people went missing. So I went looking, is all. But no luck could've ever saved me from the {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Well, no luck but [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GeassadaeLoreConcept]Milina[/hyperlink]!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1124@TITLE"
msgstr "A Lucky Break"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1152@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As the fire in your heart fades and all furious heat sinks to the floor, doubts creep into your mind: If only you could have protected <<o:Karissa>>... if only you could have been there for <<o:Karissa>>..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1152@BODY_FOOTER@ANTAGONIST"
msgstr "Thus a strange bewildering stillness returns again to the realm, as its greater magical aura becomes slightly less chaotic, though not less infernal..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1152@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With a dark thud, the familiar presence of {Karissa.FirstName} flickers and fades from your heart. As you tap out into the cosmos to reach out to <<o:Karissa>>, you realize that <<p:Karissa>> is defeated!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1152@BODY_HEADER@ANTAGONIST"
msgstr "With a deafening boom, the fiery presence of {Karissa} flickers and fades into the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1152@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "<<Co:Karissa>> voice screams, wails, cackles, and cries all before roaring execrably with a broken vigor as <<p:Karissa>> is sucked out into the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Thus, {Karissa} is banished from the realm, and with it <<g:Crusade^n,{Karissa.FirstName}>> of Chaos is at an end as <<o:Karissa>> {KarissaRace} flee about in reckless abandon!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1152@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"If only...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1152@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Celebrate <<o:Karissa>> defeat!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1152@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Consume a portion of <<o:Karissa>> fading power!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1152@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Pray for <<o:Karissa>> safe passing. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1152@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Sacrifice captives of the {KarissaRace} to Balorboss! [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1152@TITLE"
msgstr "Flame Extinguished"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1154@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "While your restless thoughts spiral off into many, maddening directions, a couple of spontaneous ideas enter your awareness..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1154@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Ever since hearing {Karissa.Name} utter <<o:Karissa>> powerful Scream of Chaos, a restless urge lingers within you to grow your {GLOBAL.ChaosConcept.Hyperlink} and scream your heart out too, but how?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1154@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Chaos is, by its very nature, an ever ungraspable concept, yet on this realm it is all around you. You can taste it in the air, feel it on your body, sense it with your spirit. Fire, carnage and turmoil are its products, but besides the arcane study of Chaos tomes... how does one come closer to its source? How does one truly embrace Chaos?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1154@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Plunge {PlayerCapital} into temporary lawlessness and learn by observing. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1154@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Round up and barricade your scholars [knowledge/] until they uncover a chaos tome. (DEPRECATED)"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1154@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Indiscriminately declare war on every new Ruler you meet!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1154@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Continue to ruminate—at your own expense."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1154@TITLE"
msgstr "Appetite for Entropy"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1157@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "You must grow your {GLOBAL.ChaosConcept.Hyperlink} and quickly, lest the madness of {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} take hold."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1157@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The madness of {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} stirs within your mind—chaos beckons."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1157@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Ever since hearing that mighty Scream of Chaos uttered by {Karissa.Name}, a restless urge has been tormenting you at the back of your mind. It appears that this unrequited objective has been festering for too long and now the infernal, maddening energies of {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are vexing your spirit with irrational irritation! Something has got to give..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1157@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Utterly plunge {PlayerCapital} into anarchy and intently study the outcome. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1157@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Command all scholars [knowledge/] and recruits [unitprod/] to find you a Chaos Tome, fast!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1157@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Give in already. Scream, roar, and batter yourself into an exhausting furor!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1157@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Take your vexing fury out on your troops. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1157@TITLE"
msgstr "Cravings for Chaos"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1168@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"We wish to join your crusade of chaos!\" smirks the {EventUnit} with a quick, playful wink, \"and liberate our chained master! Please accept our oh-so-passionate support.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1168@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Not long after the destruction of the Chain City, a small, ragtag group of Demonic figures emerge near your {PlayerCapital}, led by a rapturous {EventUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1168@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Hail, O mighty {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" greets the {EventUnit} with a sly, courteous bow. \"Our kindred has long desired to bring about due vengeance upon the abominable '[hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlords[/hyperlink]' and their princely lackeys. And in you, we see a mighty, potent challenger to their age-old reign!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1168@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Allow the Hellion rebels [unit/] to join your army."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1168@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"You can always support me with gold. [gold/]\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1168@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"I need no help, go back to the shadows!\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1168@TITLE"
msgstr "Rebellious Hellions"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1177@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "While the {Walburgis.LastName} disintegrates in darkness, <<o:Walburgis>> {WalburgisRace} flee in terror and {WalburgisCapital} is free for you to decide on. Razing and dismantling it now will break the nearby chain."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1177@BODY_FOOTER@PIT_PROTECTOR"
msgstr "While the {Istarnech.LastName} is slowly digested into <<r:Istarnech>>, <<o:Istarnech>> {IstarnechRace} scurry away in mortal panic and {IstarnechCapital} is left vulnerable to destruction..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1177@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Eyes wide, {Walburgis.Name} steps back, bleating and gurgling black bile and ichor out in great globs until it overtakes <<p:Walburgis>> whole."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1177@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "With another {GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept.Hyperlink} gone, {EventRealm} is one step closer to total anarchy."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1177@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Raze and dismantle The Chain of Anguish, now! [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1177@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Sacrifice captives of the {WalburgisRace} to Balorboss! [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1177@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Salvage <<o:Walburgis>> Demonic powers before <<p:Walburgis>> fades away entirely. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1177@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Use this dire opportunity to rally your troops not to despair. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1177@TITLE"
msgstr "Salvation from Anguish"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1179@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Go, protect the chains,\" presses the {Ysariel.LastName}, \"Make haste!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1179@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Suddenly, {Ysariel.Name} reaches out with great urgency."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1179@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The {Karissa.Title} has moved <<o:Karissa>> troops towards the inner Pit,\" stresses {Ysariel.FirstName} \"Quickly, redirect your attention to the inner Pit and do not let <<o:Karissa>> advance any further, I beseech thee!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1179@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Heed this warning."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1179@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Ignore this and all future warnings."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1179@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"To Caldera with all of you!\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1179@TITLE"
msgstr "Protect the Chains!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1186@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With a stern face, {Ysariel.FirstName} continues, \"As {Ysariel.LastName} I hereby order this siege to end, a tithe to be paid, a truce to be forged and for the both of you to focus on the matter at hand!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1186@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At the start of your siege, {Ysariel.Name} descends from above with a furious snarl. \"Cease this senseless folly at once, both of you!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1186@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{PlayerLeader.FirstName}, heed my warning: should this city fall, then the nearby {CapitalIstarnech} will break,\" growls {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"I believe our {Istarnech.Title} has learned <<o:Istarnech>> lesson, though a price must still be paid.\"[br/][br/]\"No! Curse the younger races, not my gold!\" howls the Demonic [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept]Elder Giant[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1186@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Understood, my Brother.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1186@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I accept this, not for you, but for the greater good.\" [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1186@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"I'll take the risk.\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1186@TITLE"
msgstr "Slack the Chain of Greed"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1188@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{PlayerLeader.FirstName}, heed my warning: should this city fall, then the nearby {CapitalWalburgis} shall break,\" growls {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"I believe our {Walburgis.LastName} has learned <<o:Walburgis>> lesson, though a price must still be paid.\"[br/][br/]\"Gha! Curse you fallen [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archon[/hyperlink],\" gurgles the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Prince[/hyperlink], \"end not my unholy war!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1188@TITLE"
msgstr "Slack the Chain of Anguish"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1190@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{PlayerLeader.FirstName}, heed my warning: should this city fall, then the nearby {CapitalDaDaYo} shall break,\" growls {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"I believe our {DaDaYo.LastName} has learned <<o:DaDaYo>> lesson, though a price must still be paid.\"[br/][br/]\"Pha, never a moment too late, are you 'Champion of Emnora,'\" spits the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Princess[/hyperlink], \"Go on then, do it! End it, end it already!!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1190@TITLE"
msgstr "Slack the Chain of Impatience"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1205@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"This changes nothing, <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>,\" affirms {Ysariel.FirstName} with hot tears in <<o:Ysariel>> eyes, \"Nay, rebuild the Chain City, then I shall instruct you on your new duties.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1205@BODY_FOOTER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Prove your intent now [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Duke[/hyperlink],\" challenges {Ysariel}, \"Swear a Pact of Brotherhood with me, or acknowledge yourself an enemy of my [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle[/hyperlink] all along.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1205@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon striking your deal, {Ysariel} descends from above with a gloomy frown. \"So, you have sold your soul over to [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Bealoroth}[/hyperlink]...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1205@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I do not blame you for your transgressions, my <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>,\" sighs {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"I too was once faced with a similar decision and ultimately also decided to shoulder the infernal burden for the greater good of all. Though, when I first invited you to claim a seat at my Circle, I did not foresee you would join it as [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Royalty[/hyperlink], but here we are...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1205@BODY_LORE@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "{Ysariel.FirstName} eyes you for a long, tense moment. \"I knew {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} would ultimately claim you too, {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. As it does all of us... In a sense, we have become Pact Brothers after all. But now the question remains, how true to your word are you? Are you still committed to protecting [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]the Circle[/hyperlink], or were you actually our enemy all this time?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1205@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Though my soul be sold, my heart remains bound to you, my Brother.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1205@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"You were right, I shall pledge a Pact of Brotherhood with you.\" [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1205@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Pha, to Caldera with your Circle! Hatred is my Master now.\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1205@TITLE"
msgstr "Bound to Balorboss"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1212@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As you see all {EventRealm} burn before your inner eye, a profoundly malevolent challenge enters your awareness...[br/][br/]Are you Evil?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1212@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At last, your true nature has surfaced and soon all of {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} shall become the very canvas of your nefarious arts."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1212@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "As this sinister delight sparks up within your malevolent heart, you sense the greater cosmic forces of chaos take note of your aspirations for destruction. Indeed, as its raving presence nears your awareness the word turns red and all about you carnage calls. Carnage! Yes, it seems to tell you destruction is at hand. Break the chains, wreck {EventRealm}, let evil reign free!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1212@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Yea, I am evil: Evil Incarnate!\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1212@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"I am Chaos Manifest! [chaosboon/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1212@TITLE"
msgstr "Agent of Destruction"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1213@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As the realm burns whole, all greater forces of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} focus their attention upon you. And you.."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1213@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As whole {EventRealm} burns before you, and the Carnage Energies whirl about in a furious cacophony, a great sinister revelry enters your dark heart."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1213@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Your evil work is thus rendered complete, and in this most ominous moment none can stand up to or against you. This ancient, ruined realm of {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is now yours to claim and shape to your own image."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1213@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "...Embrace the savage Chaos!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1213@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "...Devote this victory to Balorboss!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1213@TITLE"
msgstr "Complete Destruction"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1226@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "...Envelop yourself in the Shadows."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1227@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"I am Shadow Made Flesh!\" [shadowboon/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1248@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"There are Shrouded Isles upon {EventRealm},\" whispers {Karissa.FirstName} with a giddy giggle. \"I must have them! So find me three <<m:EventStructure>> oh would you, my Roaring One?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1248@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon one raging morning, {Karissa.FirstName} spontaneously reaches out to you with a wicked grin, dragging a small figure behind <<o:Karissa>>. \"Look who I found skulking about the realm?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1248@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Then, with a gusty titter, {Karissa.FirstName} tosses forward {Frikka}, who shifts between a vile snarl and an ambivalent grin to be here. \"It's an old acquaintance no less. <<Cp:Frikka>> was disguised as a little {EventUnit} cornered inside a curious Breached Isle I found near the Pit. And after some... inspired inquiry from my part, {Frikka.FirstName} here had something marvelous to share!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1248@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Anything for you, {Karissa.FirstName}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1248@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets and Deceptions"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1249@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "A dark and sinister grin dawns upon {Karissa.FirstName} as <<p:Karissa>> bites <<o:Karissa>> lip. \"I got some nasty, little secrets to share with you...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1249@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After clearing the third {EventStructure}, a satisfying titter again erupts behind you. \"Marvelous, my Roaring One!\" cheers {Karissa.FirstName}. \"Let me thank you for your precious gift...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1249@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Oh, Shrouded Isles,\" sighs {Karissa.FirstName} with a blush of nostalgia, \"I think I used to have one of those. Curious, my memory is failing me... Now I only remember [hyperlink,GLOBAL.MerlinLoreConcept]Merlin[/hyperlink], that old lecher; how I loved to tease him with my secrets.\" With a twinkle in <<o:Karissa>> eye, <<p:Karissa>> looks at you. \"Oh, don't be jealous, I was only toying; ah, we were all so young still back then. But you, my Roaring One, are the real deal.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1249@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"What do you have on your mind?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1249@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets and Deceptions: Unshrouded"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1258@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Find this Shrouded Island,\" grins {Karissa.FirstName}, \"and then raid it of every, single nasty secret it might contain. You can keep all the plunder, save any, say—sinners you might find...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1258@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"I got two invitations for some rather exclusive isles,\" reveals {Karissa.FirstName} with a slow blink, \"and I want you to have them both. Don't hesitate now.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1258@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"My little chat with {Frikka.FirstName} earlier revealed that there are two Shrouded Isles of significance upon this realm,\" continues {Karissa.FirstName}. \"One, belonging to my [hyperlink,GLOBAL.YsarielLoreConcept]Handsome Ace[/hyperlink], containing some rather embarrassing secret. And yet another, I believe, far more alluring isle containing the ingredients for some ineffably fiendish plot... one ages in the making. And I must have it!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1258@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Yes ma'am.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1258@TITLE"
msgstr "Raid the Shrouded Isle"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1259@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Take these jailed souls and feed them to the {Beast}!\" urges {Karissa.FirstName} with wicked glee. \"Or, alternatively... use your matured Chaos powers to bind some to your service...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1259@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the key to the {EventStructure} in your hand, a familiar, hot presence emerges within your heart. \"Yes, my Roaring One!\" cheers {Karissa.FirstName}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1259@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Look at all these forlorn {GLOBAL.SoulsLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" sighs {Karissa.FirstName}. \"They sadly never returned to [hyperlink,GLOBAL.TheWellLoreConcept]the Well of Creation[/hyperlink] and now await their long overdue retribution...\" Karissa ponders their fate with a melancholic frown. \"All souls deserve purpose in the cosmos, and by the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]Chaos Endailon[/hyperlink] they shall have it! Let's feed them to the Beast, shall we?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1259@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Feed the {Beast} with these souls."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1259@TITLE"
msgstr "Private Island Raids: No Dither"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1260@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Claim some souls [unit/] for your army."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1269@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Fierce and defiant, the {EventUnit} stands <<o:EventUnit>> ground, awaiting the correct answer, or elsewise prepared to strike."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1269@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "In the bowels of this infernal hole stands a portal. And upon entering its threshold, a glum-faced {EventUnit} exits through its gateway to halt all further advance."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1269@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"None may pass, but those who can answer this,\" demands the {EventUnit}. \"I spurned the path my heart was shown; and claimed the dark as if my own. Through vice and ruin, I'm drawn to roll; a drifting, damned and wayward soul. I'm full of guilt, yet hunger still; I respect no law, taboo, nor will. No virtue left, no debts I mend; I tramp the road that has no end. What am I?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1269@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You are a sinner most foul.\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1269@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"You are in my way, to arms!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1269@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"You are the paradox of order, free will astray.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1269@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Leave this riddle for some other time."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1269@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"You are welcome in Obbadoth, now begone.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1269@TITLE"
msgstr "I Tramp the Road"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1270@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EventUnit} stands tall, awaiting an answer, resignation, or a challenge... How do you respond?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1270@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Within this calm, still, and surprisingly cool place there stands a curious portal. Upon closer inspection, an {EnemyUnit} appears to bar all entry inside."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1270@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "With a stern face, the {EventUnit} speaks: \"None may enter, but the {Ysariel.Title}, or <<o:Ysariel>> closest of Sworn Brothers who know the answer to this riddle: \"I stand apart where others bind; Unclaimed in hearth, in heart, in kind. No voice calls mine, no place to stay; I walk alone, a world away. What am I?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1270@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You are an outcast.\" [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1270@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"You are hereby my foe, to arms!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1270@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"You are the consequence of your own actions; a product of malefaction.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1270@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Retreat to ponder this riddle elsewhere."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1270@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"You are he to whom I am Sworn. Make way.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1270@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"You are uncommitted, let me show"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1270@TITLE"
msgstr "A Product of Malefaction"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1271@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EventUnit} grins a wicked grin as <<p:EventUnit>> readies <<r:EventUnit>> to answer <<o:EventUnit>> own question with violent action towards your troops."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1271@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Amongst the swelling heat and brimstone arises a complex of structures taller than mountains, filled to the brim with screaming and wailing souls of sinners."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1271@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Approaching the site, the fiery jailers appear, eager to receive the next batch. But upon seeing your troops, the head warden, a hulking {EventUnit} stops and growls. \"Who be ye? Not {Frikka.FirstName} nor one of <<o:Frikka>> co-conspirators, those counted among <<o:Frikka>> [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Princes[/hyperlink] of sedition. Bring you new prisoners or... are you soon to become one?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1271@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack the jailers."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1271@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Frikka sent me here, out of my way.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1271@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Attempt to roar aloud your wildest Scream of Chaos!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1271@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Attempt to daunt the jailers by invoking Higher Forces."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1271@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Retreat!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1271@TITLE"
msgstr "Stockade of Sinners"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1272@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.SoulsLoreConcept]anguished souls[/hyperlink] of a legion of sinners wail out at you to be set free, and with the key to their fate now in your hands, a decision awaits..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1272@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With a grunt and a roar, the {EventUnit} falls over into the molten pit below and, overcome by its wounds sinks to its fiery doom."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1272@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "All about you, the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.SoulsLoreConcept]accursed souls[/hyperlink] of sinners wail and howl to be released. Their swelling cacophony reverberates across the crater and out into the hollow darkness beyond."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1272@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Decide their fate..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1272@TITLE"
msgstr "Stockade of Sinners: Jailbroken"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1279@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "While the {DaDaYo.LastName} is dragged away, <<o:DaDaYo>> {DaDaYoRace} scramble in wild abandon and {DaDaYoCapital} is free for you to decide on. Razing and dismantling it now will break the nearby chain."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1279@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As a fiery portal opens up behind <<o:DaDaYo>>, <<p:DaDaYo>> drops down to the floor and claws screeching like a banshee. \"No! My time is not yet come, I refuse!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1279@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "With another {GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept.Hyperlink} gone, {EventRealm} is one step closer to total anarchy..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1279@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Raze and dismantle the Chain of Impatience, now! [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1279@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Sacrifice captives of the {DaDaYoRace} to Balorboss! [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1279@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Salvage <<o:DaDaYo>> Demonic powers [production/] before <<p:DaDaYo>> fades away entirely. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1279@TITLE"
msgstr "Salvation from Impatience"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1281@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "While the {Istarnech.LastName} is slowly digested into <<r:Istarnech>>, <<o:Istarnech>> {IstarnechRace} scurry away in mortal panic and {IstarnechCapital} is free for you to decide on. Razing and dismantling it now will break the nearby chain."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1281@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Toppling over, {Istarnech} groans and grumbles aloud as gold-froth emerges from every orifice. \"No, the Need calls! The hunger pangs, they are insufferable!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1281@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "With another {GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept.Hyperlink} gone, {EventRealm} is one step closer to total anarchy."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1281@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Raze and dismantle the Chain of Greed, now! [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1281@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Sacrifice captives of the {IstarnechRace} to Balorboss! [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1281@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Salvage <<o:Istarnech>> Demonic powers before <<p:Istarnech>> fades away entirely. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1281@TITLE"
msgstr "Salvation from Greed"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1284@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With a firm stance, {EventUnit} readies to protect their mysterious plight as <<o:EventUnit>> awaits your answer..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1284@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Approaching the {EventStructure}, a curious yet determined {EventUnit} steps up to halt your entry."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1284@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "With unblinking eyes, the {EventUnit} spontaneously orates aloud: \"Passage through is barred to all but those who know the answer hereto: Born in bloom, I warm the sky; I crimson fade as death drifts by; I sleep beneath a quilt of white; Then rise again in lush delight. What am I?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1284@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You are the changing seasons.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1284@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I have no time for this, to arms!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1284@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Answer this inquiry by summoning the spirit of the seasons."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1284@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Ponder this question away from the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1284@TITLE"
msgstr "The Fourfold Enigma"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1285@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Empowered by the seasonal torrent, the rabid {EventUnit} works itself up into a fury, refusing anyone near <<P:EventUnit>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1285@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The tower before you stands swathed in a raging torrent of warped seasons. And at its gate, growls a horrid abomination..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1285@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Wiz-ard, ach!\" coughs the abominable {EventUnit}. \"Magbar kill wiz-ard, ach-khu! You make [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]season gods[/hyperlink] wither and eat you. You warp Fey magicks so seasons go bad, you make Magbar all ugly, ugly and sad! Grrr-kuu, Magbar kill! Ach-khuuu, I kill you!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1285@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack the {EventUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1285@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Strengthen your troops [mana/] with the seasonal torrent."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1285@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Attempt to master the spellwarped mists and seasons."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1285@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Reach out to soothe Magbar's swelling rage."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1285@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "Leave Magbar and the Arcanum, for now."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1285@TITLE"
msgstr "The Wrath of Seasons"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1286@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "More <<m:EventUnit>> slink forth to listen, as {FeyGuideName} seethes: \"Let's feud no more, but sow our grief; Let's heal {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and reap relief.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1286@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As the seasonal torrent reaches its climax, {FeyGuideName} flutters up in riled anguish. \"Stop, don't cleave what crawls and grieves!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1286@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Cowering, Magbar looks up to {FeyGuideName}, all riled-up. \"Born of blight, bent from right; wizard hands have sparked Fey spite. They seasons torn, its cycle shorn; {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} thus claw and mourn. But not by hate we mend this fate; no, fight the right, unmake the scorn. Mistlings, rise! Shed off the lies; embrace your spite, but make it wise.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1286@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Draw on the seasons for its power. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1286@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Strengthen <<G:speech^n,{FeyGuideName}>> to win Magbar over. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1286@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Raid the tower for its secrets [knowledge/], while {FeyGuideName} speaks on."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1286@TITLE"
msgstr "The Wrath of Seasons: Subsided"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1299@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer.FirstName} furrows <<o:EventPlayer>> brows. \"Traces of their history can still be found on various <<m:EventStructure>> throughout the realm. Find and activate them, so that we might gain the leverage of wits.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1299@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Before the morning's departure, {EventPlayer.FirstName} draws you aside with a hushed whisper. \"Do you know what a {GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is? There is a rather puzzling one here on {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1299@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"See here, our primary foes are each members of an old [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archon[/hyperlink]-sanctioned [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle[/hyperlink], long ago established here to control their waxing powers,\" explains {EventPlayer.FirstName}. \"Though, as is becoming pressingly more evident, they are not quite as contained, nor as 'administered' accordingly. Now, when Milina spirited me to freedom I learned that these very 'Disciples' are not the original circle-members at all...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1299@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will consider this.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1299@TITLE"
msgstr "Leverage of Wits"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1300@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "After a brief, pensive pause, {EventPlayer.FirstName} looks up with a troubled smile. \"Hmm... the plot thickens, as they say.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1300@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon puzzling the various <<m:EventStructure>> scribbles together, {EventPlayer.FirstName} exlaims: \"Dear {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, this forms a map to a {EventStructureB}!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1300@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"How fascinating to be reminded of these. Why, I've heard rumors of such devices being employed by the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept]Wizard Kings[/hyperlink] of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, though never quite confirmed—it was all a rather 'mortally tabooed subject,' if memory serves. But see here, to the surprise of no one the original Duathan circle did exactly that. Though I fear... ominously so.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1300@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Tell me what is on your mind.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1300@TITLE"
msgstr "Leverage of Wits: Mapped Out"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1304@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I suspect,\" mulls {EventPlayer.FirstName}, \"that [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept]Duatha's[/hyperlink] troubles are interwoven with whatever secrets lay shrouded beyond that portal. We would do well to uncover them.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1304@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Wizardly secrets, my good fellow,\" puffs {EventPlayer.FirstName}, \"of a most unsavory kind, I do fear.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1304@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Spells don't just pop out of nowhere,\" hums {EventPlayer.FirstName}. \"Their primary avenue of creation being through empiricism. Long ago, an age of 'unfettered experimentation' flourished that triggered [hyperlink,GLOBAL.TheFracturingLoreConcept]such manner of cataclysms[/hyperlink] that the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} deemed it right to intervene. [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Administrative circles[/hyperlink] were thereafter established to ensure a more, say, lawful continuation of wizardly business everywhere. Yet... many assimilated Archmages did not quite fancy these new restrictions...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1304@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I shall uncover these secrets.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1304@TITLE"
msgstr "A Circle Shrouded"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1305@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer.FirstName} looks up, drained of <<o:EventPlayer>> merry demeanor. \"If so, do you think the {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} forays merely echo the trauma {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} suffered?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1305@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "While your troops salvage {EventStructure}, {EventPlayer.FirstName} appears again with an emotive smile to sit with you in silence."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1305@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"So,\" puffs {EventPlayer.FirstName} as <<p:EventPlayer>> breaks the silence, \"sadly, it appears my suspicions were on point. The original {GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept.Hyperlink} was a cabal of Archmages hellbent on dissecting [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept]Duatha's mysteries[/hyperlink] and her beloved creations. And under {GLOBAL.HorwyndLoreConcept.Hyperlink}-bought shroud, one pursued unscrupulous trials of a most abhorrent fashion. Presumably, this wrought the nightmares now plaguing Duatha and vexed the {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} into their present temperament...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1305@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Ponder on this for a while... [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1305@TITLE"
msgstr "A Circle Shrouded: Uncovered"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1309@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Upon various crumbling gates and archways the same repeating motto is engraved, reading: 'Bounteous be the Fey Arcana...'"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1309@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Entering beyond the ichorous veil of the {EventStructure}, a still and opaque domain appears. One reeking of mildew and decayed aspirations."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1309@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "All about your troops, the ruined vestiges of a once vast institute of learning peeks out under the stranglehold of an all-encompassing overgrowth. A quick survey of the ruins reveals ample evidence that this haunted place was long ago abandoned in what must have been an anguished scramble."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1309@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Onwards.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1309@TITLE"
msgstr "A Reclaimed Collegium"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1310@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Wiz-ard...? Wiz-ard! Khuuu, nay! Begone, go a-way,\" weeps the growling voice from the mists. \"Magbar must not stay. Khuhuhu, nay.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1310@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Trudging through the misty wild growth, all halt before a ghastly growling wail, crying: \"Khuuu! Hurts and lies, skewers and cries!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1310@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Khuuu! Why lies say to Magbar, to me?\" laments the growling voice deep from the mist, \"When I shows you fair-lands of Fey and fair-y! You smiles and you treats, you pets and talks sweets. But hurts Magbar's friends when I goes for to sleep. Kuhuhu, Magbar in pain!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1310@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Chase after the ghastly voice."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1310@TITLE"
msgstr "Abominable Secrets"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1314@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Khuuu! No stabs me with skewers, no pull me apart,\" wails the ghastly voice, \"no jab me with magicks and jinxes in heart! Khuhuhu, nay...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1314@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Further up ahead, that ghastly voice again weeps out in raspy coughs: \"Khuuu-ach, island no go! Ach, island no go!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1314@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Khuuu, oh nay, no! No hurt Magbar, I no want to go!\" sobs the ghastly voice. \"Magbar is friend, no drag I to evil island. Khuhuh, I no make angry [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]sun-men[/hyperlink] here come, nor punished they wiz-ards to make all so glum. So why angry with Magbar, why hurt I with pain? Magbar your friend—ach, nay never again!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1314@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Chase after the ghastly voice."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1314@TITLE"
msgstr "Thaumaturgical Trauma"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1319@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Gold... I need your gold!\" grumbles the mad, [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GiantsLoreConcept]Elder Giant[/hyperlink], \"Feed me your damned gold!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1319@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A hungry rumbling enters your awareness, followed by the loud, booming grumbling voice of {Istarnech.FirstName} \" Gold! Gold! Istarnech hungers for your gold!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1319@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "It appears that <<p:Istarnech>> is out for another sacrifice for <<o:Istarnech>> insatiable appetite for gold and will not leave until this accursed need is sated."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1319@TITLE"
msgstr "Demonic Prince of Greed"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1324@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Now!\" threatens {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"Vow upon your immortal soul that you shall protect the Circle as my <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>, or reveal yourself as a servant of evil and face my wrath!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1324@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As the light of Order withdraws from you, the broken light of {Ysariel.FirstName} envelopes you whole with its bleak, sullen aura... \"Yea sinner, I saw you deal with that demon.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1324@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Make no mistake, {Liztia} is a villainous trickster most foul who has eluded my blade for too long,\" scorns {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"Ample experience has wizened me to the fact that <<p:Liztia>> only reveals <<r:Liztia>> when some fiendish catastrophe is imminent. Precisely as I feared... and whatever ploy might be at play, <<p:Liztia>> thought you the right {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} for <<o:Liztia>> sinful act.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1324@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I regret my sin, and swear this pact to atone.\" [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1324@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Pha, spare me your judgments 'Fallen Archon!' I sin as I please.\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1324@TITLE"
msgstr "Casting Aspersions"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1325@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The sinful offers of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept]Obbadoth's[/hyperlink] [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Princes[/hyperlink] can be deceptively convincing,\" scoffs {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"Though rarely do they bargain so freely with newcomers to the Pit. I suspected foul play before, but now sense a deeper conspiracy at work.. Nevertheless, I will not allow it to unfold under my watch.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1338@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"We {EventRace} seek, then twist their beak! Then for Auntie {EventPlayer.FirstName} I gives a squeak! And when she come, she'll surely peek; how Pellari of stinky cages reek!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1338@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Auntie {EventPlayer.FirstName}, who just us meet, once cheerfully with {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} treat,\" mutters {FeyGuideName}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1338@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "A sombre note falls over {FeyGuideName}. \"It like sprout-blight feels to see Auntie torn; twixt [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]Fey Lord[/hyperlink] praise and Fey Lord scorn! I wish to Auntie, we could show—somehow; how {EventRace} hurts {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} now...\" {FeyGuideName} stomps <<o:FeyGuideName>> little head with balled fists, then gasps: \"Oh, wow, wow, wow! I... I know how!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1338@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"That's a great idea!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1338@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"No. I prefer war, actually.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1338@TITLE"
msgstr "The Beaktwister Plot"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1339@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"This... is not the way of Spring,\" growls {EventPlayer.FirstName} with a distraught gait. \"Has [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]{FeyGodName}[/hyperlink] been taking me for a fool?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1339@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon vanquishing the Mistwalkers, {FeyGuideName} makes a muted call, that somehow still echoes far. Then, {EventPlayer} appears, saying, \"I knew you'd come back to me.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1339@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Auntie, Auntie, come and see;\" chimes {FeyGuideName}, \"how bad a'bruised {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} be. By {EventRace} fang, and claw, and spear; all are in cage, in pain, and fear!\" [br/][br/]{EventPlayer.FirstName} observes the cage riddled camp awhile in pained silence. \"I... I did not know. \"[hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]{FeyGodName}[/hyperlink] promised all life a chance to blossom. How could <<p:FeyGodName>> do this... to me?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1339@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Convince {EventPlayer} to join the Pellari struggle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1339@TITLE"
msgstr "The Beaktwister Plot: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1344@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"This befoulment of Spring must end!\" announces {EventPlayer.FirstName}. \"I renounce this perverse Disciple's mantle and shall join the {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} cause!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1344@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With a pained grimace, {EventPlayer.FirstName} ponders <<o:EventPlayer>> moral quandaries for what feels like the longest instance ever obliged upon {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1344@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Spring is the bloom after death's embrace,\" quotes {EventPlayer.FirstName} in humming song, \"The hope of new life, before the lengthening of days. The call to sprout and break the fast; for all living things to strengthen, at last.\" Swallowing <<o:EventPlayer>> hurts, {EventPlayer.FirstName} concludes, \"[hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]{FeyGodName}[/hyperlink] urged us to break our fast unyielding; as befits the predator in Spring... But this has crippled our game of its fair chance to repopulate!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1344@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Celebrate joyfully on the streets! [happiness/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1344@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Celebrate with a grand picnic! [food/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1344@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Celebrate with a bold military parade! [morale/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1344@TITLE"
msgstr "Disciple No More"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1345@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Henceforth, your will is no longer your own! And though <<p:PlayerLeader>> might sinisterly smile on the outside, inside, <<p:PlayerLeader>> was silently screaming to be released..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1345@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon signing the contract, a dark and sinister laugh echoes out from every corner of void about you. \"I am pleased that you failed to read what was just signed...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1345@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Then, the darkness overtakes you, and you feel your muscles atrophy, your mind obliterated, and your neck snap back as the dark laughter is all that you henceforth know and fear. Though you might try and fight it, there is no use... you just signed your free will over to Pseumodius, who now shall forever puppet your every move.[br/][br/]And thus, wherever {PlayerLeader.Name} was hereafter seen, <<p:PlayerLeader>> were on a mission for their hated Demon Overlord..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1345@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Scream without words!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1345@TITLE"
msgstr "Your Will is No Longer Your Own!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1351@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"See these here <<m:EventStructure>>? If you truly want to destroy the realm—and I know you do—I highly urge you to ignore everyone else and activate three of these instead...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1351@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Ah, drat, you are a reader,\" snaps a much different voice than before, \"I hate readers... Well now, perhaps you are not as witless as you appear.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1351@BODY_HEADER@FRIKKA_PREVAILED"
msgstr "\"Ah, tsk-tsk,\" cackles {Liztia} as <<p:Liztia>> wards off your advances. \"A most admirable attempt, I must admit. Allow me to reward your efforts...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1351@BODY_HEADER@FRIKKA_UNMASKED"
msgstr "With a quick motion you dispel the magical disguise of your opponent, who steps back with a sinister laugh. \"Most impressive!\" booms another voice, \"I suppose you refuse my Pact, then?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1351@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "<<g:façade^n,{Liztia}>> drops like a silken cloth and underneath appears a strangely familiar face. \"Allow me to introduce myself, {Frikka.Name}, we might have met before on {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink} or elsewhere. Seeing how you are not interested in joining my ranks, perhaps you'd be more amenable to... poking your nose where it isn't welcomed? To, say—cause some 'highly catastrophic mischief,' hmm?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1351@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will consider this.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1351@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"Wait, were you not the one who gave the Gildercoil away?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1351@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"Why don't you show me the way?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1351@TITLE"
msgstr "Abetting the Deceiver"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1352@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Can you keep... a secret?\" grins {Frikka.FirstName}, \"A diabolically catastrophic secret, that is?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1352@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon activating the last {EventStructure}, a familiar voice appears again behind you. \"My, my, haven't we been a busy little bee...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1352@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "From the shadows, {Frikka.FirstName} appears with a sinister grin. \"Rejoice, my wicked solicitant, for the tools of catastrophe will soon be at your fingertips.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1352@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Go on, I'm listening...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1352@TITLE"
msgstr "Abetting the Deceiver: Complete"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1354@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Which reminds me, I should pursue that sultry old [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrvatoghLoreConcept]Urvatogh[/hyperlink], now that he's subdued... \" muses {Frikka.FirstName} to <<r:Frikka>>. \"Anyway, how about those <<m:EventStructure>>?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1354@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Ha! I didn't 'give away' anything to anybody,\" grins {Frikka.FirstName}, as a dark, diabolical ghost of a laugh echoes out of the void around you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1354@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"No, I merely... 'planted it' upon the right {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} to claim the liability. {GLOBAL.GrexolisLoreConcept.Hyperlink} needed to 'expire,' and who better to take the blame than an overly ambitious [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadraiFactionLoreConcept]Shad'raite[/hyperlink]? Indeed, now the {GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept]Vampires[/hyperlink]—and many more horrors besides—are freed again to press their vengeance upon the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}... and soon, we'll join the ranks. I mean—my [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Overlord[/hyperlink] will, of course.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1354@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will consider this.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1354@TITLE"
msgstr "Sowing Seeds of Deception"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1359@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Calamitous temptations await your command,\" grins {Frikka.FirstName}. \"Go, explore the {EventStructure} that has just been revealed. And feel free to desecrate {EventStructure_B}, on the way...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1359@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Now then, as {GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of Deception, I know my marvelous reputation well precedes me,\" boasts {Frikka.FirstName}. \"But what I am about to reveal to you is no lie, indeed...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1359@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Remember that little welcome gift I promised you first?\" continues {Frikka.FirstName}. \"You passed my preliminary tests, which I put in place to ensure I entrust this 'highly classified information' to the right instrument... You see, a confidential cabal of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlords[/hyperlink] have long been plotting to escape the wretched Pact we signed with {Ysariel.FirstName}. And there's a little loophole we much desire to exploit.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1359@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will consider this.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1359@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"Why don't you show me the way?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1359@TITLE"
msgstr "Calamitous Temptations"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1360@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Did you know the Pact of the {EventRealm} terminates if {Ysariel.FirstName} should fail to protect {EventRealm}?\" grins {Frikka.FirstName} maliciously. \"I hereby gift you a legion of <<m:EventUnit>>, enjoy the wrecking.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1360@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the hulking {EventStructure} rising all about you, and its key in your hand, a familiar presence again emerges from behind. \"Thus, the long awaited Demonwake dawns...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1360@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Slow clapping, {Frikka.FirstName} emerges from the shadows. \"Now the instructions you have been waiting for. All about us stands a vast prison complex of sinners, each of whom have pledged their mortal [hyperlink,GLOBAL.SoulsLoreConcept]soul[/hyperlink] to a [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlord[/hyperlink], and perished since. We have secretly secured each from returning to[hyperlink,GLOBAL.TheWellLoreConcept]the Well of Creation[/hyperlink], and now this legions is wholly at our disposal for... truly despicable ends.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1360@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Gladly.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1360@TITLE"
msgstr "Calamitous Temptations: Behold"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1379@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Wholly unrivaled, you are now both Chaos Manifest and Evil Incarnate upon {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink}! And this... well, this is only just the beginning."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1379@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Thus, an evil laughter bubbles up within you, the likes of which only {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} can arouse."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1379@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Before you, the Hellion scourge emerge from hiding while Demons scramble about in chaotic turmoil. For their [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Princes[/hyperlink] are defeated and the {Ysariel.LastName} is banished to the Nether Realms—thus breaking the {GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept.Hyperlink} that long held the now thoroughly humiliated [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlords[/hyperlink] in place. But, most heinous of all, the {Karissa.Title} is vanquished from this realm..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1379@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Laugh most maniacally!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1379@TITLE"
msgstr "Maniacal Aspect"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1380@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Wholly unrivaled, you are now both Shadow Made Flesh and Evil Incarnate upon {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink}! And this... well, this is only just the beginning."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1380@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Laugh most maleficiently!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1380@TITLE"
msgstr "Maleficence Aspect"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1381@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"What say you, we finally unchain that old {Beast} of mine, for old-time's sake, while we set our sights on some repulsively, greener pastures abroad...\" laughs {Balorboss}. [br/][br/]\"And you, my [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic <<PlayerLeader{Prince/Princess}>> of Evil[/hyperlink] shall lead the vanguard!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1381@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1379@BODY_HEADER"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1381@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You have made me mighty proud, my [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic <<PlayerLeader{Prince/Princess}>> of Evil[/hyperlink],\" booms the roaring voice of {Balorboss} in your heart. \"However, now that {EventRealm} is fully ours—and even {Ysariel.Title} is finally bubbling below—this realm has become... despicably lacking in Carnage potential. And I so detest a world without Carnage. In fact, now that the Pact of the {EventRealm} is made undone, I say: all [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept]Other Worlds[/hyperlink] should be ours to subvert!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1381@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Laugh most diabolically!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1381@TITLE"
msgstr "Royally Diabolic"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1382@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Your reign as Evil Incarnate upon {EventRealm} begins now, and thus your laughter shall fall upon"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1382@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Laugh! Laugh aloud!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1382@TITLE"
msgstr "Evil Incarnate"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1383@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As the holy chorus slowly recedes from your consecrated soul, a Blessing of Order becomes yours to claim, and you wish for..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1383@BODY_FOOTER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "Then, you behold the Celestial chorus descending from above to strengthen your virtuous quest! And with it, a final boon is made available, and so you wish for..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1383@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Suddenly, a distant chorus of Celestial magnificence graces your ears. As you focus upon its wordless song, a radiant sensation overcomes you wholly..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1383@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Then all the world fades into a brilliance so foreign to {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} that it feels utterly inconceivable... and yet, it persists.[br/][br/]With it comes a [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]consciousness of the cosmic affinity of Order[/hyperlink], gracing your soul with arduous virtue and righteous purpose. In embracing this Higher Force, you know that an even greater reward is now bestowed upon you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1383@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "...the forces of order [unit/] to strengthen your armies."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1383@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "... the ultimate affinity of order to be made available."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1383@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "... the highest wisdom of order to be bestowed upon you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1383@TITLE"
msgstr "Graced by Higher Forces"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1474@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Never use this spell, {Player.FirstName},\" urges {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"Pray, leave it sealed here— where it belongs.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1474@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon exiting the {EventStructure} a familiar voice reaches out to you, weighed down with a deep sense of guilt. \"I know of your exploits, {Player.FirstName}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1474@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Understand...\" continues {Ysariel.FirstName}, \"I was raised and devoted to [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archon ideals[/hyperlink] since birth. Expulsion from Emnora... I did everything to reverse the resulting malediction. Yet, all I begot was the accursed essence of my purgatorial affliction. This heinous spell is its result. And though my {YsarielRace} adopted it willingly, its very existence mortifies me.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1474@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will consider this...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1474@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"My Brother, I too shall share your burden.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_1474@TITLE"
msgstr "Form of the Fallen"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_695@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Then, the sky rumbles overhead as an explosive flash erupts before your very eyes! From the blinding light two awesome figures clash: a mighty, dark angel and an ascended idol of fire."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_695@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As you arrive at the summoning point provided in the distress call of {Ysariel}, you are met by a roaring earthquake coming from the very bowels of this world."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_695@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "All about you in the boiling air, fierce demonic energies clash against the dim, straining spirit of Order, all whirled about in an elated cacophony of raging Chaos. {EventRealm} appears to be in an absolute state of turmoil as the earth quivers beneath your feet and the black clouds above your head race about in ominous patterns..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_695@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Peer through the bright flash."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_695@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I swear my Soul to no man.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_695@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Bring it! Smite me, you disgraced buffoon!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_695@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "(Ignore me, I'm just here to test the game.) | TEMP"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_695@TITLE"
msgstr "Hail the Chaos"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_697@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Desperate, {Ysariel.FirstName} turns to you, \"Quickly {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, aid me in protecting {EventRealm}!\" Gleefully, {Karissa.FirstName} charms you also, \"No, no, my new favorite. Let's break it all—together.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_697@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Lo, before you, {Ysariel} clashes face-to-face with none other than {Karissa}!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_697@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Back you foul Witch of Chaos!\" growls {Ysariel.FirstName}, \"By the {GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, thou shalt not unmake my accursed Circle, nor release the Demon scum wholly upon the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}—begone!\" [br/]{Karissa.FirstName} licks <<o:Karissa>> lips and flashes <<o:Karissa>> maddening eyes. \"Tsk, tsk, my handsome Ace,\" coaxes <<p:Karissa>>. \"The [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]Chaos Endailon[/hyperlink] invites all to break the old order. So go on, give up already; give in... to me.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_697@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Side with {Ysariel.FirstName}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_697@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Side with {Karissa.FirstName}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_697@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Side with neither, let them fight it out."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_697@TITLE"
msgstr "Pick Your Destiny"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_698@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Ysariel.FirstName} challenges you to swear an Unbreakable Pact of Brotherhood with <<P:Ysariel>>, or threatens you with righteous violence, if you refuse. How do you respond?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_698@BODY_FOOTER@KARISSA_BOUND"
msgstr "{Karissa.FirstName} turns around and winks at you with a hot sigh. \"Well, my big <<PlayerLeader{boy/girl}>>, are you coming, or what?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_698@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With an explosion of fire, {Karissa.FirstName} is slain, though not defeated. After a brief pause to catch <<o:Ysariel>> breath, {Ysariel.FirstName} lands before you in all his fallen glory—and <<p:Ysariel>> salutes you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_698@BODY_HEADER@KARISSA_BOUND"
msgstr "With a blaze and a curse, {Ysariel} burns to ash before {Karissa.FirstName} who savors <<o:Ysariel>> incineration with heated breaths. \"Until next time, my handsome Ace...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_698@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Welcome to {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" acknowledges <<p:Ysariel>> . \"You have heeded my summons, for this I offer you my gratitude. However, be you my <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>, or be you my enemy? Prove your intent now: swear a 'Pact of Brotherhood' with me—swear it upon your immortal soul—so we may restore the forsaken order of the {EventRealm}, together. But if you dare refuse me, I shall smite you down!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_698@BODY_LORE@KARISSA_BOUND"
msgstr "{Karissa.FirstName} grabs a handful of <<o:Ysariel>> ashes, softly kisses it in <<o:Karissa>> hand before blowing it into the air. Without even acknowledging you, <<p:Karissa>> turns away, walks up to the edge of the crater, and basks in the heat of {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} for a moment. Then <<p:Karissa>> stretches her arms wide and releases a wild Scream of Chaos, so loud it reverberates across the realm!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_698@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"By my soul I swear it: We shall be Brothers!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_698@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I swear my soul to no man; yet I vow to restore order.\" [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_698@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Bring it! Smite me you disgraced buffoon!\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_698@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Join <<g:side^n,Karissa.FirstName>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_698@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Challenge {Karissa.Name} instead!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_698@TITLE"
msgstr "{Ysariel.LastName}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_698@TITLE@KARISSA_BOUND"
msgstr "{Karissa.Title}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_765@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Thus you behold the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle of {EventRealm}[/hyperlink], a vast, ancient, diabolical capitol of chaos, carnage, and infernal magicks."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_765@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Nearing the central underground domain, all are overcome by the searing heat of the underworld, and the rancid stench of sulfur and burning flesh."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_765@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "At the very center of the vast cavernous reach there suffers the '{Beast}.' A Hellion titan, who is believed to have once fought against the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlords[/hyperlink] in ages long past. But now, it is chained up and tortured for all eternity. All about it, the furious maddened sounds of battle echo out from every corner of the Pit—the mad Carnage Ritual which all Demonkin here partake to appease their infernal masters."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_765@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I am going to need a bigger army...\" [unitprod/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_765@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Study this devilish atmosphere intently. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_765@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Tap into [mana/] the chaotic atmosphere of the Pit. [chaos/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_765@TITLE"
msgstr "Behold: {EventRealm}!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_767@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Revel in the carnage, you are home!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_770@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "While the {EventStructure} shatters behind <<P:Karissa>>, <<g:face^n,{Karissa.FirstName}>> warps from breathtaking beauty to maddening fury all in the span of a heartbeat—and you..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_770@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon nearing {EventStructure}, a sight like no other burns into your retinas: {Karissa} {Karissa.Title} has arrived here before you!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_770@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Oh, you savage animal, you want to rip me apart,\" <<p:Karissa>> observes, \"I can see it in your eyes, {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Go on, give into the fury, the lust, it is divine! I should know; the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]Chaos Endailon[/hyperlink] released me and I can do so for you too. For I am she: no mere Aspect, oh no, the Chaos, it is me! And this neutered world shall soon know my revolution and be reborn by it! Ha! Hahaha!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_770@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "... Give in, scream! Scream in fury! [chaos/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_770@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "... Avert your eyes from temptation. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_770@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "... Swallow the rage. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_770@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "... Cut through the ravishment: attack!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_770@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "... Call your Sworn Brother to your side!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_770@TITLE"
msgstr "Come Closer"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_779@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Go, rebuild the {EventStructure},\" commands {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"And should you ever face darkness or temptation within the Pit, then call upon me: {Ysariel.Name}, thy sworn Brother!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_779@BODY_FOOTER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Go, rebuild the {EventStructure},\" commands {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"But should you bear challenge to the sanctity of my [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle[/hyperlink], then I shall smite you down!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_779@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"{Player.FirstName}, my <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>!\" exclaims {Ysariel.FirstName} as <<p:Ysariel>> embraces you firmly. \"Together, we are now the last line of defense against the total outburst of evil upon the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_779@BODY_HEADER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "{Ysariel.FirstName} stares at you with wide, vicious eyes shimmering with the fractured light of order. \"Have you come to deliver us from evil? Fool, {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} will destroy you—but I shall refuse no aid.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_779@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Since the destruction of {GLOBAL.GrexolisLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" laments {Ysariel.FirstName}, \"the heinous forces of the {GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are again returned to the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Thus, the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]Chaos Endailon[/hyperlink] has sent forth its vile Aspect to wreak havoc here upon the realm—whose order it is my lonesome charge to uphold. And yea, that {Karissa.Title} be a wicked witch, most foul! <<Cp:Karissa>> must ultimately be slain, for the Pact of the {EventRealm} to hold. But first; I urge you to claim a seat at my [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]fractured Circle[/hyperlink]...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_779@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"{Ysariel.FirstName}, my Brother. Until we meet again.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_779@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"Wait, first tell me what to expect in {EventRealm}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_779@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"By the highest forces of Order [order/], I pledge to restore this Circle!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_779@TITLE"
msgstr "We Are the Last Line"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_780@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Normally, the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Overlords[/hyperlink] never leave their seats unclaimed, especially not the five Chain Cities that hold the {Beast}...\" {Ysariel.FirstName} stares off in a brooding mood, \"They are plotting something, I can sense it...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_780@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the {EventStructure} in your possession, {Ysariel.FirstName} again descends from above and smiles a faint, warm smile, \"Well done, my <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>, welcome to the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle of the {EventRealm}[/hyperlink].\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_780@BODY_HEADER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "With the {EventStructure} in your possession, {Ysariel.FirstName} again descends from above with a cynical frown. \"You succeeded... somehow. Fortune favors you, for now...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_780@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"This Seat is normally reserved for the Chief {GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Bealoroth}[/hyperlink],\" explains {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"Long ago, I granted each [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Overlord[/hyperlink] the right to seat their chosen champions at this {GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Eleven seats there were once, though only four now remain... 'Tis the product of the vile {Karissa.Title}—who has wrecked the Pit with <<p:Karissa>> ceaseless foray—yet, I also suspect some foul ploy on the part of the Overlords..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_780@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"What next, my Brother?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_780@BUTTON_0@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"What next?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_780@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Tell me more about this Circle.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_780@TITLE"
msgstr "Bound By Carnage"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_787@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The awesome and terrible presence of a [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlord[/hyperlink] reaches out to you from the infernal depths of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept]Obbadothan Nether Realms[/hyperlink]. Lo, it is {Balorboss}!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_787@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon entering the smoking ruins of {EventStructure}, a scream comes out at you that shakes the very Azh'Ruun Pit to crumble!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_787@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Run, fool! Run! <<Cp:Balorboss>> is coming for you!\" the voices of a thousand Imps shout out in wicked glee, before their hellish chorus fades into a singular, booming roar that drowns out all:[br/][br/]\"Bwahaha! Too late, you wretched gremlin! It is I: [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink], <<p:Balorboss>> whom mortals call {Bealoroth}—Overlord of Overlords, Ruler of the terrible Nether Realms that lie beneath {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and Chiefest of all Evils! Behold, puny {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, fear me and despair!\" roars <<p:Balorboss>>—terribly so."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_787@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Tremble! Despair! [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_787@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Stand your ground. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_787@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Pha! I laugh in the face of Evil.\" [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_787@TITLE"
msgstr "Baloric Phenomenon"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_790@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink] erupts in a laughter that rocks the cavern floor, \"Bwahaha! If you want the {EventStructure}, then sell me your damned soul for it, fool. Me; {Balorboss}, Overlord of Overlords!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_790@BODY_FOOTER@KARISSA_BOUND"
msgstr "The scorn of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink] roars across the Pit: \"Perish before the power of {Balorboss}, you wretched gremlin. Go get <<P:PlayerLeader>> boys! Bwahahaha!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_790@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Oh, crud! You? Stand against me? Me, [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink]? Get out of here! Go on, shoo!\" bellows the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlord[/hyperlink]. \"Hold now, you are actually serious? You stand... against—ME?!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_790@BODY_HEADER@YSARIEL_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Oh, crud! You? Stand against me? [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink]? Get out of here! Go on, shoo!\" bellows {Balorboss}, before stopping with a hellish grunt. \"Wait. You are... actually... 'pactbound' to that brat, {Ysariel.FirstName}?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_790@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Bwahahaha! You got guts, kiddo!\" grunts [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink]. \"I like guts in my flesh-bound minions. What say you, we make a little deal, eh? You sell me your wretched soul, and in return I shall grant you this {EventStructure} and the awesome Power of Balors! Which is mine to command! Me! For I am {Balorboss}, Demon Overlord of Overlords upon {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and Chiefest of all Evils!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_790@BODY_LORE@KARISSA_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Bwahahaha! Oh I see,\" bellows [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink], \"You are cuckolded by my new nemesis, the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]Chaos Endailon[/hyperlink]! And now you think yourself a real big-shot, eh? Well, his {Karissa.Title} may have ruined my {EventStructure}... and defeated that weakling {GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept.Hyperlink} who I assigned to it, earlier... and... and all: BUT I DON'T CARE!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_790@BODY_LORE@YSARIEL_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Pha!\" grunts  [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink], \"{Ysariel.FirstName}? That delusional savior? No one takes <<P:Ysariel>> seriously, anymore. And why should we? If it wasn't for that wretched pact we signed—after the Hellion Wars—why, <<p:Ysariel>>'d be smoldering in hellfire by now! Though, I got to admit, that boy knows <<o:Ysariel>> way with the sword. Oh yeah, <<p:Ysariel>> has kept the Carnage going for... duh... eons? Ages? I lost count—and also, I don't care! <<Co:Ysariel>> death is nigh! And <<o:Ysariel>> pitiable, wretched soul is mine! Mine, you hear me? MINE!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_790@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"{Balorboss}, my Infernal Master! At last, I have found you!\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_790@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I do not fear you! This city shall be mine.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_790@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Call upon your Sworn Brother, {Ysariel.FirstName} to aid you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_790@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "Pray to the Higher Forces of Order for protection!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_790@TITLE"
msgstr "Pact With the {Balorboss}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_791@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Go forth, my Minion! Slay them! Slay them all, dammit, I cannot wait to see you do it!\" applauds [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink]. \"Here, take {EventStructure} and make me proud! I BELIEVE IN YOU, KID! Wreck 'em all good for me!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_791@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Oh, crud! You are serious! Bwahahahaha! YES! Yes! Yeah!\" booms the voice of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink] through the chasm of the {EventRealm}. \"All souls belong to me! For I am {Balorboss}!!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_791@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We're gonna do this!\" shouts [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink]. \"Listen up kid, this Pit is mine! Mine I tell you! And there is nothing I hate more than a world WITHOUT CARNAGE! You hereby signed your wicked soul over to me—and so bind an Unbreakable Pact with a mighty Demon Overlord from the great terror world, that is the Netherrealms of Obbadoth! Serve me well, and the Power of Balors shall be yours to command!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_791@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Hail {Balorboss}! My Demon Overlord!\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_791@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Wait, not my soul? What have I done?!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_791@TITLE"
msgstr "Pact With {Balorboss}: Signed and Sealed"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_793@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "And suddenly, the presence of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink] vanishes from the Pit. Just like that."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_793@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With a warcry that rocks the Pit, {Ysariel.Name} descends from above: \"Be gone, foul demon! Remember our Pact!\" <<p:Ysariel>> shouts, as <<p:Ysariel>> swoops down with <<o:Ysariel>> bright, flaming sword in hand!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_793@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "It remains awfully silent as it seems [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink] is reluctant to answer... But then <<p:Balorboss>> shouts out aloud: \"CRUD! Crud! Cruuuuuuuuud!\" roars {Balorboss}. \"Damn you, {Player.FirstName}! The Pact of {EventRealm} prevents me from slaying a Sworn <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>> of {Ysariel.FirstName}! Damn <<P:Ysariel>>! Damn <<o:Ysariel>> pitiable, wretched soul! It is mine! MINE! Mine, I tell you!—Wuaaaaargh!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_793@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Good riddance! {Balorboss} is defeated.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_793@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Shrug in indifference. | DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_793@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"{Balorboss}? My Master, no! Return to me, please!\" [evilact/] | DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_793@TITLE"
msgstr "Ysariel Summoned: Pissed Angel!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_798@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Hold the {EventStructure} at all cost,\" commands {Ysariel.FirstName}, \"then fuel this realm with Carnage! Aye, 'tis a wicked quest, but take heart my <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>, thine prey be the scum of chaos; so show them no mercy!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_798@BODY_FOOTER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Hold the {EventStructure} at all cost,\" commands {Ysariel.FirstName}, \"then fuel this realm with Carnage! And remember, thine prey be the scum of Chaos; so show them no mercy!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_798@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The {EventStructure} keeps the {Beast} in place, while the Carnage Ritual keeps the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlords[/hyperlink] at bay. These are the duties upheld by the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle of {EventRealm}[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_798@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Great Evils[/hyperlink] of this place are contained here by the pact I signed with them, long ago,\" scorns {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"{GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is an ancient and powerful [hyperlink,GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept]World[/hyperlink], whose diabolical magic comes from the repulsive energies of Carnage. It feeds the Overlords and thus sates them enough to remain here. But, should the Carnage Ritual ever cease... then our pact shall be made undone. And the Demon Overlords shall be freed from the confines to, once again, sate their vile hunger upon the {GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept.Hyperlink}!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_798@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Trust in me, my Brother!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_798@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"I will consider this.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_798@BUTTON_5@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"It will be done.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_798@TITLE"
msgstr "Show Them No Mercy"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "With the currents stabilized a grim realization dawns on you both. \"Our labor is not yet completed,\" acknowledges {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"It is time we rid this precarious order of its final threat.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@BODY_FOOTER@KARISSA_SLAIN"
msgstr "DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@BODY_FOOTER@KARISSA_SLAIN_OR"
msgstr "DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the last sacrifice of Carnage made, an alien tranquility betides the Pit, followed by stern praise, \"Glory be, <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>,\" chimes {Ysariel.FirstName}, \"the duty is done.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@BODY_HEADER@KARISSA_SLAIN"
msgstr "DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@BODY_HEADER@KARISSA_SLAIN_OR"
msgstr "DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@BODY_HEADER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "With the last sacrifice of Carnage made, an alien tranquility betides {EventRealm}. While the chaotic energies of carnage paradoxically tranquilize in a strange, orderly way, {Ysariel.FirstName} appears silently beside you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "For a strange, still moment, {Ysariel.FirstName} and you can clearly comprehend the vile magical currents of {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} harmonize. In so doing, Ysariel's breathing deepens into bitterness. \"I have not sensed such order in the Pit like this for a long time...\" laments Ysariel, with a grim sigh, \"It—angers me somehow, yet I do not know why.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@BODY_LORE@KARISSA_SLAIN"
msgstr "DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@BODY_LORE@KARISSA_SLAIN_OR"
msgstr "DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Draw upon the strange, stabilized aura of tranquil Carnage. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Let your scholars study this perfect paradox of orderly chaos. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Pray to Higher Forces for protection in the upcoming battle. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@TITLE"
msgstr "Show Them No Mercy: Ritual Sated"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@TITLE@KARISSA_SLAIN"
msgstr "DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_799@TITLE@KARISSA_SLAIN_OR"
msgstr "DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_801@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Yea, <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>,\" admits {Ysariel.FirstName} fiercely, \"I battled the Hellions beside the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlords[/hyperlink] to earn their trust. And upon our victory, I stated my case, and bargained... and bargained, until they relented. Thus, Throne I became. Though, my false brothers in Emnora spat me out for it!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_801@BODY_FOOTER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "{Ysariel.FirstName} glances at you sideways with a secretive scornful frown. \"The rest is history, I am now Throne of a [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle of paramount importance[/hyperlink], and we must forthwith restore it.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_801@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Ysariel.FirstName} eyes you with a deep rooted spot of sorrow. \"After the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.TheFracturingLoreConcept]Cataclysms[/hyperlink] that shook the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} sought to contain the unchecked powers of wizards and their calamitous ilk.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_801@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} was an utter cesspool of wickedness, back in those days,\" curses {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"Ceaseless, was the warring of Demons and Hellions, and all the Carnage fed them all with incredible power. Left to their own devices, the spawn of evil threatened to outrival even the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}! Thus, I came here, intent on establishing a {GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept.Hyperlink} that might control the scourge. Alas, that the High Council already had forsaken this mission, long ere it ever began... Still, I persisted. And, against all odds, I achieved what none in Emnora thought possible!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_801@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"What next, my Brother?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_801@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Even the worthiest cause may be undone by wicked deeds.\" [order/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_801@TITLE"
msgstr "Deliberations of Evil"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_809@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Yea, the {GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept.Hyperlink} has struck the hour!\" cheers {Ysariel.FirstName} Judgment is come for the {Karissa.Title}. Let us expel <<P:Karissa>> forthwith!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_809@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Go now, <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>\" affirms {Ysariel.FirstName} with a cordial smile. \"For it is not yet the time for celebrations and partings.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_809@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Now is the hour that we must strike the {Karissa.Title}\" proclaims {Ysariel.FirstName}. \"Though <<p:Karissa>> might be an immortal {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, <<o:Karissa>> defeat here shall banish <<o:Karissa>> spirit from {EventRealm} and so allow us to seal <<o:Karissa>> away for good.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_809@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Judgment cometh!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_809@TITLE"
msgstr "Onwards to Victory"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_810@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Ysariel.FirstName} sniffles away <<o:Ysariel>> hot tears, as <<p:Ysariel>> stands before you. \"I relieve you of our Pact, my valiant <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>. Go now from this wretched place. Yet... though you be free, know this: I shall pray in earnest that we might meet again, one day.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_810@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"<<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>!\" exclaims {Ysariel.FirstName} as <<p:Ysariel>> races forward to embrace you. \"Glory! Glory, we have done it! We have saved the Pit, and you have saved us all!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_810@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "{Ysariel.FirstName} suddenly stops before you, trembling all over. \"Yea, thus my labor as Throne continues, and my sacrifices were not in vain... thanks to your efforts. All the {GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept.Hyperlink} should owe you their eternal gratitude, though they likely will never show it. But hearken to this <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>, silent deeds of righteousness are the foundation upon which all bright futures are built. Regardless, I bid you go forth and take pride; boldly tell others of our deeds here today.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_810@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Embrace your Brother, one last time."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_810@TITLE"
msgstr "Forsaken, yet Unbroken"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_813@BODY_FOOTER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Go, tell them of your victory here today. I shall continue my solemn watch of {EventRealm} as its Throne.\" With that, {Ysariel.FirstName} reaches out <<o:Ysariel>> hand and regards you with reverence."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_813@BODY_HEADER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "As the old order returns to {EventRealm}, {Ysariel.Name} presents himself before you with a solemn frown and a curious twitch in his cheek."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_813@BODY_LORE@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"{Player.Name},\" begins <<p::Ysariel>> \"I was wrong about you. You did what I could not... Resist the pull of evil, persist against all odds, and thus establish a virtuous order upon a realm bound by malicious chaos.\" {Ysariel.FirstName} pauses for a moment to swallow <<o:Ysariel>> pride and swelling tears. \"You have indeed come to deliver us all from evil and for this, I am ever grateful. As, I am sure, all the Worlds Within will be.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_813@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"Order has been restored on Obbadoth.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_813@TITLE@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "Unyielding Virtue"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_814@BODY_FOOTER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"\"Yea, the {GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept.Hyperlink} has struck the hour! Judgment is come for the {Karissa.Title}. Expel <<P:Karissa>> forthwith!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_814@BODY_HEADER@ORDER_BOUND"
msgstr "\"Go forth, ye Paragon of Order,\" commands {Ysariel.FirstName} with swallowed pride, \"the Pit still needs our blades drawn.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_826@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Istarnech.FirstName} looms slowly closer to consume your gold [gold/], even where you stand! With molten, gold-froth on <<o:Istarnech>> lips, <<p:Istarnech>> grumbles, \"Gold... Gold! Insatiable is the hunger of Istarnech!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_826@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The earth rumbles to footsteps the weight of mountains. Thus, you behold the protector of the {IstarnechCapital}. <<Cp:Istarnech>> who rejected the {GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and stole the knowledge from the {GLOBAL.EternalCouncilLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_826@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{Istarnech.FirstName} hungers for your gold!\" bellows the fiery [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GiantsLoreConcept]Giant[/hyperlink]. \"Your gold, yes! Consume it, I must! Never there is enough. No... never. All is fuel for 'the Eternal Need,' my [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlord of Avarice[/hyperlink]—she, who is born out of pride! [hyperlink,GLOBAL.TraitorKingsLoreConcept]Traitor King[/hyperlink] of {GLOBAL.MyrridaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, men call me—[hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Prince of Greed[/hyperlink]. {Istarnech.Name} is my name, and your damned gold, I must devour!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_826@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Here, take my gold [gold/]. Eat it!\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_826@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Hmmm, maybe just... a little gold [gold/]?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_826@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Hold! Take this trinket, instead.\" | DEPRECATED"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_826@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"Starve, foul Traitor King!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_826@TITLE"
msgstr "Rex Hoarder: Beware His Wolves!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_843@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Walburgis.FirstName} stands before you, and <<p:Walburgis>> is foul! Foul to behold, but oh so desirable. For <<o:Walburgis>> power! The power that <<p:Walburgis>> can grant you? It is irresistible... or is it? The choice is yours:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_843@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Just like that, {Walburgis.Name}, {Walburgis.Title} of the {WalburgisRace} and protector of the {WalburgisCapital} appears before you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_843@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "A soft, fatherly voice speaks from behind you, it whispers: \"Do you offer me love? Or do you offer me war?\" The {Walburgis.LastName} speaks to you without making a sound, even though a vile spume of black blood gurgles out of <<o:Walburgis>> filthy, filthy mouth as it eerily stutters along to the words caressing in your ears."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_843@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I offer you love [influence/], not war!\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_843@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Do not answer him..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_843@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Nothing but war, never love!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_843@TITLE"
msgstr "You Will Not Be Saved!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_845@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "<<Cp:DaDaYo>> looks at you and grins the grin of a devil, then <<p:DaDaYo>> shouts out aloud: \"Idle hands are my favorite plaything, so let me whip them up for you.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_845@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{DaDaYo.Name} and protector of {DaDaYoCapital} jumps before you at the crack of a whip! <<Cp:DaDaYo>> looks at you and smiles a broad, toothy smile the size of a shark's mouth."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_845@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Welcome to the Infernal Jungle, pup,\" grins {DaDaYo.FirstName}. \"Here, we always welcome fresh meat, because they all grind down so easily! Save for absolute loafers and lazybones, the despicable taint of which I sense to be awfully present amongst your {PlayerRace}...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_845@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Refuse {DaDaYo.FirstName} near your people."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_845@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"{Ysariel.FirstName}! My Sworn Brother!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_845@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"{Karissa.FirstName}! My One and Only Mistress!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_845@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"{Balorboss}! My Demon Overlord!\" [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_845@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"Stay your whip, foul fiend. To war!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_845@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Allow {DaDaYo.FirstName} to grind a segment of your people down... [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_845@TITLE"
msgstr " Breakneck Bustler"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_884@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"After all,\" whispers {Ysariel.FirstName} as <<o:Ysariel>> soul erupts in flame, \"who cares if my star should fade... in a [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept]sea of millions[/hyperlink]...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_884@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Without any warning, the flickering presence of {Ysariel.FirstName} enters your awareness. <<Cp:Ysariel>> is defeated, yet strangely, <<o:Ysariel>> soul slowly burns out of existence."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_884@BODY_HEADER@ANTAGONIST"
msgstr "Thus, the flickering spirit of {Ysariel.FirstName} enters your awareness. {Ysariel} is defeated, yet strangely, <<o:Ysariel>> soul slowly burns out of existence."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_884@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{Player.FirstName}...\" the flickering voice of {Ysariel.FirstName} speaks to you. \"I have failed... My mission ends now, and with it, my sinful soul must finally burn in the Nether Realms, for I signed it away to [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Bealoroth}[/hyperlink] to earn my throne of torment... Our mission is lost, {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Go, abandon all, while you still can! Warn {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and leave me to my doom...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_884@BODY_LORE@ANTAGONIST"
msgstr "\"{Player.FirstName}...\" the flickering voice of {Ysariel.FirstName} speaks to you. \"I have failed... My mission ends now, and with it, my sinful soul must finally burn in the Nether Realms, for I signed it away to [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Bealoroth}[/hyperlink] to earn my throne of torment... Forgive me, mighty {GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, may all faithful curse my name. The Demon Overlords are come.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_884@BODY_LORE@YSARIEL_BOUND"
msgstr "\"{Player.FirstName}... my <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>...\" the flickering voice of {Ysariel.FirstName} speaks from your heart. \"I have failed... My mission ends now, and with it, my sinful soul must finally burn in the Nether Realms, for I signed it to [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Bealoroth}[/hyperlink] to earn my throne of torment... Our mission is lost, <<PlayerLeader{Brother/Sister}>>. Go, abandon all, now you still can. Warn {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, but leave me to my doom...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_884@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Abandon all hope."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_884@BUTTON_0@YSARIEL_BOUND"
msgstr "\"I do, my Brother!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_884@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Well, I certainly don't.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_884@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Bwahaha, Balorboss awaits you arrival Fallen Archon. Burn!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_884@TITLE"
msgstr "One Less Light"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_888@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Karissa.FirstName} flashes <<o:Karissa>> maddening eyes. \"Show me your {GLOBAL.ChaosConcept.Hyperlink}, big <<PlayerLeader{boy/girl}>>: give in to it completely, then scream your heart out into its cosmic blaze! We'll find each other there...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_888@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "You walk up to {Karissa.FirstName} who bites <<o:Karissa>> lip with a wicked grin to see you. \"Hmm... Do you have what it takes? I cannot yet tell, how... 'exciting.'\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_888@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Ah. Chaos,\" sighs {Karissa.FirstName}, releasing <<o:Karissa>> lip, \"this world is brimming with it, yet its true potential has long been neutered by the stranglehold of Order. I have come to break its chains, and all are welcome to join. Yes, everyone, even you! Yes... well... if you can handle the heat—if you can handle... me.\" Karissa takes a suggestive step back as her whole body ignites in flames."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_888@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will find you there!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_888@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Release a wild Scream of Chaos!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_888@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"There is not enough room on Obbadoth for us both. Test me at your peril!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_888@TITLE"
msgstr "Fiery Overture"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_889@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{Karissa.FirstName} flashes <<o:Karissa>> eyes and pouts <<o:Karissa>> lips in feigned innocence. \"How would you like to... tear asunder all of {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and rebirth it—together—with me?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_889@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Upon expanding your {GLOBAL.ChaosConcept.Hyperlink}, a hot, familiar sensation caresses your mind. And with a wild whoosh of flame and mad cackles, {Karissa.FirstName} appears again before you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_889@BODY_HEADER@CHAOS_HURLANT"
msgstr "{Karissa.FirstName} stands back with awe as she beholds your wild Scream of Chaos, before flashing <<o:Karissa>> ravenous eyes at you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_889@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Yes!\" cheers {Karissa.FirstName} as <<Cp:Karissa>> fixes <<P:Karissa>> whole attention onto you. \"Oh, my Roaring One,\" teases <<p:Karissa>>, \"I just now sensed your distinct, vigorous signature in the great cosmic blaze and instantly knew you had stayed true...\" {Karissa.FirstName} glances away with a queer smile while <<p:Karissa>> toes the floor, before concluding in a whisper, \"...to me.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_889@BODY_LORE@CHAOS_HURLANT"
msgstr "\"Yes...\" <<p:Karissa>> snarls, \"Yes! Give it to me, my Roaring One. You are the stimulant I have been longing for, another Primal Being brimming with pure chaos! I just love it! Oh, how I love to hear you roar... for me: for '{Karissa.LastName}.'\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_889@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I would love nothing more!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_889@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Demand {Karissa.FirstName} to explain <<r:Karissa>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_889@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Cease your farcical advances, vixen. I shall destroy this realm alone!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_889@TITLE"
msgstr "Chaos Hurlant"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_906@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"So we burn it!\" laughs {Karissa.FirstName}. \"Raze and dismantle the five Chain Cities holding their {Beast} in place! Then we unleash it upon {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and burn this [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle[/hyperlink] down! Burn it all down!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_906@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{Karissa.FirstName} cackles louder and louder until <<o:Karissa>> furious love fills your heart. Through it, a liberating spirit flares up from within, maddening you with an uncontrollable, violent urge to rage!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_906@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Yes! Yes! Yes!!\" screams {Karissa.FirstName} with a deranged grin. \"Let's skip the coquetry my Roaring One. {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink} was once a world utterly rife with chaos, but since the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} choked the virility out of it, why; the Fiends here have become but... impotent little imps. All ages since, the sullen tyranny of 'Archon Order' has subdued the true potential out of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, and this simply can no longer do...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_906@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Yes, I love it!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_906@TITLE"
msgstr "Break the Chains: For the Fury!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_907@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As the {Beast} regrows its strength, and {EventRealm} lies in shambles, a great sensation of ruinous pride enters your heart. Victory is near."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_907@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With all the Chains broken, the {Beast} writhes and roars in its Pit. Ages of torment have weekend the Hellion Titan, but—in time—its power shall be regained."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_907@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Wicked fool!\" shouts the anguished voice of {Ysariel.Name}, \"You know not what you have done! This act spells doom for the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} at large, do you not see this? Soon, the Demons shall again feast upon the {GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept.Hyperlink} without mercy. However, so long as my Throne still stands. [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept]Allfather's[/hyperlink] wrath shall be rendered upon you!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_907@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Laugh [morale/] at <<o:Ysariel>> misfortune and empty threats."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_907@TITLE"
msgstr "Unfettered and Furious"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1229_946@BODY_LORE@YSARIEL_DEFEATED"
msgstr "\"Wicked fool!\" screams the anguished spirit of {Ysariel.Name} out from the fiery abyss below, \"You know not what you have done! This act spells doom for the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} at large, do you not see this? Soon, the Demons shall again feast upon the {GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept.Hyperlink} without mercy. And made enemy of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demonic Overlords[/hyperlink]. They shall come for you, as will the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1004@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Though we must not underestimate {Symon}, {PlayerLeader},\" {EventPlayer} adds, still agitated. \"<<Cp:Symon>> has become a true master of the arcane.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1004@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "From within the turmoil of the swarming ethereal armies of the Eldritch Leviathan, a single voice calls out to {EventPlayer}, gentle and familiar."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1004@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{EventPlayer}, my love,\" the voice says, while the figure of an Elven woman —{EventHero}!— comes into focus. \"Why did you leave me on the Cliffs of Sordünn? We could have lived... happily ever after.\"[br/][br/]But lo! It is only an Astral apparition, mocking reflection of <<ge:grievous past^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>>. For a long moment {EventPlayer} is struck motionless, with unseeing eyes. But then they light up with anger. \"That foolish boy,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> grumbles, while waving about as if it could disperse the illusion. \"Those years of isolation must have untaught all <<o:Symon>> manners.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1004@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to deal with <<ge:phantasms^p,{Symon.FirstName}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1004@TITLE"
msgstr "Love and Mirrors"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1008@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Receive the {EventTome}, {PlayerLeader},\" {EventPlayer} declares solemnly. \"May it aid you in ending this crisis.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1008@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Only moments after {Symon} left, disappointed, {EventPlayer} reaches out to you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1008@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I am glad, {PlayerLeader},\" {EventPlayer} says with a smile, \"that it was you who sought me out on that barren Astral island. For not many would have breasted the waves of the Eldritch Leviathan like you did, nor resisted <<ge:compelling offer^n,{Symon.FirstName}>>.\"[br/][br/]\"I was never your master, my friend, but I have one last arcane secret to offer. Knowledge, that for ages was only reserved for the chairmen of the <<m:{GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>>.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1008@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Accept the {EventTome}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1008@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Ask {EventPlayer} to indulge in your own arcane research [knowledge/] instead."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1008@TITLE"
msgstr "Cosmic Initiation"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1013@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer} is breaking <<ge:spell^n,{Merlin.FirstName}>>, waking up the {EventStructure}!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1013@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.AstralFlowsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} start to converge near {EventCity}, where the {EventStructure} rests in enchanted sleep. They carry the echoes of <<ge:voice^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>>:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1013@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Disperse, Astral anchor,[br/]let the mana flow unbound.[br/]Shower the sleeper in the sea[br/]with the shards of your falling star.[br/]How disenchanting!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1013@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Hurry up with the creation of new Astral anchors."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1013@BUTTON_0@SWITCHED_SIDES"
msgstr "Continue your assault on the remaining Anchor Cities."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1013@TITLE"
msgstr "Astral Disjunction"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1016@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer} collapses, <<o:EventPlayer>> chronosphere rolling down a slope."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1016@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With all <<o:EventPlayer>> illusions and magical wards shattered, {EventPlayer} <<r:EventPlayer>> breaks down on <<o:EventPlayer>> knees."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1016@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I guess that's it,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> calls out, gasping for breath. \"Serves me right for trying to be the good kid for too long. Did you ever baby-sit a Leviathan?\" {EventPlayer} tries to laugh, but <<o:EventPlayer>> voice cracks.[br/][br/]\"But now our fates are too intertwined; I cannot leave. It's a shame—I'll never reach that Empire... of the Ex...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1016@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"It is over.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1016@TITLE"
msgstr "The Broken Avatar"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1067@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "What remains is the image of <<ge:perturbed face^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>>, like you first saw it on that barren isle within the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, imprinted on your memory."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1067@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Encircled by nightmares and enemies, {EventPlayer}, the dethroned arbiter of Evermore, closes <<o:EventPlayer>> eyes to meditate."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1067@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "The tentacles underneath <<ge:mantle^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>>, previously kept calm and in check, suddenly lash out in all directions. Yet they become obstructed by a barrier of light sparking up around {EventPlayer} within a split second.[br/][br/]This sphere of confinement, where [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept]Urrath's[/hyperlink] hold assaults the labyrinthine wards of <<ge:mind^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>>, floats up into the air like a bubble, until it vanishes through an Astral Rift."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1067@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"We have failed...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1067@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"It was a necessary sacrifice.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1067@TITLE"
msgstr "Abjuration Sphere"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1071@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "From <<ge:broken staff^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>>, rampant vines begin to sprout, growing into vegetal shelters around {EventPlayer.FirstName} and other {EventRace}. The shelters pulse with a green light; thereafter left empty."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1071@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Seeing <<o:EventPlayer>> kindred scattered and slain {EventPlayer} sends out a final prayer to <<o:EventPlayer>> goddess."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1071@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"O Great Mother,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> supplicates, \"the Eldritch Leviathan, bane of the Draconians, has returned to wreak havoc on your children. We fought hard to subdue it, but its power is beyond our own, crushing all resistance.\"[br/][br/]{EventPlayer.FirstName} musters <<o:EventPlayer>> last strength to ram <<o:EventPlayer>> staff into the ground. \"I beseech you, Great Mother, save those unworthy of your grace!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1071@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "They are with the Grovetender now."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1071@TITLE"
msgstr "Grovetender's Mercy"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1072@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The sanguine barrier implodes, taking {EventPlayer} to <<o:EventPlayer>> phylactery beyond Evermore."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1072@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Even with <<o:EventPlayer>> limbs dangling from a twisted and mangled body, the skull of {EventPlayer} still shows a vicious smile."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1072@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We are wasting our time here,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> declares, while drawing in blood from the surrounding sunless lands. \"The Horn of the Dead remains untraceable—for now. But death is patient; it will be reclaimed eventually.\" The conjured blood coalesces around {EventPlayer.FirstName}, forming a sanguine barrier. \"Despair not, my mindless minions,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> ends <<o:EventPlayer>> speech, \"for you will rise again in my name when the next Blood Moon dawns.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1072@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Damned be that lich."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1072@TITLE"
msgstr "Death Eternal"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1089@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"If you want to find me, ask your {EventRace} friends about Gylamir.\" Then {EventPlayer} teleports away to the Leviathan, disappearing into the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1089@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Evermore bursts asunder as the Eldritch Leviathan rises from its ancient sleep."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1089@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Now that the creature can be seen in its full otherworldly splendor, everything beside it is reduced to insignificance. Even the ruins of the mighty Wizard's Throne are like dust lost in the gills of this behemoth. As the shockwave of destruction approaches you, you notice a warding sphere spanning around yourself, protection yet prison at once.[br/][br/]{EventPlayer} comes into focus, showing an exculpatory gesture. \"I'll admit it,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> says laughing, \"I have trust issues. But don't feel sour; I won't forget that I owe you one.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1089@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Curse that little weasel."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1089@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Remember <<o:EventPlayer>> last words, {EventPlayer} owes you; big-time."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1089@TITLE"
msgstr "Awakening"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1090@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer} raises <<o:EventPlayer>> grimoire and you feel yourself being pulled away, rushing through [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AstralFlowsLoreConcept]Astral Currents[/hyperlink] until you see that barren rock where you first found {EventPlayer}..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1090@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Producing a last, dulled squeal, the Eldritch Leviathan comes to rest beneath Evermore, returning to its deep slumber."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1090@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"It is done,\" {EventPlayer} declares, the tentacles underneath <<o:EventPlayer>> coat calmly adrift. \"Now the time of vigil will begin; while someone needs to attend to poor {Symon}. <<Cp:Symon>> collapsed the moment the Leviathan fell silent.\"[br/][br/]\"As for you, {PlayerLeader}, it seems the trust in you was misplaced. I suggest you think about what you did today.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1090@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "This is the end of this journey."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1090@TITLE"
msgstr "Deep Slumber"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1143@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Footer"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1143@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Hiding in their fortified burrows, the {EventRace} at last recognize the familiar faces among your troops and send forth their leader, {EventHouseLord}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1143@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Bless the lords of plenty!\" {EventHouseLord} calls out overjoyed, hugging those who can't escape <<o:EventHouseLord>> reach. \"We heard of your grand feats against the Pale Ones in this undelightful, so very undelightful time of strife. You are surely looking for our heroic protector, Mister {EventPlayer}? You will find him down the tunnel {EventDirection} {EventHouse}.\"[br/][br/]\"But before you hurry along,\" {EventHouseLord} adds quickly, as if <<p:EventHouseLord>> truly feared your departure, \"I must insist that you taste our {EventFood}! It's due time for luncheon after all.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1143@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Inspect {EventHouse} for further negotiations—and {EventFood}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1143@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "End the conversation with {EventHouseLord} for now."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1143@TITLE"
msgstr "Meeting Hard-Pressed {EventHouse}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1177@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "A nightshade sprouts, enclosing {EventPlayer} in a single black berry. Then the berry disappears—plucked by the fading voice of Onoka, Queen of Whispers."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1177@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With <<o:EventPlayer>> webs severed and {EventPlayer} lured into a deadly trap <<r:EventPlayer>>, a voice begins to whisper, first soft, then biting:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1177@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"O my wither weaver spider[br/]So vulnerable, so frail your legs, eightfold[br/]'Consume her!' they clamor; 'the obloquy!'[br/]But oh! Not my bittersweet, lo![br/]Crawl home, to Witherbloom[br/]Dry my nocturnal tears.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1177@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "<<Cp:EventPlayer>> is gone from the Burrow Downs for good."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1177@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Collect the scattered and abandoned spider eggs. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1177@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Seal the echo of this rhyme within the shadows. [shadow/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1177@TITLE"
msgstr "<<ge:Failure^n,EventPlayer.FirstName>>"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1179@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Fuming and fighting, the giant becomes blobbier and hotter until <<p:EventPlayer>> combusts! And is then devoured whole by [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]{FeyGodName}[/hyperlink]—leaving only a glittering, golden gut."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1179@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Inescapably hungry and angry, {Kana} and {Grump} start clubbing one-another with <<o:EventPlayer>> bare fists."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1179@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You dumb rot, this your fault,\" growls {Kana} chomping on one arm. \"Ow! No, this your fault, lump-brain!\" screams {Grump} as <<p:Grump>> grasps <<g:shoulder^n,{Kana}>> and begins to tear at it. In this way, the giant pummels <<r:EventPlayer>> into blobbier bits, while a hot, fuming glow emanates off <<o:EventPlayer>> outline."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1179@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Sell the gut like a massive gold nugget! [gold/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1179@TITLE"
msgstr "<<ge:End^n,EventPlayer.FirstName>>"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1180@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Reforge the gut into a magic keepsake [item/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1180@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Sacrifice this gut to the cosmic inferno! [chaos/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1183@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "At the unnatural titter of birds, {EventPlayer} is rapidly overgrown and consumed by [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]Ilandra's[/hyperlink] weeds. Leaving nothing behind, but a rich composted heap."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1183@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A shocked tear erupts from <<g:eyes^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>> as a single green sprout emerges from <<o:EventPlayer>> snout."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1183@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"No, no, no,\" growls {EventPlayer.FirstName} as <<P:EventPlayer>> plucks the sprout away. But in an eyeblink, a dozen more pop from <<o:EventPlayer>> skin. {EventPlayer.FirstName} madly claws and tears as many sprouts off <<o:EventPlayer>> body as possible. But it is no good, for every sprout removed, a dozen more emerge, growing twice as fast as the previous."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1183@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Take the magic compost to grow your crops. [food/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1183@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Erect a monument of victory on this spot. [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1183@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Meditate on this spot and feel its vital nutrients. [nature/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1183@TITLE"
msgstr "<<ge:End^n,EventPlayer.FirstName>>"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1185@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Inescapably, the rumbling of {FeyGodName} roars aloud and as it reaches {EventPlayer.FirstName} on the run, it devours <<P:EventPlayer>> instantly, leaving only a single magnificent feather to drop down like an autumn leaf..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1185@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Panic strikes <<g:eyes^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>> as a bright flash strikes in the distance."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1185@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"No, my [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]Duathadae Lord[/hyperlink],\" screeches {EventPlayer.FirstName} as <<o:EventPlayer>> feathers slowly drop off, one by one. \"Not me, do not devour me! Have I not fed your desires for many years? Do I not deserve another chance?\" As feather after feather drops, {EventPlayer.FirstName} realizes no one is listening and bolts off in fear."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1185@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Adopt this feather as a quill for your study. [knowledge/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1185@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Grind this feather into a potent concoction. [mana/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1185@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Absorb this feather into the greater Astral aura. [astral/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1185@TITLE"
msgstr "<<ge:End^n,EventPlayer.FirstName>>"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1187@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Footer"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1187@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Header"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1187@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Lore"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1187@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Oh no!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1187@TITLE"
msgstr "WIP Ham Defeated Event"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1206@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "As mists faded and clouds parted before the shimmering sun, a bright rainbow graced down upon the {EventStructure}. Thus, Pellari rejoiced; the Burrow Downs were saved, at last."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1206@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "In this way, the fearful {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} were warded off and {EventPlayer} emerged before the reclaimed {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1206@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "All around the {EventStructure}, {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and Fey alike raised songs of hope and warding as {EventPlayer.FirstName} scaled its steps. At its summit, <<p:EventPlayer>> emerged alongside {FeyGuideName} to channel [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept]Duatha's dreaming spirit[/hyperlink] through the gifts of the {GLOBAL.GeassadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} to slowly unravel the realm's afflicted nightmare. Powerless against these mounting forces, the[hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]Duathadae's servants[/hyperlink] dissipated like mists before the sun."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1206@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Rejoice!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1206@TITLE"
msgstr "All The Colors of Hope"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1227@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "At the brink of a frenzy, {FeyGuideName} must embrace one of the seasons for the next stage of <<o:FeyGuideName>> Fey life. Where do you steer <<o:FeyGuideName>> volatile struggle?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1227@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Pondering the numerous perils and close escapes on the Burrow Downs, you become dragged into an argument of {FeyGuideName}—with <<r:FeyGuideName>>!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1227@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Master Wizard, oh, oh!\" <<p:FeyGuideName>> moans anxiously, \"it is time for {FeyGuideName} to grow!\" The little sprite stutters and flutters erratically, while <<o:FeyGuideName>> body keeps changing form and colors from morning to evening and back.[br/][br/]\"Spring is my lover, ever young and green.\"[br/]\"Autumn lunges out at my foes, makes them scream!\"[br/]\"Summer kindles my heart, warms my friends.\"[br/]\"Winter bites cold, murders hope, meets their ends!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1227@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Towards the caress of spring."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1227@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Towards the warmth of summer."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1227@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Towards the tumult of autumn."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1227@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "Towards the cruelty of winter."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1227@TITLE"
msgstr "A Seasoned Destiny"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1243@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Now what does a spider do when her victims are caught in her trap?\" {EventPlayer} asks as the {EventUnit} reveals <<o:EventUnit>> terrible visage. \"She feasts.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1243@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "While the rebels valiantly stand their ground against the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]Duathadae's[/hyperlink] disciples, thick mists creep down the Burrow Downs once more, foreboding new ill."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1243@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Scatter, little {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, while you can,\" the insidious words of {EventPlayer} resound from the mists. \"Did you think you could truly challenge the lords upon Witherbloom's throne? They granted you sanctuary, protected you from the cruel wizards beyond. But oh, how naughty [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept]Duatha's[/hyperlink] children have become.\"[br/][br/]\"I have observed the pitiful struggles of the other disciples long enough,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> continues, while the shape of a large stag appears beside <<P:EventPlayer>>. \"They gave me time to spin my threads, weave my spells.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1243@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Defend the rebellion from <<ge:sinister forces^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1243@TITLE"
msgstr "Hour of the Mistcrawlers"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1265@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I suspect you too have come to Evermore to unriddle this enigma,\" the mysterious mage remarks. \"May I interest you then in some exchange of gathered insights?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1265@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Traversing the scarred ruins of Evermore, you come upon a lone mage occupied with the various trinkets strapped to <<o:EventPlayer>> chain belt. At last <<p:EventPlayer>> notices you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1265@BODY_HEADER@CLUES_FOUND"
msgstr "In vain you had followed the footsteps of the mysterious mage throughout Evermore's Shrouded Isles. Now, when you least expected it, he suddenly appears before you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1265@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Well met, stranger,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> calls out, <<o:EventPlayer>> face hidden behind a mask. \"I am a Cosmic Wanderer, searching the {GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept.Hyperlink} for the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EndailonLoreConcept]Astral Endailon[/hyperlink] and exploring how the very fabrics of magic are reshaped by its influence. There is a deeply intriguing anomaly present on this realm. Could it even be...? We must find out the truth in time.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1265@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Let us share knowledge [knowledge/] and solve this mystery together.\" [relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1265@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"I will consider this.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1265@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"I will not trust a stranger hiding behind a mask.\" [relationLvl-3/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1265@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"You are lying. You have plundered Evermore's Shrouded Isles. [casusbelli/] Show your intentions!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1265@TITLE"
msgstr "Traces of Mystery"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_1265@TITLE@CLUES_FOUND"
msgstr "Masked Illusions"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_150@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"You never told me why you sought me out on that barren rock, {PlayerLeader},\" {EventPlayer} asks, suddenly turning to you. \"Or you told me and I didn't listen.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_150@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Evermore. Since you arrived on its Astral shores, an ancient magic washes up, out and over you. {EventPlayer}, after observing from a distance, approaches you at last."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_150@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You too can feel it, {PlayerLeader},\" <<p:EventPlayer>> remarks, gazing afar. \"Despite the passing of ages and disasters, Evermore's spell still befuddles. To the Elves it offered healing; to the <<m:{GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> squandered immortality. To the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept]Shadow Demons[/hyperlink] it was mere sustenance; to me unloved home.\" {EventPlayer} slowly clasps <<o:EventPlayer>> grimoire with <<o:EventPlayer>> corrupted arm. \"The cosmos is ancient and some things are better left undisturbed. Evermore's magic is being meddled with, and we must find out by whom.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_150@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"The devouring winds whispered your name. From the Withered Worlds [matter/] they carried me hither.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_150@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "\"I am your judge [order/], {EventPlayer}. You will atone for your sins.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_150@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "\"I took my chances. [chaos/] Would I twaddle, barter, kill? The die decides.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_150@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"I observed the Astral Flows [arcana/] and foresaw a tsunami...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_150@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"To invite you to the lands of my people [nature/], where the most tormented souls can find healing.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_150@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"I came to herald your nearing end, {EventPlayer}.\" [shadow/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_150@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"I sought guidance in the mastery of the arcane arts [knowledge/].\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_150@TITLE"
msgstr "Tides of Magic"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_154@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The grip loosens, and the world slowly returns into focus. \"Go now,\" {EventPlayer} finishes. \"Study the echoes below the shattered throne. Remember to not remember.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_154@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Master and apprentice,\" {EventPlayer} repeats, rephrasing your words. \"That cannot be. Instead, Evermore itself will be your teacher.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_154@BODY_HEADER@ASTRAL"
msgstr "\"Remarkable,\" {EventPlayer} replies with a smile. \"The {EventRace} should have sought you out in my stead.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_154@BODY_HEADER@CHAOS"
msgstr "\"Curious,\" {EventPlayer} states, \"immensely curious. Yet how do you know your die isn't manipulated?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_154@BODY_HEADER@MATERIUM"
msgstr "\"Then you traveled far, {PlayerLeader},\" {EventPlayer} replies, \"for little more than a mystery.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_154@BODY_HEADER@NATURE"
msgstr "\"A compelling offer,\" {EventPlayer} replies, \"but I would only bring doom to your people.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_154@BODY_HEADER@ORDER"
msgstr "\"By all means, {PlayerLeader},\" {EventPlayer} says with true enthusiasm. \"Observe and judge.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_154@BODY_HEADER@SHADOW"
msgstr "\"Let us hope you are right, {PlayerLeader},\" {EventPlayer} says with gravity. \"It is my greatest desire.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_154@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I was the arbiter of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept]Athla's[/hyperlink] {GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" <<p:EventPlayer>> continues, changing the subject, while you start feeling a nagging strain inside your head. \"I sat there on the Wizard's Throne, seeking cosmic balance. But it was all for naught.\" The strain intensifies, slowly obfuscating your thoughts. \"For I was one with the enemy; [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept]Urrath's[/hyperlink] agent!\" <<ge:clasp^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>> eclipses your self, reduces the world to one voice, <<ge:voice^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>>. \"You must understand, {PlayerLeader}: my words cannot be trusted! My thoughts cannot be trusted!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_154@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Still dazed, prepare to seek out the broken Wizard's Throne."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_154@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Strike back at {EventPlayer}. [mana/] Prove your mind's strength! [xp/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_154@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Speak a prayer [mana/] for <<ge:tormented soul^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>>. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_154@TITLE"
msgstr "The Broken Circle"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_155@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Reaching out to the presence beyond the Broken Throne, you..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_155@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Drawn to the brim of an enormous crater you gaze at a desolation of floating ruins, broken wards, and a shattered tower piercing the sky: the Broken Throne of Evermore."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_155@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Even now, millennia later, the <<m:{GLOBAL.FractureLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> in the {GLOBAL.AstralFlowsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} echo the destruction liberated from within the Wizard's Throne when {EventPlayer} cast the spell that activated the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.SealLoreConcept]Seals[/hyperlink] on {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. However, within the turmoil of flickering magic and mana-draining pulls you can sense a vast presence, intangible yet overpowering. Could this be the voice of Athla calling to you through her [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DreamersLoreConcept]dreams[/hyperlink]?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_155@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "...clutch a creature [unit/] encircling the presence."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_155@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "...tap into the currents [mana/] it provokes."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_155@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "...allow it to act on your consciousness."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_155@TITLE"
msgstr "The Broken Circle: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_193@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"And if we explore the Shrouded Isles,\" {EventPlayer} concludes <<ge:words^p,{EventHero.FirstName}>>, \"we may find the source of the Astral disturbances. {PlayerLeader}, are you ready to comb through Evermore's most well-guarded secrets?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_193@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"To summarize:\" {EventPlayer} at last responds, \"your people came to {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, conjured secret islands with Evermore's wizards—and none of this was found out thereafter? Remarkable.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_193@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We know how to keep our secrets,\" {EventHero} replies, raising <<o:EventHero>> plumy eyebrows. \"As for the <<m:{GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>>, our agreement ensured their own mortal discretion. Nevertheless, nothing is safe forever.\" <<Cp:EventHero>> unfolds a map and points at various marked locations: \"These are the Shrouded Gates leading to the Isles hidden beyond Evermore. Someone has started to plunder the arcane secrets guarded within those Shrouded Isles; soon thereafter the Astral disturbances on Evermore began.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_193@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Agree to explore the Shrouded Isles linked to Evermore."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_193@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_194@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Demand [influence/] a pawn [item/] from {EventHero} to pledge for <<o:EventHero>> truthfulness."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_194@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "Inquire [knowledge/] about the Shrouded Gates and their surroundings."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_203@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Together,\" {EventHero} ends <<o:EventHero>> talk, \"{GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and {EventRace} created the Shrouded Isles, isolated pockets within the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, hidden from the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_203@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "While your people still build up their foothold at Evermore's shores, you find yourself summoned to a meeting with {EventPlayer} and the messenger of the {EventRace}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_203@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"When the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} established their <<m:{GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> throughout the {GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" the messenger, called {EventHero}, begins, \"the Circles' Wizards soon felt the chains of Archon rules and leadership. No longer could they freely explore the secrets of the arcane; no, they had been reduced to mere stewards of Archon order.\" {EventHero} pauses, as if <<p:EventHero>> expecting {EventPlayer} to interrupt <<o:EventHero>> monologue.[br/][br/]Then, <<p:EventHero>> continues: \"My people have a long tradition of preserving and guarding magical secrets. They made an offer to the most ambitious {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of the Circles...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_203@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Await <<ge:reaction^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_203@TITLE"
msgstr "An Ancient Agreement"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_207@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Brace yourself,\" {EventPlayer} ends <<o:EventPlayer>> speech, \"from Karissa's secret Isle one must expect the worst.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_207@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Entering the shadows of the enormous {EventStructure2}, you are joined by {EventPlayer} who beholds the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_207@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"To [hyperlink,GLOBAL.KarissaLoreConcept]Karissa[/hyperlink], the life of mortals was always just a plaything,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> explains, while <<o:EventPlayer>> well hand carefully examines the various glyphs and charms woven into <<o:EventPlayer>> attire. \"Fickle as a flame, she drove her Orcs to uttermost violence—or granted unexpected mercy. To tell the truth, I never understood her loyalty to me during the Second Age. Maybe she had simply decided to like me.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_207@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to enter the Shrouded Gate."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_207@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Karissa's Past"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_211@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The gate to Yaka's Isle is close,\" {EventPlayer} ends, \"though I'm slightly surprised there are no statues of Yaka pointing at its location.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_211@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Standing at the feet of two enormous statues watching over the sand-sunken ruins of {EventStructure}, your are joined by {EventPlayer}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_211@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"This is {GLOBAL.YakaLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" {EventPlayer} explains, picking up a stone fragment of the foremost toe. \"It's how he appeared to the Azrac during the First Age, how he raised the Tigrans during the Second and probably how he set foot on Grexolis during the Fourth Age. The 'God of Fire' was always too concerned with enforcing the worship of his followers to even notice the machinations of his supposed allies.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_211@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to enter the Shrouded Gate."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_211@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Yaka's Past"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_213@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The secret gate of {GLOBAL.FangirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} lies near,\" {EventPlayer} concludes. \"Now that its concealing spell has been broken, it is hidden in plain sight.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_213@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Exposed to the Devouring Winds blowing from the {EventStructure}, you are joined by {EventPlayer}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_213@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"This was the Wizard's Tower of {GLOBAL.FangirLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" {EventPlayer} explains, \"master of earth magic, inventions, and buildcraft—and a friend. He stood against the Conspirator Wizards of Evermore during the Second Age, and again on {GLOBAL.GrexolisLoreConcept.Hyperlink} when they called themselves {GLOBAL.ShadraiFactionLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Long gone are the days when he would drop the use of magic in fear of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ShadowDemonsLoreConcept]Shadow Demons[/hyperlink]. Now, Fangir molds the {GLOBAL.AstralFlowsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, binding the light of the stars in enchanted runes.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_213@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to enter the Shrouded Gate."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_213@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Fangir's Past"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_215@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The secret entrance to Mab's Shrouded Isle lies near,\" {EventPlayer} indicates. \"Things could get muddy in there.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_215@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Climbing down the bleak dungeons leading to the {EventStructure}, you are once again joined by {EventPlayer}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_215@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"These festering halls were once the domain of Mab,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> narrates, while renewing the wards protecting <<o:EventPlayer>> back. \"The Goblins called her 'Mother Mab, but what a cruel mother she was. Only many generations after Mab's departure did the Goblins slowly begin to appreciate things unrelated to filth, anguish, or destruction again.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_215@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to enter the Shrouded Gate."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_215@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Mab's Past"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_217@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"You should move with caution,\" {EventPlayer} warns, \"the unnatural mist near Arachna's gate does not bode well.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_217@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Cutting through the webs surrounding the {EventStructure}, your troops are aided by {EventPlayer}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_217@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Spiders, of course!\" <<p:EventPlayer>> calls out, incinerating the remaining webs with some well-placed fire spells. \"Though it would be a deadly mistake to reduce {GLOBAL.ArachnaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} to her affinity for spiders. Just like her eight-legged denizens, Arachna loves to lure unwary {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} into her traps. As I heard, even {GLOBAL.MeandorLoreConcept.Hyperlink} fell victim to her woven enchantments back on {GLOBAL.AuldwealdLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_217@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to enter the Shrouded Gate."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_217@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Arachna's Past"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_219@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I am surprised that Marinus knew of the Shrouded Isles,\" {EventPlayer} concludes. \"The {GLOBAL.HorwyndLoreConcept.Hyperlink} were very thorough as it seems.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_219@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Carefully prowling through the hostile gloom engulfing the {EventStructure}, your troops find {EventPlayer}, examining the Umbral corruption."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_219@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"How the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GreatUmbralWarLoreConcept]Umbral invasion[/hyperlink] has scarred all {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" <<p:EventPlayer>> says, sighing. \"During the Second Age, this used to be the tower of Marinus and around it lay the pastoral lands of the Halflings. Focused on trade and the riches of the seas, Marinus was one of the few <<m:{GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> who valued peace and prosperity over domination and war.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_219@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to enter the Shrouded Gate."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_219@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Marinus' Past"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_221@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Behind Serena's gate,\" {EventPlayer} warns, \"you will find the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. There is no doubt about it.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_221@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "In the woods enshrouding the {EventStructure}, the vicious growth of the Gloom is spreading like a disease."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_221@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{GLOBAL.SerenaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, alas...\" {EventPlayer}, who suddenly appeared beside your troops, utters. \"You did not deserve this fate. Despite your blind hatred towards most non-Elven races. Despite the treachery committed against [hyperlink,GLOBAL.JuliaLoreConcept]Julia[/hyperlink] and Gabriel. Despite foolishly wandering into the All-Devourer's trap. For no one does.\" The tentacles on <<ge:back^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>> mimic the movements of the Umbral trees."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_221@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to enter the Shrouded Gate."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_221@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Serena's Past"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_223@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Nimue is a powerful {GLOBAL.ShadraiFactionLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" {EventPlayer} warns. \"You must enter her Isle with great caution.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_223@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Following a cliff line of Astral barrens, your troops come upon {EventPlayer}, who is watching the waves."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_223@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The waters have calmed ever since {GLOBAL.NimueLoreConcept.Hyperlink} left {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" <<p:EventPlayer>> remarks, while the devouring winds blow from the {EventStructure}. \"Even within the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle[/hyperlink] she was infamous for her capriciousness and vanity. Some days she bewept the poor souls she had drowned; on others, she raged like a vicious maelstrom. Though all this pales in comparison to the gruesome tales told about the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.TidolonLoreConcept]Enchanted Archipelago[/hyperlink]. The {GLOBAL.ShadowTrialLoreConcept.Hyperlink} must have brought out the worst in her.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_223@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to enter the Shrouded Gate."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_223@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Nimue's Past"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_225@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Be prepared for the uttermost cold,\" {EventPlayer} warns. \"For that is where Artica's creations thrive.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_225@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Amid the frosty {EventStructure}, {EventPlayer} awaits your troops, wrapped up in <<o:EventPlayer>> mantle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_225@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The frozen lands, where blizzards rage and northern lights enchant the skies, have always been the domain of {GLOBAL.ArticaLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" <<p:EventPlayer>> explains, while warding off the freezing wind. \"Her bond with the Frostlings always appeared to run deeper than for most other <<m:{GLOBAL.WizardKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>>. Not only in myths has her relation to the Frost Queens been speculated about. Blood is thicker than water; or ice, in this case.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_225@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to enter the Shrouded Gate."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_225@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Artica's Past"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_227@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Behind the portal we will find,\" {EventPlayer} reflects, \"if this Isle is the doing of Anon—or of someone intent on covering their tracks.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_227@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Climbing the hallowed colonnade up from the {EventStructure}, your troops find {EventPlayer} waiting for them at the top."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_227@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Now, this is an interesting enigma,\" {EventPlayer} explains, while <<o:EventPlayer>> corrupt hand trembles slightly. \"{GLOBAL.AnonLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, whose prophecy foretold my rescue from the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept]Pitiless Void[/hyperlink], is an Archon. Yet the {GLOBAL.HorwyndLoreConcept.Hyperlink} devised the Shrouded Isles to hide knowledge from the {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Then why or how could Anon build a Shrouded Gate on Evermore?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_227@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to enter the Shrouded Gate."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_227@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Anon's Enigma"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_229@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Whatever is happening to Evermore, it shakes the foundations of what is left of the broken island."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_229@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "While you and your allies still search for the source of the Astral disturbances, you come to witness their material impact."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_229@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Ruins crumble, clefts spread through the barren soil, and mountains groan as the entire island of Evermore begins to shake. An otherworldly sound pulses from below, sometimes deep as the ocean, sometimes sharp as a razor, then again whistling in an almost melodic fashion. After a while, the tremors subside and a dead silence ensues."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_229@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Time to hurry up with our search.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_229@TITLE"
msgstr "Cosmic Tremors"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_231@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer} has become an {GLOBAL.EldritchSovereignLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, channeling <<o:EventPlayer>> necromantic powers to raise the deceased Elves of the first ages."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_231@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Carrying the scent of pestilence and decay, long lines of {EventRace} stage the arrival of their grim master {EventPlayer}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_231@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Death to all, and death specifically to you, {Merlin},\" <<p:EventPlayer>> declares with a cold grin. \"You may have denied me my triumph in the Second Age, old man, but even then you were always one step behind. You didn't realize why the All-Devourer liberated the Wizard Kings of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle[/hyperlink], nor did you find the marks of {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} I placed on the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.RevenantsLoreConcept]Archon Necropolises[/hyperlink] throughout {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. Now behold my latest creations, a late gift to the fading lineage of House Inioch.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_231@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Await <<ge:reaction^n,{Merlin.FirstName}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_231@TITLE"
msgstr "The Reaper of Evermore"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_235@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"There is a simple way to learn if Evermore's disturbances are <<ge:doing^n,{Nekron.FirstName}>>,\" {EventPlayer} concludes, staring at you. \"Will you return the {EventRace} to rest?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_235@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Your weakness is not my concern, {EventPlayer},\" {Nekron.FirstName} retorts. \"Where you succumbed, I triumph.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_235@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"What about you, {PlayerLeader}?\" {Nekron.FirstName} asks, suddenly addressing you. \"Why would you follow a 'broken pawn'? Don't mistake me for a servant of {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. A master of death can bestow eternal gifts of <<o:Nekron>> own, and knows many friends throughout the {GLOBAL.WorldsWithinLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, weaving a new Dominion...\"[br/][br/]\"Let's not waste our time here,\" {EventPlayer} cuts off {Nekron.FirstName}, \"{PlayerLeader}, this is one Shrouded Isle less to explore, for you heard what to expect from {Nekron.FirstName} '{Nekron.LastName}'.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_235@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Vow to take down {Nekron} [rs_war/] and contain <<o:EventPlayer>> undead plague."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_235@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Wait how the situation unfolds. There may be other enemies lurking on Evermore."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_235@TITLE"
msgstr "Shrouded Enemies"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_237@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The blood of day and night is fighting to the death,\" the {EventUnit} proclaims with a sadistic grin. \"Who will survive?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_237@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Searching the dungeons below <<ge:broken throne^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>> your troops find a chamber with a still ongoing blood ritual."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_237@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "There is a {SunGuardian} enchained at one end of the chamber and a {MoonGuardian} at the other. Both are trapped within a sanguine bond that is being nourished by a {EventUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_237@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Order the {EventUnit} to be slain and save the {SunGuardian}. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_237@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Order the {EventUnit} to be slain and save the {MoonGuardian}. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_237@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Overcharge the ritual [evilact/] to blood-infuse both guardians. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_237@TITLE"
msgstr "Shrouded Enemies: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_239@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Suddenly {EventPlayer} recedes a step. \"Is that you, {Merlin}?\" <<p:EventPlayer>> shouts, clasping <<o:EventPlayer>> ornate staff more firmly."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_239@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "New life sprouts and blooms on Evermore's desolate soil, as a dignified Draconian druid approaches you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_239@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"May peace be upon you, O foreign mages,\" the druid calls out, endowing you with a white lotus as a token of friendship. \"I am {EventPlayer}, {EventPlayer.Title} of the {EventRace}. The distant heritage of my people has led us to these troubled shores. We seek the echoes of a forgotten age when Evermore was still an ingrained part of Athla.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_239@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Await <<ge:reaction^n,{Merlin.FirstName}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_239@TITLE"
msgstr "An Unexpected Welcome"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_243@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "In all this, you can't shake off the strange feeling that you are being watched and that the destruction witnessed thus far was only the beginning."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_243@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Once again the ruins of Evermore tremble, shaken by a cosmic disturbance of even greater intensity."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_243@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "This time the Astral currents wash over you, pulling your mind to whence they came as they recede. Your mental eye clings to the mountains {EventDirection} {EventCity}, and you conclude that this must have been the epicenter of the disturbance; and hence where you must direct your next moves."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_243@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"It's time to brace ourselves for what is coming!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_243@TITLE"
msgstr "Into the Storm"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_244@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "An eldritch Leviathan is breaking through Evermore's crust, wreaking havoc upon the sundered island."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_244@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Nearing the mountains {EventDirection} {EventCity}, your troops are knocked down by a shockwave of destruction."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_244@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Mountains burst and rocks crumble as a gargantuan creature tears apart the material realm. Its enormous tentacles breach through the {GLOBAL.AstralVoidLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, creating <<m:{EventStructure2}>> in its wake. Even through the thundering destruction you can hear the otherworldly sounds once more, now recognizing them as the bellowing of the creature."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_244@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Assemble your allies."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_244@TITLE"
msgstr "Into the Storm: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_325@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {EventStructure} has resurfaced, breeding destruction and a plethora of ethereal creatures in its wake."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_325@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Another earthquake ruptures Evermore, as the Eldritch Leviathan continues to shake off the overlaying material crust."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_325@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "With each breach the sheer size of the enormous creature becomes more apparent. You remember the words of {EventPlayer}, saying that \"Evermore was once an ingrained part of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}\" and can't help wonder to which degree the Eldritch Leviathan shaped the history and identity of the isle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_325@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to create an Astral anchor."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_325@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Prepare to defend the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_325@TITLE"
msgstr "Eldritch Wake"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_326@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "If no Leviathan Landmark is bound in time, all will be lost!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_326@BODY_FOOTER@SWITCHED_SIDES"
msgstr "Defend the Leviathan Landmarks at all costs!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_326@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Squealing from the Void below Evermore, the Eldritch Leviathan begins to fully awaken."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_326@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Through the ages the Eldritch Leviathan lay hidden beneath Evermore. Now the ravaged isle lies destroyed, scarred by the craters where the colossal body parts have broken through. Even more Astral Sea monsters emerge throughout the realm, drawn into the fight for freedom of their gargantuan ancestor."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_326@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"We must breach through!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_326@BUTTON_0@SWITCHED_SIDES"
msgstr "\"We must endure!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_326@TITLE"
msgstr "Nearing End"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_326@TITLE@SWITCHED_SIDES"
msgstr "Nearing Victory"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_343@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I suggest you don't attempt to stop us,\" the masked mage ends his speech, \"or this will get utterly unpleasant.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_343@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "In vain, you had followed the footsteps of the mysterious mage throughout Evermore's Shrouded Isles. Now, when you least expected it, he suddenly appears before you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_343@BODY_HEADER@MASKED_SYMON_MEE"
msgstr "While the life-or-death struggle against the Eldritch Leviathan rages on, the mysterious mage seeks you out once more, at last determined to show their true colors."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_343@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I guess it is time,\" he says, fiddling with a chronosphere strapped to his chain-belt. \"Since you were all so kind\"—he snaps his fingers and draws in {Merlin}—\"to join me for the Leave-Taking, it would be impolite to not hold a speech.\" He raises a small chalice: \"After many, many years, some spent better, some spent worse, my volumetric inmate and I\"—he gestures towards the Leviathan—\"have decided to break out and leave this inhospitable island.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_343@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Await <<ge:reaction^n,{Merlin.FirstName}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_343@TITLE"
msgstr "Confrontation"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_346@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Neither of you can stop this,\" {EventPlayer} concludes, tossing the emptied chalice to you. \"So don't make this hard on me.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_346@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"No, {Merlin},\" {EventPlayer} responds firmly, \"I cannot trust you on this. No offense; it's the tentacles.\" <<Cp:EventPlayer>> laughs."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_346@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"As for the other [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle[/hyperlink] Wizards,\"—{EventPlayer} waves dismissively—\"I had excessive time to study their petty characters. No, they wouldn't understand.\" {EventPlayer} pauses <<o:EventPlayer>> speech for a moment as the otherworldly squeal of the Eldritch Leviathan can be heard in the distance. \"None can understand,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> then reaffirms, clenching <<o:EventPlayer>> fists. \"All {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} share an intrinsic fear of the incomprehensible. When it comes to the eldritch they know only destruction or domination. But I will prove there is another way...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_346@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "So be it."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_346@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Symon is right!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_346@TITLE"
msgstr "The Avatar of the Leviathan"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_348@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Once {EventPlayer} left, you look around the scenes of devastation and the Broken Wizard's Throne in the distance. And you can't help but wonder: was this a beginning or an end?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_348@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the avatar of the Eldritch Leviathan defeated, the colossal creature slowly succumbs to <<ge:enchantments^n,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>>, returning to its deep slumber."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_348@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"It is done,\" {EventPlayer} declares, the tentacles underneath <<o:EventPlayer>> coat calmly adrift. \"Now the time of vigil will begin; while someone needs to attend to poor {Symon}.\"[br/][br/]\"But all this mustn't be your concern, {PlayerLeader}; not today at least. For today you should rest, recover from the battle for Evermore. Tomorrow, the secrets of the cosmos still await you.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_348@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "A book knows many chapters."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_348@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "All good tales must end eventually."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_348@TITLE"
msgstr "The Avatar of the Leviathan: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_354@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The illusory hordes of {EventPlayer} are launching a final attack on {EventCity}. Defend it at all cost!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_354@BODY_FOOTER@SWITCHED_SIDES"
msgstr "The illusory hordes of {EventPlayer} are launching a final attack on {EventCity}. Join their assault before it's too late!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_354@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With three Astral anchors enchaining the body parts of the Eldritch Leviathan, the colossal creature is beginning to return to its deep sleep."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_354@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "While the movements of the Leviathan calm down, its Avatar {EventPlayer} is mustering <<o:EventPlayer>> full arcane strength, conjuring phantasmal armies to assault the anchor city {EventCity}.[br/][br/]It is a terrifying sight to behold mirror images of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DragonsLoreConcept]Elder Dragons[/hyperlink], <<m:{GLOBAL.GiantKingLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>>, and <<m:{GLOBAL.EldritchSovereignLoreConcept.Hyperlink}>> march side by side, all determined to disrupt the spell cast on the Leviathan."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_354@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Victory is nigh!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_354@BUTTON_0@SWITCHED_SIDES"
msgstr "\"The anchors must be broken!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_354@TITLE"
msgstr "Phantasmal Upheaval"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_359@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Shaken and drained your soul seeks a path through this Astral turmoil, back to Magehaven."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_359@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Evermore bursts asunder as the Eldritch Leviathan rises from its ancient sleep."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_359@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Now that the creature can be seen in its full otherworldly splendor, everything beside it is reduced to insignificance. Even the ruins of the mighty Wizard's Throne are like dust lost in the gills of this behemoth. As the shockwave of destruction reaches you, you look out for {EventPlayer}, but it is already too late."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_359@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"We have failed...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_359@TITLE"
msgstr "Awakening"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_360@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Once {EventPlayer} left, you look around the scenes of devastation and the Broken Wizard's Throne in the distance. And you can't help but wonder: was this a beginning or an end?"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_360@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Producing a last, dulled, squeal the Eldritch Leviathan comes to rest beneath Evermore, returning to its deep slumber."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_360@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"It is done,\" {EventPlayer} declares, the tentacles underneath <<o:EventPlayer>> coat calmly adrift. \"Now the time of vigil will begin; while someone needs to attend to poor {Symon}. <<Cp:Symon>> collapsed the moment the Leviathan fell silent.\"[br/][br/]\"But all this mustn't be your concern, {PlayerLeader}; not today at least. For today you should rest, recover from the battle for Evermore. Tomorrow, the secrets of the cosmos still await you.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_360@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "A book knows many chapters."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_360@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "All good tales must end eventually."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_360@TITLE"
msgstr "Deep Slumber"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_417@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "While <<ge:chatter^n,{FeyGuideName}>> goes on and on, you reflect on the dangerous path ahead. Luckily, you brought some specialists..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_417@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Still befuddled by the flurry of sensations within the {EventStructure}, you hear the chittering voice of your Fey guide, {FeyGuideName}, prancing around you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_417@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"No time to sleep, no time to peep! Make haste, Master Wizard, don't waste your breath. Deep in {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the slow find death.\" The words sputter from <<ge:mouth^n,{FeyGuideName}>> like water from a fountain. Anxiously fluttering up and down, the little sprite awaits a reaction. \"We mustn't stay in the mist. They see, they find, they twist. [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]Our lords[/hyperlink], they love to play. We are the pawns and must obey.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_417@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "The {CultureUnit} [unit/], paragon of your people's military traditions."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_417@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "An undead minion [unit/] bound to my will. [shadow/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_417@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "A heavenly helper [unit/], bringing light to this darkness. [order/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_417@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "An elemental spirit [unit/] unleashed from the Astral flows. [arcana/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_417@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "A fiendish assistant [unit/] used to torment and hell. [chaos/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_417@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "My trusted companion [unit/] \"{PetName}\". [nature/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_417@BUTTON_8"
msgstr "A tireless construct [unit/] without remorse or fear. [matter/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_417@TITLE"
msgstr "Down the Rabbit Hole"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_424@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Rubbing <<r:FeyGuideName>> eyes, {FeyGuideName} looks up with a bitter smirk and finishes <<o:FeyGuideName>> rhyme: \"...I tooks some of your mana.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_424@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With a messy poof and a raspy cough, {FeyGuideName} spirits back into existence beside you, <<o:FeyGuideName>> eyes sullen and coat disheveled."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_424@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "For a brief moment {FeyGuideName} passes you a silent cranky glance. \"Back I am... flim-flam,\" <<p:FeyGuideName>> chatters with a cough, \"bam-bam... peh...\" Then, <<p:FeyGuideName>> dusts off <<o:FeyGuideName>> coat and starts to groom <<r:FeyGuideName>> back into shape, while humming: \"Ri-ma, ra-ma...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_424@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Welcome back.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_424@TITLE"
msgstr "Dawnusk Resprouts"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_427@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Moments later, the area becomes shrouded again. But you have seen enough: the {EventRace} have arrived here first."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_427@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Entering the large cavern with the supposed {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} hideout, the mists briefly clear, revealing a terrible scene."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_427@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Ravaged and caved in, the burrows of the {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} smolder in the dim darkness. Pale figures patrol the pathways, rounding up the surviving {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and forcing them into cages, like animals. At the heart of the gutted hideout, a crude encampment has been raised, adorned with the skull of a stag, dreaded symbol of the {EventRace} and their Scourges."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_427@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Keep a close eye on {FeyGuideName}..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_427@TITLE"
msgstr "A Homely Hideout: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_428@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"They do not grudge, they do not judge,\" the little sprite ends <<o:{FeyGuideName}>> speech, \"{GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} welcome all in their comfy halls.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_428@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Swift, Master Wizard, to the shelter, go, go! <<ge:friends^p,{FeyGuideName}>> dwell near in their cozy burrow.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_428@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "While {FeyGuideName}—through movements and gestures—continues to hurry you along, <<p:{FeyGuideName}>> tells you more about these 'friends' waiting ahead: \"{GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} have fur, feather, claw; tail, snout, beak, paw. From Duatha's oldest dreams they came. They brought her joy, she gave them names. But, oh, nasty things did the Fey, woe betide...! Remaining {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} in the caverns now hide.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_428@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Tell {FeyGuideName} to lead the way."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_428@TITLE"
msgstr "A Homely Hideout"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_434@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Completing <<o:FeyGuideName>> eerie transformation, {FeyGuideName} is determined to take on the {EventRace} and liberate <<o:FeyGuideName>> {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} friends."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_434@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Shaken by the destruction of the hideout, {FeyGuideName} sobs, while <<o:FeyGuideName>> skin and wings begin to change colors."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_434@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Poor friends, here it ends,\" <<p:FeyGuideName>> whines, growing increasingly purple. \"{FeyGuideName} failed. Now the pale ones will take us, break us...\"[br/][br/]\"No!\" <<p:FeyGuideName>> suddenly calls out with renewed fervor and <<o:FeyGuideName>> eyes flash up like ghost lights. \"WE take them, break them, strangle their throats, mangle their coats; sinew and bone, stashed below stone...\" <<ge:voice^n,FeyGuideName>> sharpens, like a cold wind piercing through a shelter's cracks: \"Vile walkers will kneel; peel; squeal. Beweep their ordeal.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_434@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"It is the only way forward.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_434@TITLE"
msgstr "Ghastly Revelations"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_435@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Our rescue must be celebrated!\" <<p:EventUnit>> concludes with irritating elation. \"Do you fancy some honey brew and blackberry pies?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_435@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the {EnemyRace} vanquished, the surviving {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} gather around you, curious and grateful. One of them, a mole, speaks up."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_435@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Friendly hero, you are our savior!\" <<p:EventUnit>> calls out, shaking <<o:EventUnit>> own hands in uncontrollable joy. \"The Pale Ones do us ill. See, poor Maple here got his paws scratched and Sunshine's fur got all squeezed when she was stuffed into that awful cage. And then all the others\"—the mole peeks at the scene of destruction, but quickly turns <<o:EventUnit>> head back, smiling again."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_435@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Say nothing, baffled by the question."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_435@TITLE"
msgstr "Ghastly Revelations: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_533@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The seasons they fly,\" {FeyGuideName} explains, still chuckling, \"on Duatha, winter is always nigh.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_533@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As you continue to follow {FeyGuideName} through the fogged tunnels, a rejuvenating breeze carries the smell of fresh leaves into the underground."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_533@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Oh, spring,\" {FeyGuideName} begins to chant, while mushrooms and moss sprout in large patches where the wind had touched the barren stone, \"new life you bring. You sprang, you sprung; tickled my tongue. Then, like a bee, stung; flung your poisonous dung—while the birds sung to the morning, still young.\" The sprite giggles, blissfully looping the loop."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_533@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"We must learn to adapt to this ever-shifting realm.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_533@TITLE"
msgstr "Beckoning of Spring"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_535@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Deeply grateful, the liberated {EventUnit} joins the fight to rescue <<o:EventUnit>> brethren."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_535@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your troops have forced open a cage of the {EnemyRace} and freed another {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_535@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Oh, praise be the good seasons!\" exclaims the {EventUnit} with great elation. \"We were sure as shucks that we'd end up as [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]Fey Lord[/hyperlink] stew! Thank you stranger, me and my kin are ever at your service!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_535@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"Together, we will tear down the {EventStructure}!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_535@TITLE"
msgstr "Ghastly Revelations: Liberated {EventUnit}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_555@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Great hero,\" the mole explains, turning back to you, \"we will shape our new home to your designs. This city in your honor, how should we adorn it?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_555@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "In this moment, {FeyGuideName} joins the conversation. <<Cp:FeyGuideName>> is back to <<o:FeyGuideName>> happy self again, scurrying and chattering."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_555@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"A feast is good,\" <<p:FeyGuideName>> says, \"but not so soon. How would you feast without cup or spoon? A new shelter is needed, sturdy and tall. To work, quick, quick, then we dance at nightfall.\"[br/][br/]\"{FeyGuideName}!\" the mole calls out in excitement. \"Come, let me cuddle your cheeks, you little snuggle bug!\" After an extensive hug he continues: \"You're right, my friend. We cannot live in this rubble and must reach the surface. The Pale Ones had concealed the path upwards, but their magic is lifted.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_555@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"With rich quartz and gemstones [gold/] from the burrows deep.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_555@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"With enchanted mushrooms and will-o'-wisps [mana/] from your underground gardens.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_555@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"With icons of retained Pellari freedom.\" [influence/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_555@BUTTON_6"
msgstr "\"With the skulls [souls/] of the slain {EnemyRace}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_555@TITLE"
msgstr "A New Shelter"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_557@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"It must not be like this, {EventPlayer},\" {Merlin} says tentatively, \"there is still time to put the Leviathan back to sleep, seek a concerted solution...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_557@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"{EventPlayer}, is that you?\" {Merlin} asks calmly, yet <<o:Merlin>> expression betrays <<o:Merlin>> sorrow. \"I see you have carried a burden far greater than anyone could have asked you to do.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_557@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You do remember me, {Merlin},\" {EventPlayer} replies as <<p:EventPlayer>> dispels <<o:EventPlayer>> mask. \"I am impressed.\" <<Cp:EventPlayer>> shows a sarcastic smile. \"Unfortunately you are late, about one and a half ages late. Though I do not blame you; when you have a whole world to worry about, what is a lone fledgling mage who stumbled upon a creature from the beginning of time? Nothing that can't be sealed away...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_557@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Continue observing their conversation."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_557@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Hear out Symon"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_557@TITLE"
msgstr "Unmasked and Unbound"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_561@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"It's no betrayal when {Merlin} told you to distrust even <<o:Merlin>> thoughts,\" {EventPlayer} concludes with gleaming eyes. \"Say, {PlayerLeader}, are you in for the journey?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_561@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "While your armies clash with the swarming denizens of the Eldritch Leviathan, its declared avatar {EventPlayer} appears before you once more."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_561@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I must apologize, {PlayerLeader},\" <<p:EventPlayer>> begins, inspecting the trinkets on <<o:EventPlayer>> belt chain. \"During our last meeting I only focused on the master, disregarding the apprentice; or whichever title you fancy. {PlayerLeader.Title}?\"[br/][br/]\"What would you say,\" {EventPlayer} continues, \"if I told you there was a whole new world to explore, untouched by [hyperlink,GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept]Magehaven's[/hyperlink] {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and the endless struggle between {GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept.Hyperlink}? I have the knowledge and the vessel, but could use a capable partner. All it takes are some nudges to keep {Merlin} from spoiling our Leave-Taking...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_561@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Join {EventPlayer}. [rs_alliance/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_561@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Stay true to {Merlin} and stopping the Leviathan."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_561@TITLE"
msgstr "The Leave-Taking"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_563@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"If you want to find me, ask your {EventRace} friends about Gylamir.\" Then {EventPlayer} teleports away to the Leviathan, disappearing into the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_563@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With {Merlin} defeated, the enchantments on the Anchor Cities crumble, setting the Eldritch Leviathan free."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_563@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Now that the creature can be seen in its full otherworldly splendor, everything beside it is reduced to insignificance. Even the ruins of the mighty Wizard's Throne are like dust lost in the gills of this behemoth. As the shockwave of destruction approaches you, you notice a warding sphere spanning around yourself, protection yet prison at once.[br/][br/]{EventPlayer} comes into focus, showing an exculpatory gesture. \"I'll admit it,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> says laughing, \"I have trust issues. But don't feel sour; I won't forget that I owe you one.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_563@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Curse that little weasel."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_563@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Remember <<o:EventPlayer>> last words, {EventPlayer} owes you; big-time."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_563@TITLE"
msgstr "The Leave-Taking: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_588@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The {GLOBAL.AstralFlowsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are disturbed,\" {EventHero.FirstName} reads out the ciphers, \"someone is watching us.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_588@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Arriving at the Shrouded Gate, {EventHero} searches the area for traces of <<o:EventHero>> people."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_588@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"We {EventRace} have a long tradition of devising and inscribing magical ciphers,\" {EventHero.FirstName} explains, while <<p:EventHero>> inspects the various stone formations surrounding the portal. \"It is always fascinating to find a message written in a system we stopped using ages ago.\"[br/][br/]\"Ah, yes,\" {EventHero} calls out at last, halting at an eroded rock. \"The portal guardians left us a clue, though it isn't much.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_588@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Memorize the clue."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_588@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Ciphers and Truths"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_591@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"A masked figure approaches,\" {EventHero.FirstName} reads out the ciphers, \"lonesome and tall-grown.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_591@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Arriving at the Shrouded Gate, {EventHero} once again searches the area for traces of the guardians."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_591@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"My people study the mystic teachings following four distinct schools of magic,\" {EventHero.FirstName} explains, while <<p:EventHero>> inspects even the tiniest rocks. \"Each school is seated on a different branch of our mighty Tree of Knowledge. And each school is bound to assign their share of graduates to the duty of guarding Shrouded Isles throughout the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\"[br/][br/]\"Here!\" <<p:EventHero>> suddenly calls out, picking up a pebble. \"Another message.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_591@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Memorize the clue."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_591@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Schools of Magic"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_592@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"A secret is buried beneath this island,\" {EventHero.FirstName} reads out the ciphers, \"deeper than what we guard.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_592@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Arriving at the Shrouded Gate, {EventHero} once again searches the area for traces of <<o:EventHero>> people."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_592@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"For us {EventRace}, the watch over the Shrouded Isles is not merely a duty,\" <<p:EventHero>> explains, inspecting the portal, \"it is a calling. Ages ago, when the cosmos was in turmoil, we bewept the fate of our distant brethren, the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.AncientKrazuraLoreConcept]Krazura[/hyperlink]. They inspired us to preserve what otherwise would have been forgotten.\"[br/][br/]{EventHero} points at a stone plate, ignoring that <<p:EventHero>> is the only one who can decipher its message."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_592@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Memorize the clue."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_592@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: An Avian Legacy"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_594@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"There is no defense,\" {EventHero.FirstName} reads from the pendant, \"against a cosmic barrage.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_594@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Arriving at the Shrouded Gate, you find {EventHero} in a mournful mood."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_594@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"All these {GLOBAL.HorwyndLoreConcept.Hyperlink},\" <<p:EventHero>> says pensively, \"vanished—dead.\" <<Cp:EventHero>> picks up a large pendant buried between the rocks. \"You must know, {PlayerLeader}, that only the most venerated students are elect to become guardians of sun and moon. Their ritual of ascension is celebrated by all {GLOBAL.HorwyndLoreConcept.Hyperlink} during the yearly 'Solunacrum.'\"[br/][br/]{EventHero} dusts off the pendant, which seems to hold another, this time more obviously placed, message."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_594@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Memorize the clue."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_594@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Eclipse"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_612@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The Astral ripples we pursue do not carry the footprints of the Void,\" {EventPlayer} concludes. \"This isn't Fangir's doing, I am certain of it.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_612@BODY_FOOTER@SYMON_REVEALED"
msgstr "\"If we can survive the Eldritch Leviathan,\" {EventPlayer} concludes, \"I will need to search for {GLOBAL.FangirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. I owe it to him.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_612@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At {EventStructure}, your troops find a {EventItem}. {EventPlayer} picks it up."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_612@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"You have chosen a perilous path to walk, my friend,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> says, talking to <<r:EventPlayer>>. \"Do you think you will triumph where the {GLOBAL.UnmakersLoreConcept.Hyperlink} failed?\"[br/][br/]{EventPlayer} hands over the {EventItem}. \"Use this with care,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> remarks, then continues to explain: \"When I shattered the Wizard's Throne to seal Athla, devouring energies not unlike those of {GLOBAL.TheFracturingLoreConcept.Hyperlink} became liberated and scarred Evermore. {GLOBAL.FangirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} must have returned to his Isle during the Fourth Age, investigating this anti-magic I had unleashed.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_612@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Claim {EventStructure} and the Isle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_612@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Fangir's Ambitions"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_614@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"It's an Orrculator Locket,\" {EventHero.FirstName} explains. \"Don't fiddle with its modulations or the guardians won't recognize the message.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_614@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Nearing the Shrouded Gate, your troops are stopped by {EventHero}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_614@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Halt, {PlayerLeader},\" <<p:EventHero>> warns, \"for this Isle has not yet been breached and my brethren still guard its portal. Their codex demands they defend the Shrouded Gate, even against us {GLOBAL.HorwyndLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, but if you show them this token they will grant you free passage.\"[br/][br/]{EventHero} hands you an intricate disk not unlike an astrolabe embedded within a pendant. It displays ornate etchings of celestial bodies, emblems of the four magic Horwynd schools and symbolism related to smithcraft and forging."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_614@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Thank {EventHero}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_614@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Wardens of Sun and Moon"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_618@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer} places the restored tear in a small hole on the ground. The charred plate slides away, revealing the {EventItem}. \"Fascinating,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> says."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_618@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Still standing amid the screaming echoes of {EventStructure}, you notice {EventPlayer} appear, inspecting the frozen shards on the ground."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_618@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"There are not many {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} who are aware of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.KarissaLoreConcept]Karissa's[/hyperlink] elemental origins,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> explains while carefully mending the shattered tear piece by piece. \"I myself never gave the myth much credence that she and {GLOBAL.ArticaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} fell from the skies of {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} within a frozen meteor. But when I saw them fight each other as sisters of fire and ice, I suddenly understood that their fates were intertwined.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_618@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Claim {EventStructure} and the Isle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_618@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Elemental Secrets"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_621@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Despite <<o:EventUnit>> appalling appearance, it is clear that the {EventUnit} seeks care, like an abandoned child."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_621@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "As your troops reach {EventStructure}, a {EventUnit} emerges from the bog, sniffing at them inquisitively."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_621@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Ghrmm-sniff, who comes to Morvo?\" <<p:EventUnit>> asks, licking <<o:EventUnit>> pimpled throat pouch. \"Has the Mother returned for <<P:EventUnit>>? Or does she send Morvo fresh fodder?\" The {EventUnit} bares <<o:EventUnit>> foul teeth. \"Brothers and sisters always so hungry, leave nothing for poor Morvo.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_621@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Give this Morvo into the custody of your troops. [unit/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_621@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Keep Morvo as a curiosity [influence/] for your court."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_621@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Feed Morvo [evilact/] to <<o:EventUnit>> voracious siblings inside the {EventInfestation} to poison them."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_621@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Mab's Creations"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_624@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I'll have to keep this,\" {EventPlayer} apologizes as <<p:EventPlayer>> pouches the Eye of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]Onoka[/hyperlink]. \"Though I found something else that may serve as compensation.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_624@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Struggling through barriers of ice, webs, and mists, your troops at last reach {EventStructure}, where {EventPlayer} asks them to hush."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_624@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Where the Mistwalkers lurk,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> whispers, \"one mustn't disturb the silence.\" {EventPlayer} carefully searches the numerous niches carved into the structure until <<p:EventPlayer>> withdraws a small object from one of them. \"It would appear that Arachna's loyalties were never fully dedicated to the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle[/hyperlink],\" <<p:EventPlayer>> remarks, presenting the Eye of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]Onoka[/hyperlink]. \"Perhaps this is why her actions always seemed so far removed from the central conflicts striking Athla.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_624@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Claim {EventStructure} and the Isle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_624@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Arachna's Duplicity"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_627@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I'm sure Marinus will forgive me for spoiling his treasure,\" {EventPlayer} says with a smile. \"And if he doesn't, it's still one of my lesser sins.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_627@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Reaching the heart of the idyllic Isle you find {EventPlayer} resting at {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_627@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"A garden,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> calls out with delight, \"a secret garden! What simple treasure in a world of cosmic wars.\" For brief moments {EventPlayer} loses <<r:EventPlayer>> in the fragrance and beauty of the surrounding flora. \"Speaking of treasures,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> then adds, inspecting the arcane structure again, \"I would be surprised if there wasn't any literal wealth stashed away in here.\" {EventPlayer} pokes around until <<p:EventPlayer>> uncovers a keyhole at the pedestal of a decorative statue."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_627@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Claim {EventStructure} and the Isle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_627@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Marinus' Wealth"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_630@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I am last,\" the {EventUnit} ends <<o:EventUnit>> tale. <<Cp:EventUnit>> also suffers from the Umbral malady."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_630@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Inside the {GLOBAL.ShadowRealmLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of {EventStructure} your troops find a lone {EventUnit}, surrounded by creeping gloom."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_630@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Once... a glade, enshrouded,\" the {EventUnit} mumbles slowly with a deep, creaking voice. \"The Sylvan Wolf roamed freely... sanctuary's guardian. Then came... the Umbral Vulture. The meadow fell sick... grass, trees, and beasts inflicted. The Umbral malady... carried off the Sylvan Wolf. The Umbral Vulture... feasted.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_630@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "End the {EventUnit} before it dies to the gloom."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_630@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Nourish the {EventUnit} [mana/] to imbue it with new life force [unit/]."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_630@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Bind the {EventUnit} [unit/] through its Umbral corruption. [evilact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_630@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Serena's Corruption"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_634@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "While {EventPlayer} speaks, a burning greataxe rises from the ground behind <<o:EventPlayer>> back. But before it can strike <<P:EventPlayer>> down, you snatch it with your arcane pull."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_634@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Claiming {EventStructure}, {EventPlayer} returns to investigate the breached structure."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_634@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"As it appears,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> says, \"the secret hiding behind [hyperlink,GLOBAL.YakaLoreConcept]Yaka's[/hyperlink] ego is an even bigger ego. A bit uninspired for a Wizard who was the first on {GLOBAL.AthlaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} to tamper with magics that would alter entire races.\" {EventPlayer} takes another aimless look around. \"Or perhaps\", <<p:EventPlayer>> adds pensively, \"there is another secret sunk beneath these sands, which these excessive displays of self-centeredness are supposed to divert from.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_634@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Claim {EventStructure} and the Isle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_634@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Yaka's Ambitions"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_638@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer} arranges the corals in a puzzling pattern and plunges them into the closest Astral Rift. \"This is for you, {GLOBAL.AzanyaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_638@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Now that your troops have eradicated the penguin threat they are joined by {EventPlayer}, who marvels at the colorful reef grown around {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_638@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"If there is one trait of {GLOBAL.NimueLoreConcept.Hyperlink} I can relate to,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> says, picking up washed up corals, \"it is her fascination with the {GLOBAL.MaerLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. The endless depths of the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are uncharted waters even for most Archmages, and to imagine the foreign wonders of the ancient Maer civilization lost somewhere within that insurmountable space is exhilarating.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_638@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Claim the {EventStructure} and the Isle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_638@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: The Sea Beyond"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_639@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"If only you brought true death, {Nekron.FirstName},\" {EventPlayer} says with a sigh, \"but you merely deny the dead their peaceful end.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_639@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"I see you haven't changed your ways one bit, {Nekron.FirstName},\" {EventPlayer} replies calmly, though <<o:EventPlayer>> corrupted hand appears to be restrained with great force."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_639@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"But you bring no news to one who was the broken pawn of the enemy.\" Twitching tentacles attempt to crawl out of <<ge:robe^n,{EventPlayer}>>, but immediately flinch as if struck by a flame. \"In the reflection of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.UrrathLoreConcept]Pitiless Void[/hyperlink] everyone is a puppet, {Nekron.FirstName}. Urrath's magic cannot be wielded without succumbing to its corruption.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_639@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Keep following their debate."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_639@TITLE"
msgstr "The Price of Power"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_671@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Sumuskira the Grovetender visited you?\" {Merlin} repeats. \"Good. I got an outstanding, albeit painful, impression of that Dragon.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_671@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"{EventPlayer}!\" {Merlin} speaks out with solemnity. \"It is I indeed, and your vigilance is well-appropriate for the gloom of the enemy still poisons my veins.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_671@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Tell me, {EventPlayer.FirstName},\" {Merlin} then asks, \"how did things fare for you during the incursions of the Fourth Age? I am pleased to see you still alive.\"[br/][br/]\"The mountains beyond Ralikesh are vast,\" {EventPlayer} gives <<o:EventPlayer>> vague response. \"After the Umbral eclipse, my tribe became blessed by the sudden attendance of the Great Mother. She showed me visions of a distant past, when her children, our ancestors, throve on all Athla.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_671@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Remind the two of the Astral disturbances."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_671@TITLE"
msgstr "The Grovetender's Scion"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_674@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Excuse our rambling conversation, {PlayerLeader},\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} at last says, turning to you, \"A storm is brewing on Evermore, and I hope we will weather it together.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_674@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"So you have noticed it too?\" {EventPlayer} asks, carefully examining the skies."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_674@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The voice of the Great Mother turned ominous when she mentioned Evermore,\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} continues. \"She called it the 'shiver', the place where the 'eldritch Leviathan' decimated her children and woke up Athla.\"[br/][br/]\"After arriving on Evermore, we searched the {EventStructure} and found a portal to a small isle within the Astral Void. We learned much about how the accursed Tempest once used the weakness of Dragonkin to mold new Draconians. However, he knew nothing of this eldritch Leviathan.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_674@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"A friend of {Merlin} is a friend of mine.\" [relationLvl3/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_674@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"When the storm erupts, we shall see.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_674@BUTTON_5"
msgstr "\"I cannot trust a stranger when we are looking for a powerful mage plundering Evermore's secrets.\" [relationLvl-3/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_674@TITLE"
msgstr "Traces of a Cataclysm"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_676@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Footer"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_676@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Header"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_676@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "Lore"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_676@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Reward 1"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_676@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Reward 2"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_676@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Reward 3"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_676@TITLE"
msgstr "Traces of a Cataclysm: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_683@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"With Mister <<g:tactics^n,EventPlayer>>, we have mounted a dashing insurgency against these vile Disciples, but the tide is turning fast, the Mistwalkers are at our doors. You must help us, oh please!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_683@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "On the early, misty morrow, a bloodied {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} errant appears before you in great distress. Letting <<P:EventUnit>> into your new court, <<p:EventUnit>> quickly relates <<o:EventUnit>> ill tidings..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_683@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"<<PlayerLeader{Master/Mistress}>> Hero, word of your heroic arrival spread quickly after our {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} kin returned to their burrows,\" heaves the poor, bloodied creature. \"But there, most found our refuge besieged, besieged I tell you! Oh woe, that sinister Disciples of the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]Dark Fey Lords[/hyperlink] are now after our valiant leader, Mister {EventPlayer}, with a vengeance! For <<p:EventPlayer>>, after freeing <<r:EventPlayer>> most dashingly from their clutches, became the champion of our struggles.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_683@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Turn to {FeyGuideName} to demand further explanation."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_683@TITLE"
msgstr "The Siege of the Burrow Downs"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_684@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"By channeling Duatha's dreams {EventPlayer.FirstName} arose in Milina's whim,\" urges {FeyGuideName}. \"<<Cp:EventPlayer>> must not fail, we must prevail; ere the {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} take <<P:EventPlayer>>!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_684@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "{FeyGuideName} giggles as you turn to <<P:{FeyGuideName}>> for answers. \"The truth was known, the path was shown; {EventPlayer.FirstName} still needs rescue, is this not so?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_684@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"When {EventPlayer.FirstName} was come, to {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} lands; the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]Fey Lords[/hyperlink] him did bind,\" titters {FeyGuideName}, \"They shackled <<P:EventPlayer>>, then brought to trial, with mockery in mind! But yea, behold, our {GLOBAL.GeassadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} wished, that {EventPlayer.FirstName} would make escape! So touched was <<P:EventPlayer>>, by Milina sweet, to lead the {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} scrape. Milina, O Milina, my mistress, our divine! She it is, who {FeyGuideName} made to seek you out, in time.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_684@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Accept this quest in full support of the Pellari cause!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_684@TITLE"
msgstr "Milina's Whim"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_686@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"{FeyGuideName}, you little rascal, I knew you'd pull through,\" chimes {EventPlayer.FirstName}. \"Come all, come join us for tea as we introduce ourselves and discuss 'battle plans'...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_686@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Reaching the confines of {EventCity}, {FeyGuideName} darts off forward towards an open, underground square where many figures huddle around a steaming pot."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_686@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "In the midst of this gathering, {EventPlayer} looks up with a warm smile. \"{FeyGuideName}? Back so soon, are we? And who is this you bring...?\" {EventPlayer.FirstName} beams with pride upon seeing you. \"By the {GLOBAL.AllfatherLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, what a capital fellow—hullo there! Oh, a mighty, fine business this is becoming, I feel luck to be squarely on our side. Surely, [hyperlink,GLOBAL.GeassadaeLoreConcept]Milina[/hyperlink] smiles in her Geasan slumber.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_686@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Join the rebel assembly for tea."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_686@TITLE"
msgstr "Milina's Chosen: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_688@BUTTON_7"
msgstr "Question [knowledge/] {EventPlayer} why <<p:EventPlayer>> is here."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_689@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "Accept this quest, reluctantly; weary of further Fey trickery."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_702@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Scurry away before <<g:thunder^n,{FeyGodName}>>,\" threatens {EventPlayer.FirstName}. \"You and those little dirt-rodents will be mist-fare before the splendor of me, '{GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}'. I have set my sights on you...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_702@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A mocking raptor's screech, announces the arrival of {EventPlayer}. \"Ugh, where do they keep finding such... miserable riffraff?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_702@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "With unblinking eyes, {EventPlayer.FirstName} probes your mind. \"Fall rains down on all, especially to those who rise too recklessly. I have known plenty of {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} like you. Think you can resist the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]true masters[/hyperlink] of this land because you've squashed a couple of Mistwalkers, do you? Hmpf. You and <<g:wretched^n{Ham.FirstName}>> {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} rabble will change your tunes soon enough.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_702@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"You do not impress me, you windbag. To war!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_702@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Flatter [influence/] <<g:ego^n,{EventPlayer}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_702@TITLE"
msgstr "Run Before the Thunder"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_708@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"You will see {FeyGuideName}, call out to old Auntie when you do,\" snaps {EventPlayer}, before turning to you. \"And you... Either turn in {Ham} to me before any more {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} get hurt. Or become prey.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_708@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With a combative snarl, {EventPlayer} prowls before you. \"Another outland {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}? Come to {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} to plunder her bounties, or to aid our hunt for rebels?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_708@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"{FeyGuideName}, do not trust that {Ham}, return to Auntie {EventPlayer.FirstName}! Remember the old stories of the first {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} who defiled this land,\" growls {EventPlayer.FirstName}. \"They caused the nightmares that tormented {GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}! So curse that {Ham} for dragging the {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} into <<o:Ham>> selfish wars. <<Cp:Ham>> is cruel to make them <<o:Ham>> pawns. But we Duatha-born are the Godir now...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_708@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"No one threatens me. To war!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_708@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"I will consider this.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_708@TITLE"
msgstr "Spring's Out on the Prowl"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_709@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"We kills it, then eats it!\" grumbles {Grump}. \"Nah, we captures it an' tosses it into the {EventStructure}, for [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]{FeyGodName}[/hyperlink], ghahaha!\" argues {Kana}, and on and on..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_709@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"Can we eats it?\" rumbles a deep, slobbering voice. \"No! That one's good sport for [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]{FeyGodName}[/hyperlink], you glob-gob!\" gutturally screeches another."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_709@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "With a stomp and a belching chuckle, {EventPlayer} enters to land <<o:Grump>> and <<o:Kana>> vicious sight onto you. \"Ah shuddup, that's luncheons, says I!\" grumbles {Grump}. \"Yous a'ways eat'n them, you snot-rot! [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]{FeyGodName}[/hyperlink] fancy's 'em reeeal squealing-like. So best be leaving this'un all squiggly-piggly for the Summer Master, eh!\" The two heads bicker and belch back and forth like this for an abominably long time before you."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_709@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will end your bickering myself, to war!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_709@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Slink away unnoticed while {EventPlayer.FirstName} bicker on..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_709@TITLE"
msgstr "Bickering Summer Griddle"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_710@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"The bleak, perishing power of our lady [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept]{FeyGodName}[/hyperlink] be upon you all,\" curses {EventPlayer.FirstName}. \"Soon... very soon. Watch out for the unweaving strands of your imminent doom.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_710@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Skitter, skitter sound the chitinous legs of a dark, bone-chilling approach, before {EventPlayer} appears out from the murk."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_710@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Mistwalker blood is on your palms, {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, admit it,\" insists {EventPlayer.FirstName} with a dark hiss. \"Unlike [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DuathaLoreConcept]Duatha's[/hyperlink] Fairy playthings, they actually serve a noble purpose. And each of their deaths evokes a chittering vengeance to be spun out from the cold, hollow of darkness.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_710@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"So be it.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_710@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "\"Wait, aren't you a renowned Athlan Godir? What brings you here?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_710@TITLE"
msgstr "Eightfold Hiemal Oath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_714@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"We must acquire the entire {EventStructure},\" urges {EventPlayer}, \"to cast a spell of Milina-make that banishes the {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} from the Realm. And you, {PlayerLeader.FirstName}, are the right <<PlayerLeader{Hero/Heroine}>> for the job. What say you?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_714@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "After many bustling introductions over tea and biscuits—and the occasional seconds—{EventPlayer} finally rises to speak: \"I say our primary point of attention must be the {EventStructure} atop the {EventRealm}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_714@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Indeed, there are many like it,\" continues {EventPlayer.FirstName}, \"to which, the Mistwalkers bring their prisoners, and 'try' them in their abominable 'Court of Mockery.' But, as we all know, the {EventStructure} is far older than even the {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} themselves. And, therefore, it still retains a power through which the {GLOBAL.GeassadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} can channel their magicks. This, I submit to you, is the crux of my plan:\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_714@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Accept this quest, solemnly."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_714@BUTTON_4"
msgstr "\"Aye! I will claim the {EventStructure}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_714@TITLE"
msgstr "To Court With Mockery"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_716@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Lit up by the sun's ray, a single {GLOBAL.PellariLoreConcept.Hyperlink} whelpling begins to sing a lullaby of hope. To which many others soon follow, one after another."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_716@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "At last, the key areas around the {EventStructure} are secured, and with it, a bright sun ray broke through the Fey clouds and mists."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_716@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "But as the remaining {EventRace} retreat and the scattered Disciple's forces regroup at the edge of the conquered terrain, a terrible aura emerges from the trees. Rumblings of thunder, agitated twittering of strange birds, the fell hiss of steam, and the howling of winter winds all coalesce against the golden radiance of the heavens."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_716@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Join the swelling chorus."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_716@TITLE"
msgstr "To Court With Mockery: Aftermath"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_748@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"This will sound like madness,\" {EventPlayer} concludes, \"but I need you to push through and create an anchor, {PlayerLeader}. An anchor large enough to enchain a creature of Evermore's size...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_748@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "\"The Eldritch Leviathan, bane of our ancestors!\" {Reskar} calls out in disbelief, <<o:{Reskar}>> people rallying behind <<P:Reskar>>. \"It never left Evermore.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_748@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"It all makes sense now,\" {EventPlayer} adds, while the tentacles underneath <<o:EventPlayer>> robe mimic the Leviathan's movements. \"The Astral disturbances were but the yawning of the colossal creature awakening from its ancient slumber; a magically induced slumber as it appears.\"[br/][br/]\"I hate to interrupt these musings,\" {EventHero} speaks up, \"but this Leviathan brought some family. And what's more, I espy the mysterious mage we've been seeking, or rather, phantasmal reflections of her or him. They spearhead the emerging {GLOBAL.AstralMonstersLoreConcept.Hyperlink}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_748@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Prepare to battle your way to the {EventStructure}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_748@TITLE"
msgstr "The Sleeper Beneath Evermore"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_776@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Underneath the mountains {EventDirection} {EventCity}, a shockwave of destruction is unleashed."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_864@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"O cunning regents upon Witherbloom's throne,\" the leader of the {EventRace} calls out, \"render your judgment upon these unwilling offerings!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_864@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "While the heat of summer bedazzles your thoughts, your inner eye perceives visions of a macabre scene..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_864@BODY_HEADER@AUTUMN"
msgstr "While the autumn wind reaps and whirls around the foliage of the last season, your inner eye perceives visions of a macabre scene..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_864@BODY_HEADER@SPRING"
msgstr "While rampant growth rejuvenates the land, your inner eye perceives visions of a macabre scene..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_864@BODY_HEADER@WINTER"
msgstr "While heavy snowfall starts to becloud the skies, your inner eye perceives visions of a macabre scene..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_864@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "You see long lines of frightened captives climbing the winding stairways hewn into an ancient rock formation. As they reach the last plateau, the {EventRace} force their victims to enter a mistflooded basin. Once the last captive has entered the mists a dark Feysong swells, while stone-carved effigies of the four {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} rise like columns from the ground, until they tower above all."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_864@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Observe the outcome of this 'trial,' unable to intervene..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_864@BUTTON_3"
msgstr "Channel magic [mana/] from your surrounding domain to disrupt the ritual."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_864@TITLE"
msgstr "Court of Summer"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_864@TITLE@AUTUMN"
msgstr "Court of Autumn"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_864@TITLE@SPRING"
msgstr "Court of Spring"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_864@TITLE@WINTER"
msgstr "Court of Winter"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_865@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Silently, the transformed captives join ranks with the {EventRace}. From the {EventStructure} they march out, ready to spread fear throughout the Burrow Downs..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_865@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The eyes on the effigies of the {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} light up as their ominous voices pronounce a single word: \"Worthy!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_865@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "From the mouth of each effigy, a stream of butterflies emerges, coalescing into one colorful swarm encircling the basin. The mists therein begin to waft more violently, like seething lava, and muffled gasps and screams can be heard. At last, the butterflies disperse and the figures inside the mist begin to move again, tottering. Yet as the first captive steps outside the basin you shudder, for they are no longer captives—they have become {EventRace}!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_865@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Let the visions fade away."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_865@TITLE"
msgstr "Doomed to Live"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_866@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} have siphoned the life from all captives, bestowing part of the reaped power upon their Disciples."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_866@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The eyes on the effigies of the {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} light up as their ominous voices pronounce a single word: \"Unworthy!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_866@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "From the mouth of each effigy, a stream of butterflies emerges, coalescing into one colorful swarm encircling the basin. The mists therein begin to waft more violently, like seething lava, and screams of terror and anguish can be heard. When the butterflies disperse at last, the basin is empty. But the mists have changed color, dyed a disturbing lavender, flowing into the effigies as if the {GLOBAL.DuathadaeLoreConcept.Hyperlink} were absorbing the lifeforce captured within."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_866@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Let the visions fade away."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_866@TITLE"
msgstr "Doomed to Die"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_898@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer} hands over the {EventItem}. \"Wield this with care,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> remarks. \"One day Artica's life might depend on it.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_898@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "While the winds still howl at {EventStructure}, {EventPlayer} appears, inspecting the bottled flame."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_898@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"I have heard many theories about elemental siblings,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> explains, gazing at the unthawed frescoes of {GLOBAL.ArticaLoreConcept.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.KarissaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. \"One of them makes the claim that despite their fundamental opposition, elemental siblings will never fully destroy their sisters or brothers. For it would result in their own death.\" {EventPlayer} opens the bottle, liberating a darting flame which melts down the bottle, violently reshaping it into a {EventItem}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_898@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Claim {EventStructure} and the Isle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_898@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Elemental Fates"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_902@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"We found the abandoned study rooms of our primary suspect,\" {EventPlayer} concludes. \"The remaining question is just, where to find them now.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_902@BODY_FOOTER@SYMON_MET"
msgstr "\"How could I miss so long what {Symon} found thereafter?\" {EventPlayer} asks <<r:EventPlayer>>. \"This is all my fault.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_902@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Reaching the {EventStructure} of the Isle, {EventPlayer} joins your troops, pensively."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_902@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Whoever set up this Isle had a lot of time to spend here,\" {EventPlayer} remarks, scanning the surroundings. \"All these study areas covering the different facets of the arcane give testament to true thirst for knowledge—and an abundance of loneliness.\" {EventPlayer} picks up a pair of enchanted boots left on an artificing table. \"These are made to walk where no foot can get a grip. The {GLOBAL.AstralFlowsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are only tread by the desperate.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_902@BODY_LORE@SYMON_MET"
msgstr "\"Oh, {Symon},\" {EventPlayer} calls out with a sigh, \"you gave it your best to struggle through your imprisonment. All these study areas covering the different facets of the arcane give testament to true thirst for knowledge—and an abundance of loneliness.\" {EventPlayer} picks up a pair of enchanted boots left on an artificing table. \"These are made to walk where no foot can get a grip. The {GLOBAL.AstralFlowsLoreConcept.Hyperlink} are only tread by the desperate.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_902@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Claim the {EventStructure} and the Isle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_902@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Arcane Studies"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_904@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"If you insist on wasting your time,\" {EventHero} replies, clearly disgruntled, \"go and activate those Obelisks.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_904@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "In the {EventGeo} {EventDirection} {EventCity}, your troops find a monolithic structure, adorned with pristine, mysterious carvings."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_904@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"This is an Ancient Obelisk warding the secret entrances to Shrouded Isles,\" {EventHero} explains, as <<p:EventHero>> and {EventPlayer} enter the scene. \"Without the Obelisks, even their makers wouldn't be able to find the Shrouded Gates. But none of that matters. For we already revealed all the Gates on Evermore.\"[br/][br/]\"I would not be so sure about that,\" {EventPlayer} objects, smiling. \"On Evermore it is a good precaution to expect the unexpected.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_904@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Set out to find more Obelisks."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_904@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Ancient Obelisks"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_906@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "The revealed Shrouded Gate lies at the very heart of Evermore, close to the Broken Wizard's Throne."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_906@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Activating the third Ancient Obelisk, its carvings illuminate as their spell is set in motion."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_906@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "It resonates, producing chiming sounds from a distant time, and then washes over Evermore. \"Impossible!\" {EventHero} calls out as the shape of a Shrouded Gate emerges from its magic concealment.[br/][br/]\"Even now, not all the secrets of Evermore have been unraveled, it seems,\" {EventPlayer} remarks enthusiastically. \"Though you should be prepared for more resistance at this gate, {PlayerLeader}.\"[br/][br/]\"Indeed,\" {EventHero} confirms, slowly regaining <<o:EventHero>> composure, \"if this gate was guarded by any {EventRace}, I would know about it.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_906@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"I will claim whatever knowledge rests inside.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_906@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Mysterious Isle"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_910@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"How can a man spread the very thing which he vowed to fight?\" the {EventUnit} calls out in desperation. Then <<p:EventUnit>> vanishes."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_910@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Entering the Mysterious Isle your troops find themselves in a cursed, desolate environment."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_910@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "A shadowy figure is roaming the area. It doesn't seem to perceive your troops, fully engulfed in its own lamentations.[br/][br/]\"I cannot undo what I have done,\" the figure speaks, \"nor rewind the threads of destiny I tainted. Those weren't my lips that touched the cursed object, or the ploy would have been in vain. But still, it happened through my designs, my hands, my orders...\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_910@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Keep exploring the Isle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_910@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Echoes of Execration"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_912@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"I am not even worthy of this purgatory!\" the {EventUnit} screams, smelting away in <<o:EventUnit>> own fire."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_912@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Your troops continue their path through the Mysterious Isle, traversing chasms of boiling lava."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_912@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "A flaming figure emerges from the molten earth. Like the other one before, it shows no reaction to your troops, instead spitting out heated accusations.[br/][br/]\"The High Council granted me absolution—absolution!\" the figure bursts out. \"Have they lost all sense of reality? And worse, they entrust me with a {GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, returning me to the place of the unspeakable. Haven't they noticed my burning guilt? Is this their device of punishment?\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_912@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Keep exploring the Isle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_912@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Echoes of Atonement"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_925@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "An [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ArchonsLoreConcept]Archon[/hyperlink] host, led by a {EnemyUnit} appears. \"Perpetrators?\" the {EventUnit} calls out, interrupting <<o:EventUnit>> forging. \"Leave! My work hasn't finished!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_925@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Inside the Arcanum, you find a shining apparition floating above the center altar. Its words echo throughout the structure."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_925@BODY_HEADER@NO_RULER"
msgstr "Inside the Arcanum, {EventHero} finds a shining apparition floating above the center altar. Its words echo throughout the structure."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_925@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The accursed horn, it has been retrieved at last!\" the voice jubilates. \"Now the true work begins. I must thank the {EventRace} for devising the Shrouded Isles; this Arcanum will be my enclave, my smithy of purification.\"[br/][br/]An exalted chant resounds, carrying the words of litanies and incantations, accompanied by the rhythmic chimes of a Celestial hammer."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_925@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Attack the Arcanum guardians."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_925@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Clever Attack"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_925@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Leave, for now."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_925@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Echoes of Purification"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_926@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "\"Gabriel found catharsis in undoing the High Men legacy of the First Age,\" {EventPlayer} sums up, \"through his work as the arbiter of Evermore's [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle[/hyperlink] and on the {EventArtifact}.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_926@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "With the Arcanum defenders overcome, a {EventUnit} appears, holding an ornate horn with a golden skull."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_926@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"My work here is finished\", the spirit speaks, \"but the struggle against darkness is eternal, as is my guilt.\" <<Cp:EventUnit>> hands you the {EventArtifact}: \"Blow this wherever you can, {PlayerLeader}. It will guide all souls back to {GLOBAL.TheWellLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. There can never be too much mercy.\"[br/][br/]As the spirit fades away, {EventPlayer} suddenly enters the Arcanum. \"So it is true,\" <<p:EventPlayer>> says slowly, \"and it was Gabriel who brought the Horn of the Dead to Athla. He never revealed to me his burdens; but I saw in the Pitiless Void that he is with the High Council now.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_926@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Encourage {EventPlayer} to liberate <<r:EventPlayer>> from <<o:EventPlayer>> own prison of guilt. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_926@BUTTON_1"
msgstr "Embrace the path of mercy laid out by both Gabriel and {EventPlayer}. [goodact/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_926@BUTTON_2"
msgstr "Claim the other works of Gabriel's purification [unit/] from the Arcanum."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_926@TITLE"
msgstr "Secrets of the Archmages: Echoes of Mercy"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_928@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "A stream of blood shoots out from <<ge:hands^p,{EventPlayer.FirstName}>>, forming a sanguine link with the Leviathan."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_928@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "Black clouds loom at the rim of the Eldritch Leviathan's craters as the cursed words of {EventPlayer} resound throughout Evermore:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_928@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Nameless One, from darkness deep[br/]Hear this witchery in your sleep[br/]Eldritch veins of eldritch blood[br/][runicfont]Will unleash the crimson flood![/runicfont]\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_928@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Observe the ritual's outcome."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_928@TITLE"
msgstr "Sanguine Ritual"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_929@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "{EventPlayer} has revealed <<o:EventPlayer>> vampiric powers, unleashing them on all Evermore."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_929@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "A welter of high-pitched shrieks shakes Evermore as the lands surrounding the void of the Eldritch Leviathan become soaked in blood, turning Sunless."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_929@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"The Crimson Age is at its dawn,\" {EventPlayer} declares, while hordes of blood-infused creatures move in the twilight. \"All across the {GLOBAL.AstralSeaLoreConcept.Hyperlink}, the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.ElderVampireLoreConcept]agents[/hyperlink] of the Blood Dominion rise, acting from the shadows. Before the {GLOBAL.GreatUmbralWarLoreConcept.Hyperlink} is over, the {GLOBAL.GodirLoreConcept.Hyperlink} of {GLOBAL.MagehavenLoreConcept.Hyperlink} will be but nescient thralls serving the Blood Reckoning's true heirs.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_929@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "\"This fight will get bloody!\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_929@TITLE"
msgstr "Blood Dominion"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_949@BODY_FOOTER"
msgstr "Using {EventCity} as a mighty anchor, {EventPlayer} has bound the {EventStructure} in magical sleep."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_949@BODY_HEADER"
msgstr "The city of {EventCity} stretches across the rim of the {EventStructure}. Atop its tallest building stands {EventPlayer}, <<o:EventPlayer>> {EventItem} held up high, shouting an incantation:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_949@BODY_LORE"
msgstr "\"Wake not, Nameless One, where though shalt sleep.[br/]Rejoin the dreams of Athla old.[br/]This anchorage of rock shall keep[br/]Though fettered in this astral mold.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_949@BUTTON_0"
msgstr "Ward {EventCity}, so the spell will not be broken."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_949@BUTTON_0@SWITCHED_SIDES"
msgstr "Prepare to attack {EventCity} and break the anchor."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_EVENT@1252_949@TITLE"
msgstr "Anchored Sleep"

