msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "When the prophecy of Anon had been fulfilled and Merlin wrested from Urrath’s control, the Godir of Magehaven rejoiced, hoping Merlin’s powers and knowledge of the enemy would turn the tide in the Great Umbral War. Yet Merlin, guilt-ridden and drained, barely mustered the strength to repulse them. He walked the streets of Magehaven as a tired old man, dismissing friends and foes alike."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Until one day Merlin disappeared, and no traces of him were to be found. Only a vague rumor persisted that Merlin had become a recluse, imprisoning himself in meditations, on a floating island somewhere within the Astral Sea..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Alas, the Astral Flows can be treacherous and a man of once great power cannot hide from the cosmos forever. A messenger of the Horwynd, an ancient owl people attracted to arcane secrets, was the first to find Merlin’s Astral refuge. She talked in riddles, alluding to a quest of dire importance. Thereafter came many mages, some impatient, others tenacious, seeking his mentorship. Merlin ignored them all."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@BRIEFING_04@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "At last the Horwynd messenger grew desperate, speaking more openly: Her people had sensed rippling echoes in the Astral Flows, signs of unusually strong magic activity—leading back to Evermore. Evermore. Hearing that name roused Merlin from his meditations. He looked at the messenger and the one Godir who had outlasted all other aspirants. Then he conceded.[br/][br/]This is the tale of their return to Athla’s broken Wizard’s Throne..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@COSMIC_TREMORS_SPELL@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target {GLOBAL.ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink}:[bulletlist][bullet/]If it contains an enemy {GLOBAL.ProvinceImprovementConcept.Hyperlink} and no {GLOBAL.AncientWonderConcept.Hyperlink}, it is removed and the {GLOBAL.PopulationConcept.Hyperlink} is lost.[bullet/]Enemy <<m:{GLOBAL.UnitConcept.Hyperlink}>> in the province sustain {IntDamage} {GLOBAL.FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.SpiritDamageConcept.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.LightningDamageConcept.Hyperlink}, and {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@COSMIC_TREMORS_SPELL@NAME"
msgstr "Cosmic Wake"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "And so, owing to the heroic intervention of a brave Godir, the enormous eyelids of the Eldritch Leviathan closed once more. At the top of Evermore's broken Wizard's Throne stood Merlin, inheriting Symon's burdensome task of sustaining the Leviathan's enchantment. Yet as Merlin gazed at the ancient creature, he encountered a feeling swelling inside himself that he had presumed left behind in a distant life: curiosity."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Tearing asunder the material crust of its age-long prison, the Eldritch Leviathan left behind Evermore, floating away into the Astral Sea. At its colossal slope hung Symon, cheering in elation, overwhelmed by the sheer infinite number of worlds glimmering tantalizingly in the distance. He thanked the bold Godir who had chosen to support their daring liberation—and to not fear the unfathomable."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_01@DEBRIEFING_03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Thus, the Duathadae's servants were cast out from the Burrow Downs and the realm was astir with joy, as Pellari folk—young and old—resurfaced to celebrate. They joined the Fey rebels in the Mistflow Gardens, where Ham Binger channeled Milina's magic to evoke a spirit of friendship and love. New hope was kindled that one day the Geassadae would be freed from their enchantment and return laughter and merriment to all of Duatha."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@ANCIENT_WONDERS@STOCKADE@CUSTOM_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Long hidden from all sight and sense, this vast complex was constructed by a devious cabal of [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Princes[/hyperlink] seated at the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.CircleOfDeogaiLoreConcept]Circle of the Azh'Ruun Pit[/hyperlink]. For many ages, they have secretly secured a portion of demonic-pact bound souls here for some yet unknown, nefarious intent..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@AVARICIOUS_PROPERTY@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit demands a high gold [gold/] upkeep."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@AVARICIOUS_PROPERTY@NAME"
msgstr "Avaricious Wolf"

