msgstr "Your groveling pleases [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink] mightily."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@BALORBOSS_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION_02@PLEASEBALORBOSS_ALT"
msgstr "Your actions please [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]{Balorboss}[/hyperlink] mightily."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@BALOR_SERVANT_PROPERTY@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit upkeep is covered by their [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicOverlordLoreConcept]Demon Overlord[/hyperlink]."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@BALOR_SERVANT_PROPERTY@NAME"
msgstr "Servant of Bealoroth"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@BRIEFING_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Since the Dawn of Ages, Obbadoth—birthworld of the Fiends—was shaped by carnage. Here, demons and hellions clashed amongst one another in ceaseless strife, while their Overlords ever feasted upon the raw, chaotic energies it produced. Fearing this infernal tide might one day engulf all other worlds, the Archons sent forth their greatest champions to vanquish the spread and contain it."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@BRIEFING_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Though the Archons battled against Fiend-kind for many ages, neither their zeal nor divine might proved able to halt the spread. On the contrary, their relentless campaigning only further fueled the carnage energies that empowered their enemies. Realizing the error of their ways, the Archon High Council called them all back—but one champion never answered the call..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@BRIEFING_03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Determined to succeed, or driven to madness, the young champion Ysariel instead resorted to forbidden measures. Rather than opposing the Demon Overlords, he offered them a pact: if they agreed to forever remain upon Obbadoth, he would personally feed their hunger for carnage with zealous strife. In return, a Circle of Deogai would be established, seated entirely by their Demonic Princes."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@BRIEFING_04@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Though this contract ultimately contained the Demon spread, it horrified the Archons utterly. And for defying them, Ysariel was thereafter exiled in disgrace. Yet, his Circle silently abided well into the present age. It was therefore a matter of great concern to the Godir of Magehaven, when Ysariel reached out, one day, with a desperate plea for aid...[br/][br/]This is the tale of the Godir who answered his summons."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@CARNAGE_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@FIRST_CRISIS_OUTCOME"
msgstr "Countless denizens across the realm abandon their labors to partake in riots, massacres, and ritual bloodshed. While the crisis persists:[bulletlist][bullet/]Knowledge [knowledge/], Food [food/], Production [production/], and overall Population Happiness [happiness/] income is reduced.[bullet/]Draft [unitprod/], Mana [mana/], and Souls [souls/] income is increased.[bullet/]The [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Princes[/hyperlink] break any existing {GLOBAL.DSAllianceConcept.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.DefensivePactConcept.Hyperlink}, or {GLOBAL.TruceConcept.Hyperlink} with you![/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@CHARACTER_NAME@BALORBOSS"
msgstr "Balorboss^M"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@CHARACTER_NAME@BEALOROTH"
msgstr "Bealoroth^M"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@CHARACTER_NAME@LIZTIA"
msgstr "Liztia^F"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@CHARACTER_NAME@PSEUMODIUS"
msgstr "Pseumodius^F"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@DEMONIC_PACT"
msgstr "You sign an Unbreakable Demonic Pact with {PactProposer}.[bulletlist][bullet/]{PactProposer} can call upon you at any time to do <<o:PactProposer>> bidding.[bullet/]This Pact cannot be made undone.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@DESTROY_CHAIN_INSTANT"
msgstr "Instantly raze {EventStructure} and break the nearby chain!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@INSPIRE_YSARIEL"
msgstr "You hearten your Sworn Brother."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@INSPIRE_YSARIEL_GREATLY"
msgstr "You greatly hearten Ysariel, and all his Sworn Brothers and Sisters."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEBRIEFING_01_KARISSA@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Thus, the true, unfettered spirit of Chaos was set loose upon the Astral Sea, at large. For the complete destruction of the Azh'Ruun Pit not only freed the Demon Overlords from their pactbound confines but also set them clawing at the throats of their ancient Hellion adversaries, once again."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEBRIEFING_01_YSARIEL@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Thus, the Circle of the Azh'Ruun Pit was protected from the relentless onslaught of Karissa and the infernal schemes of the Demon Overlords below. With it, the old order held firm and all unknowing denizens of the Astral Sea could continue their lives, ignorant of the greater evils that lurked beneath Obbadoth—at least, for now."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEBRIEFING_02_CHAOS@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Bit by bit, sparks of anarchy ignited across many Worlds Within. As brother turned against brother, Wizards openly forged pacts with Demons, and the forces of order suddenly found themselves besieged from all fronts. All this, orchestrated before the wicked laughter of a Godir whose very name henceforth sparked fear across the Astral Sea."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEBRIEFING_02_GOOD@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Blessed by the cosmic forces of Order, this nigh-improbable ordeal was ultimately achieved through the hard, principled labor of one, exalted Godir of note. Indeed, their deeds thereafter forged a bright legend that would inspire generations of heroes to brave all impossible odds in the just pursuit of triumph."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEBRIEFING_02_KARISSA@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Bit by bit, sparks of anarchy ignited across many Worlds Within. As brother turned against brother, Wizards openly forged pacts with Demons, and the forces of order suddenly found themselves besieged from all fronts. For an unstoppable tide had erupted, ushered in through the fury of Karissa and the Godir whom she now favored above all others—her much adored partner in Chaos."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEBRIEFING_02_YSARIEL@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The Circle's throne remained stoically seated by Ysariel, who was forever left touched by the extraordinary bond he had shared in that time. Though, thereafter, he became even more pensive and sequestered than before, often seen standing alone, staring up towards the stars. Perhaps in longing for one particular Godir to visit him, once more."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEMONIC_PRINCE_EVENT@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@ANGUISH"
msgstr "You invite the {Walburgis.LastName} into your heart."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEMONIC_PRINCE_EVENT@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@DENIED_SACRIFICE"
msgstr "You deny {DemonicPrince} a sacrifice. <<Cp:DemonicPrince>> will resent you for it."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@DEMONIC_PRINCE_EVENT@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@REPLENISH_WOLVES"
msgstr "{Istarnech} will replenish your gifted stock of <<m:EventUnit>> of <<o:Istarnech>> {IstarnechRace} up to three. But beware their avarice..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@FRIKKA_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@PACT_CONDITIONS"
msgstr "You sign an Unbreakable Demonic Pact with {PactProposer}.[bulletlist][bullet/]{PlayerLeader.FirstName} forever signs <<o:PlayerLeader>> free will over to {PactProposer}.[bullet/]{PactProposer} becomes your totalitarian Overlord and will puppeteer your every move.[bullet/]Caution: Choosing this action will end the game in a defeat!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@FRIKKA_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION_01@REVEAL_01"
msgstr "{Liztia} will reveal <<o:Liztia>> true self to you..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@FRIKKA_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION_01@REVEAL_02"
msgstr "You are not gullible enough to sign this contract."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@KARISSA_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@BREAK_WITH_KARISSA"
msgstr "You break with {Karissa} and continue your evil quest for destruction alone."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@KARISSA_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@DECLARE_WAR_ON_ALL"
msgstr "From now on, you can only declare war on any new {GLOBAL.EmpireConcept.Hyperlink} that you meet.[bulletlist][bullet/]For each {GLOBAL.EmpireConcept.Hyperlink} you declare war on, you gain +1 {GLOBAL.ChaosConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@KARISSA_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@DESTROY_CHAINS"
msgstr "You are tasked with razing and dismantling all five Chain Cities surrounding {EventRealm}.[bulletlist][bullet/]If any city is destroyed, its nearby chain will break.[bullet/]If all five chains are broken, the Hellion shall be unleashed![bulletlist/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@KARISSA_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@JOIN_KARISSA"
msgstr "You join {Karissa} on her rampant crusade to destroy {EventRealm}.[bulletlist][bullet/]If Karissa is defeated, the mission is lost![bulletlist/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@KARISSA_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@KARISSA_TESTS_PLAYER"
msgstr "{Karissa} playfully tests your devotion to Chaos...[bulletlist][bullet/]{Karissa.FirstName} will continue <<o:Karissa>> wild crusade for Chaos without you, for now.[bullet/]Failing this test will forfeit any chance of collaboration and initiate a solitary path of evil.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@LIZTIA_PROPERTY@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Great Skald of Pseumodius, adept trickster and escapist."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@LIZTIA_PROPERTY@NAME"
msgstr "Liztia Great Skald"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@MAIN_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@BECOME_BARON"
msgstr "{PlayerLeader} becomes a [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Baron[/hyperlink] of {PactProposer}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@MAIN_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@CHOOSE_SIDE"
msgstr "{Ysariel} and {Karissa} both urge you to choose their side. Choosing either side will seal your destiny upon {EventRealm}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@MAIN_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@CHOOSE_SIDE_CHAOS"
msgstr "You side with the reckless forces of Chaos, intent on tearing this demonic realm down.[bulletlist][bullet/]You can strengthen your bond with {Karissa} to destroy {EventRealm}.[bullet/]You can still challenge the {Karissa.Title} and tear this realm down on your own.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@MAIN_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@CHOOSE_SIDE_ORDER"
msgstr "You side with the contested forces of Order to protect a demonic realm beset by Chaos.[bulletlist][bullet/]You can bond with {Ysariel} to protect <<o:Ysariel>> crumbling order. [bullet/]You can become a stoic paragon of virtue who fights the hard fight on {GLOBAL.ObbadothLoreConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]You can still shift into a malicious deceiver and betray your stated intentions...[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@MAIN_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@KARISSA_BOUND_ERROR"
msgstr "You cannot sign this pact because you already pledged your loyalty to {EventLeader}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@MAIN_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION_01@SIGNPACT"
msgstr "{PactProposer} is asking you to sign an 'Unbreakable Pact,' signing this pact cannot be undone."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@ORDER_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@ORDER_NOTICE"
msgstr "Higher forces of Order [order/] will take notice of this action."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@ORDER_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@ORDER_WITDRAW"
msgstr "This transgression will alienate you from the higher forces of Order. [order/][bulletlist][bullet/]Choosing this action will immediately end your virtuous course![bullet/]Noticing this, {Ysariel} will challenge your honor...[/bulletlist]"

