msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@TOOLTIP@BREAK_ALL_CHAINS"
msgstr "You empower the {Beast} enough for it to break free from its chains![bulletlist][bullet/]This destroys the defensive structures and populations of all nearby Chain Cities in the process.[bullet/]All units of any remaining {GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept.Hyperlink} will become utterly demoralized.[bullet/]All remaining enemy factions will join in a desperate {GLOBAL.DefensivePactConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Freeing the {Beast} instantly completes the {EventQuest}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@TOOLTIP@CHAIN_DESTROYED"
msgstr "{Karissa} razes and breaks {EventStructure}!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@TOOLTIP@GAIN_IMMOLATED_SOULS"
msgstr "You gain an army of {INT_VAR} <<m:EventUnit>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@TOOLTIP@LEGION_OF_SINNERS"
msgstr "You gain an unending supply of <<m:EventUnit>>[bulletlist][bullet/]You immediately start off with a large army of <<m:EventUnit>>.[bullet/]So long as the {EventStructure} remains in your possession, it will generate new <<m:EventUnit>> to replace any who fall in battle.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@TOOLTIP@ORDER_INFESTATION"
msgstr "Multiple neutral forces of Order will descend upon the realm to take up the fight against evil."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@TOOLTIP@PRINCES_DECLARE_WAR"
msgstr "All remaining [hyperlink,GLOBAL.DemonicPrinceLoreConcept]Demonic Princes[/hyperlink] instantly declare {GLOBAL.WarConcept.Hyperlink} on you!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@TOOLTIP@SUMMON_YSARIEL"
msgstr "{Ysariel} teleports to the site of crisis and remains there for 1x turn."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@VICTORY"
msgstr "Victory on the Azh'Ruun Pit!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@VICTORY_TEXT"
msgstr "You have triumphed in the Azh'Ruun Pit and changed Obbadoth forever."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@YSARIEL_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION@PROTECT_CHAINS"
msgstr "You are tasked with protecting the Circle of Chain Cities surrounding {EventRealm}. [bulletlist][bullet/]If any city is destroyed, its nearby Chain will break.[bullet/]If the {EventStructure} is razed, the mission is lost![bullet/]If all five Chains are broken, the beast will escape and the mission is lost![bulletlist/]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@YSARIEL_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION_01@YSARIELBOUND"
msgstr "You sign an Unbreakable Pact with {PactProposer}.[bulletlist][bullet/]{PactProposer.FirstName} can be called upon to aid you in moments of crisis.[bullet/]If {PactProposer.FirstName} is defeated, the mission is lost![/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@YSARIEL_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION_02@EVILBOUND"
msgstr "You openly challenge {PactProposer}, making <<P:PactProposer>> your enemy.[bulletlist][bullet/]As deceiver of {EventRealm}, it will become your mission to destroy it.[bullet/]Unseen evil forces will take notice of this action.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@YSARIEL_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION_02@ORDERBOUND"
msgstr "You refuse to sign a pact with {PactProposer}, but pledge to protect the Circle of the Azh'Ruun Pit.[bulletlist][bullet/]This action draws the attention of higher forces of Order. [order/][bullet/]If {PactProposer.FirstName} is defeated, the mission is lost![/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02@YSARIEL_QUEST@CUSTOM_PREDICTION_02@YSARIELBOUND"
msgstr "You and {Ysariel} have become Sworn Brothers. [bulletlist][bullet/]<<Cp:Ysariel>> can be summoned during moments of crisis within {EventRealm}.[bullet/]If {Ysariel.FirstName} is defeated, the mission is lost![/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_02TEMP_NAME@BALORBOSS"
msgstr "Balorboss(DEPRECATED)^M"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_03@BRIEFING_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "While the Great Umbral War raged on, exhausting Magehaven's Godir and their allies, other forces, both forgotten and new, stirred in the shadows, silently exploiting this opportunity to challenge the established balance of power. Chief among those rising forces were the Mistwalkers, servants of the Duathadae, who were dreaded for their raids—called the Toll of Seasons—throughout the Astral Sea."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_03@BRIEFING_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The Mistwalkers had become more active than ever before, dragging the populations of entire worlds to their Fey realm of Duatha. And unlike in the past, they no longer left the raided lands, instead establishing permanent presences watching over the spreading mists. Rumors of Godir, captured and turned by the Fey lords to carry out their sinister orders, were whispered in fear, even in the untouchable towers of Magehaven."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_03@BRIEFING_03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "In the wake of these rumors, a solitary sprite called Dawnusk emerged from Duatha, searching the Worlds Within for a Godir who would answer his plea for help. For the legendary adventurer and storyteller Ham Binger had fallen victim to the Toll of Seasons and been brought before the Duathadae for judgment."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@STORY_REALM_MISSION_03@BRIEFING_04@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Trust was scarce for the words of a Fey in these times of fear, and Dawnusk had to rely on his elusive Fey magic to escape the anger of many a Wizard who would try to capture or kill him. But at last the sprite found a bold Godir willing to venture into the Fey realm and rescue Ham Binger.[br/][br/]So they took a deep breath, strode into a Fey fissure, and plunged into the mists of Duatha..."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@ABILITY_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target friendly unit gains:[bulletlist][bullet/]{amount} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.GRACE.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{amount} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STATUS_PROTECTION.Hyperlink} for {STATUS_PROTECTION_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@ABILITY_01@NAME"
msgstr "Magic Shield"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SKILL01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Conjure a {GLOBAL.UNITS.ABJURER_PYLON.Hyperlink} on target hex that casts {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MAGIC_SHIELD_ABILITY.Hyperlink} on friendly units.{LOC.CONCEPT@SUMMON_LIVE_SHARED}[br/][br/]{LOC.TACTICAL@ABILITY@NEVER_IN_WATER}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SKILL01@NAME"
msgstr "Conjure Abjurer Pylon"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SKILL02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target friendly unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Has its negative status effects removed.[bullet/]If the removed status effects have positive {GLOBAL.OpposingStatusEffectsConcept.Hyperlink}, the unit gains a stack of it.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SKILL02@NAME"
msgstr "Curse Reversal"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SKILL03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target enemy unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Has a base {ABJURE_VIOLENCE_CHECK>ResolvedStrength}% chance of becoming {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.PACIFIED.Hyperlink} for {PACIFICED_STATUS_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]Chance decreases based on target's lost <<m:{GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SKILL03@NAME"
msgstr "Abjure Violence"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SKILL04@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Enchanted units gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BATTLE_SHIELD.Hyperlink}, gaining {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.PRECOGNITION.Hyperlink} when its total <<m:{GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> reach {ABJURER_GLYPH_PRECOG_60_THRESHOLD>ResolvedTriggerProportion}% and {ABJURER_GLYPH_PRECOG_30_THRESHOLD>ResolvedTriggerProportion}%.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SKILL04@NAME"
msgstr "Abjurer Glyphs"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SKILL04@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit has:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BATTLE_SHIELD.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SKILL05@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Enchanted units gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{MAGE_ARMOR_DEFENSE>DEF_MOD>Armor} {GLOBAL.DefenseConcept.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SKILL05@NAME"
msgstr "Mage Armor"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SKILL05@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit has:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{MAGE_ARMOR_DEFENSE>DEF_MOD>Armor} {GLOBAL.DefenseConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SKILL06@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target owned city or non-hostile free city:[bulletlist][bullet/]Gains +{amount} {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Gains +{amount2} {GLOBAL.FortificationHealthConcept.Hyperlink} if not under siege.[bullet/]If targeting a free city with an owned {GLOBAL.DiplomaticTokenConcept.Hyperlink}, gain +{amount3} {GLOBAL.HouseInfluenceConcept.Hyperlink} per turn."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SKILL06@NAME"
msgstr "City Wards"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SPI@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]Per adjacent {GLOBAL.ConduitConcept.Hyperlink}:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount2} {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{amount3} {GLOBAL.FortificationHealthConcept.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist][bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL.ConduitConcept.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@SPI@NAME"
msgstr "[conduit/] Glyph Tower"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@TOME@GAMEPLAY"
msgstr "Create wards and protections to preserve your units."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "\"The novice of the arcane is often captivated by spectacle, mistaking flame and storm for mastery. Yet the greatest magic is that which protects us from the forces of evil. No fire or lightning can undo a curse, no blizzard can fully shield those beside you, and no forbidden power will keep the ones you love by your side.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Abjuration"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_ABJURATION@UNIT@NAME"
msgstr "Abjurer Pylon"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MAGIC_FIGHTER.Hyperlink} that can inflict {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DOMINATED.Hyperlink} on enemy units."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL01@NAME"
msgstr "Temptress"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Conjure an {GLOBAL.UNITS.ORB_OF_DESIRE.Hyperlink} on target hex that <<m:{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.ORB_TAUNT.Hyperlink}>> enemies and burns attackers.{LOC.CONCEPT@SUMMON_LIVE_SHARED}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL02@NAME"
msgstr "Conjure Orb of Desire"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Enchanted units gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLAZING_AURA.Hyperlink}, burning and damaging nearby enemies.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL03@NAME"
msgstr "Blazing Aura"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL03@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit has:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLAZING_AURA.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL04@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Enchanted unit's base attacks gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]A base {STRENGTH_SAPPING_PROJECTILES_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.WEAKENED.Hyperlink} for {WEAKENED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>. On success gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STRENGTHENED.Hyperlink} for {STRENGTHENED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist][br/]{LOC.INTERFACE@ENCHANTMENT_NON_REPEATING@INSERT}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL04@MODIFIER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Base {STRENGTH_SAPPING_PROJECTILES_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.WEAKENED.Hyperlink} for {WEAKENED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>. On a success gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STRENGTHENED.Hyperlink} for {STRENGTHENED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL04@NAME"
msgstr "Strength Sapping Imbuement"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL04@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit's base attacks have:[bulletlist][bullet/]A base {STRENGTH_SAPPING_PROJECTILES_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.WEAKENED.Hyperlink} for {WEAKENED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>. On success gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STRENGTHENED.Hyperlink} for {STRENGTHENED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist][br/]{LOC.INTERFACE@ENCHANTMENT_NON_REPEATING@INSERT}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL05@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target friendly unit gains:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BERSERK.Hyperlink} for {THRILL_OF_COMBAT_STATUS_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]{amount} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.INFERNAL_MIGHT.Hyperlink} for {INFERNAL_BLAZE_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns}<<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL05@NAME"
msgstr "Thrill of Combat"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL06@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target race gains a fiery core, gaining:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{FIERY_HEART_DEFENSE>REDUCTION>Fire} {GLOBAL.FireResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{FIERY_HEART_CRIT_CHANCE>ResolvedCritChanceBonus}% {GLOBAL.CriticalHitConcept.Hyperlink} chance[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FIRE_HAZARD_IMMUNITY.Hyperlink}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL06@NAME"
msgstr "Fiery Heart"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SKILL06@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit has:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{FIERY_HEART_DEFENSE>REDUCTION>Fire} {GLOBAL.FireResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]+{FIERY_HEART_CRIT_CHANCE>ResolvedCritChanceBonus}% {GLOBAL.CriticalHitConcept.Hyperlink} chance.[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FIRE_HAZARD_IMMUNITY.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SPI@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]+{amount2} {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink} per adjacent {GLOBAL.FarmConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL.QuarryConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@SPI@NAME"
msgstr "[quarry/] House of Passion"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@TOME@GAMEPLAY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Strengthen your units with Demonic wrath, seduce your enemies with fiendish lust, and engulf both in infernal flames."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "\"What is it that your fiery heart truly desires? Succumb to it—yield to your pleasures, submit to your cravings. For a life without passion is a life not worth living. Embrace that power, my sweet temptress. Love, after all, is a weapon to which even the mightiest of gods are vulnerable.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Burning Passion"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@UNIT01@NAME"
msgstr "Orb of Desire"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@UNIT02@NAME"
msgstr "Temptress"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@UNIT@ABILITY01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target enemy unit has a base {TAUNTED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of becoming {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.TAUNTED.Hyperlink} for {TAUNTED_LINK_EFFECT>Duration} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@UNIT@ABILITY02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Damage taken is reflected back to the attacker as {GLOBAL.FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@UNIT@ABILITY02@NAME"
msgstr "Fiery Reflection"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@UNIT@ABILITY03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target non-{GLOBAL.HeroConcept.Hyperlink} enemy unit has a base {KISS_OF_SEDUCTION_RESISTANCE_CHECK>ResolvedStrength}% chance of becoming inflicted with {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.THRILLING_DOMINATION.Hyperlink}. If unsuccessful, the target instead:[bulletlist][bullet/]Sustains {KISS_OF_SEDUCTION_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Fire} {GLOBAL.FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Gains {amount} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BURNING.Hyperlink} for {BURNING_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist][br/]Enter {GLOBAL.DefenseModeConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@UNIT@ABILITY03@NAME"
msgstr "Kiss of Seduction"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@UNIT@ABILITY04@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Non-{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.HERO.Hyperlink} non-{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MAGIC_ORIGIN.Hyperlink} adjacent attackers have a base {DISTRACTED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of becoming {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISTRACTED.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_BURNING_PASSION@UNIT@ABILITY04@NAME"
msgstr "Curse of Desire"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Deal {COSMOS_BOLTS_EXTRA_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Blight} damage of a random channel to target."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY01@NAME"
msgstr "Cosmos Bolts"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Units in a {COSMOS_BEAM_UNIT_TARGETER_LINE>AREA>Length}-hex long and {COSMOS_BEAM_UNIT_TARGETER_LINE>AREA>Width}-hex wide line sustain damage. This ability deals damage according to the affinity points its controller has:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.LightningDamageConcept.Hyperlink} per {GLOBAL.AstralConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink} per {GLOBAL.ChaosConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink} per {GLOBAL.MateriumConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept.Hyperlink} per {GLOBAL.NatureConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.SpiritDamageConcept.Hyperlink} per {GLOBAL.OrderConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink} per {GLOBAL.ShadowConcept.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY02@NAME"
msgstr "Cosmos Beam"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY03@ASTRAL@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "At the start of the turn within {COSMOS_MANIFEST_ENEMY_TARGETER_ASTRAL>AREA>Radius} hexes:[bulletlist][bullet/]Friendly units heal {COSMOS_MANIFEST_HEAL_ASTRAL>NumHitpointsToRestore} <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> and gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BOLSTERED_RESISTANCE.Hyperlink} for {BOLSTERED_RESISTANCE_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]Enemy units sustain {COSMOS_MANIFEST_DAMAGE_ASTRAL>DAMAGE>Shock} {GLOBAL.LightningDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY03@ASTRAL@NAME"
msgstr "Cosmos Manifest: Astral"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY03@CHAOS@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "At the start of the turn within {COSMOS_MANIFEST_ENEMY_TARGETER_CHAOS>AREA>Radius} hexes:[bulletlist][bullet/]Friendly units gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STRENGTHENED.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FORTUNE.Hyperlink} for {STRENGTHENED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]Enemy units sustain {COSMOS_MANIFEST_DAMAGE_CHAOS>DAMAGE>Fire} {GLOBAL.FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY03@CHAOS@NAME"
msgstr "Cosmos Manifest: Chaos"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "For each affinity at or above {amount} gain the corresponding Passive Ability:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.COSMOS_MANIFEST_ASTRAL.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.COSMOS_MANIFEST_CHAOS.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.COSMOS_MANIFEST_MATERIUM.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.COSMOS_MANIFEST_NATURE.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.COSMOS_MANIFEST_ORDER.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.COSMOS_MANIFEST_SHADOW.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY03@MATERIUM@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "At the start of the turn within {COSMOS_MANIFEST_ENEMY_TARGETER_MATERIUM>AREA>Radius} hexes:[bulletlist][bullet/]Friendly units heal {COSMOS_MANIFEST_HEAL_MATERIUM>NumHitpointsToRestore} <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> and gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BOLSTERED_DEFENSE.Hyperlink} for {BOLSTERED_DEFENSE_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns}<<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]Enemy units sustain {COSMOS_MANIFEST_DAMAGE_MATERIUM>DAMAGE>Physical} {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY03@MATERIUM@NAME"
msgstr "Cosmos Manifest: Materium"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY03@NAME"
msgstr "Cosmos Manifest"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY03@NATURE@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "At the start of the turn within {COSMOS_MANIFEST_ENEMY_TARGETER_NATURE>AREA>Radius} hexes:[bulletlist][bullet/]Friendly units heal {COSMOS_MANIFEST_NATURE_HEAL>NumHitpointsToRestore} <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Enemy units sustain {COSMOS_MANIFEST_DAMAGE_NATURE>DAMAGE>Blight} {GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY03@NATURE@NAME"
msgstr "Cosmos Manifest: Nature"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY03@ORDER@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "At the start of the turn within {COSMOS_MANIFEST_ENEMY_TARGETER_ORDER>AREA>Radius} hexes:[bulletlist][bullet/]Friendly units gain {COSMOS_MANIFEST_MORALE>Morale Change Absolute} {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Enemy units sustain {COSMOS_MANIFEST_DAMAGE_ORDER>DAMAGE>Spirit} {GLOBAL.SpiritDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY03@ORDER@NAME"
msgstr "Cosmos Manifest: Order"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY03@SHADOW@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "At the start of the turn within {COSMOS_MANIFEST_ENEMY_TARGETER_SHADOW>AREA>Radius} hexes:[bulletlist][bullet/]Friendly units have {GENERAL_DISPEL_NEGATIVE>NumThingsToDispel} Negative Status Effects removed.[bullet/]Enemy units sustain {COSMOS_MANIFEST_DAMAGE_SHADOW>DAMAGE>Frost} {GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY03@SHADOW@NAME"
msgstr "Cosmos Manifest: Shadow"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY04@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "When a spell is cast in combat, gain +{COSMIC_RESONANCE_ASTRAL_PROTECTION>REDUCTION>Shock} Protection according to the affinities of the spell."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@ABILITY04@NAME"
msgstr "Cosmic Resonance"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@SKILL1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Summon the {GLOBAL.UNITS.AVATAR_OF_THE_COSMOS.Hyperlink}, a {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.MYTHIC_UNIT.Hyperlink} that is empowered by your own affinities."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@SKILL1@NAME"
msgstr "Summon Avatar of the Cosmos"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@SKILL2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Enchanted units gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{COSMOS_AWAKENING_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Shock} damage of each damage channel.[bullet/]+{COSMOS_AWAKENING_PROTCTION>REDUCTION>Shock} protection of each damage channel.[/bulletlist][br/]{LOC.INTERFACE@ENCHANTMENT_NON_REPEATING@INSERT}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@SKILL2@NAME"
msgstr "Cosmos Awakening"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@SKILL2@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Units has:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{COSMOS_AWAKENING_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Shock} damage of each damage channel.[bullet/]+{COSMOS_AWAKENING_PROTCTION>REDUCTION>Shock} protection of each damage channel.[/bulletlist][br/]{LOC.INTERFACE@ENCHANTMENT_NON_REPEATING@INSERT}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@SKILL3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]Reveal the Map.[bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.WorldMapCastingPointConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]+{amount2} {GLOBAL.CombatCastingPointConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]For each {GLOBAL.AffinityConcept.Hyperlink} at or above {amount3} the city gains +{amount4} of the resource based on that affinity.[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.AstralConcept.Hyperlink} - {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.ChaosConcept.Hyperlink} - {GLOBAL.UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.MateriumConcept.Hyperlink} - {GLOBAL.StructureProductionConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.NatureConcept.Hyperlink} - {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.OrderConcept.Hyperlink} - {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.ShadowConcept.Hyperlink} - {GLOBAL.KnowledgeConcept.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist][/bulletlist][br/][br/]Can only be built in the {GLOBAL.ThroneCityConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@SKILL3@NAME"
msgstr "Prismatic Tower"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@TOME@GAMEPLAY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Use your mastery over the magic of the universe to empower your units and your economy, and summon a mighty Avatar of the Cosmos itself."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "\"One of the defining steps toward cosmic awakening is to become a wanderer, surrendering oneself to the currents of the Astral Sea. No true master remains bound to a single facet of the arcane, but instead embraces its full prismatic spectrum. For in the end, we are but the convergence of soul and body, order and chaos, life and death.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of the Cosmos"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_COSMOS@UNIT@NAME"
msgstr "Avatar of the Cosmos^n"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@ABILITY01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target enemy unit sustains damage."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@ABILITY01@NAME"
msgstr "Regurgitate"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@ABILITY02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]Gain a permanent stack of {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.GORGED.Hyperlink}:[bulletlist][bullet/]At the start of combat.[bullet/]When killing an enemy unit.[/bulletlist][bullet/]Upon reaching {amount} stacks of {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.GORGED.Hyperlink}, remove them and all friendly units within {IMPS_HUNGER_CIRCLE>AREA>Radius}-hexes:[bulletlist][bullet/]Heal {IMPS_HUNGER_HEAL>NumHitpointsToRestore} <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.GORGED.Hyperlink} if they have {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DEMONIC_HUNGER_PROPERTY_GROUP.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist][/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@ABILITY02@NAME"
msgstr "Imp's Hunger"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@DEMONIC_SATIATION@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]+{DEMONIC_SATIATION_HP_BONUS>BONUS>HitPoints} <<m:{GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Deals +{DEMONIC_SATIATION_MULT>ResolvedMultiplier}% damage.[bullet/]Stacks up to {amount} times.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@DEMONIC_SATIATION@NAME"
msgstr "Demonic Satiation"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@GORGED@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]+{GORGED>BONUS>HitPoints} <<m:{GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>[bullet/]Stacks up to {amount} times.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@GORGED@MOD_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "On kill, gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.GORGED.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@GORGED@MOD_NAME"
msgstr "Gorge"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@GORGED@NAME"
msgstr "Gorged"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@SKILL1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Summon a {GLOBAL.UNITS.GLUTTONOUS_IMP.Hyperlink} on target hex."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@SKILL1@NAME"
msgstr "Summon Gluttonous Imp"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@SKILL2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target enemy unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Becomes {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISTRACTED.Hyperlink} for {DISTRACTED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]Has a base {STUNNED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of becoming {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STUNNED.Hyperlink} for {STUNNED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@SKILL2@NAME"
msgstr "Illusory Feast"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@SKILL3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target race is charged with infernal forces of gluttony, gaining:[bulletlist][bullet/]When killing a non-{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.COMBAT_SUMMON.Hyperlink} enemy unit, gain a permanent stack of {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.GORGED.Hyperlink} which:[bulletlist][bullet/]At {amount} stacks turns into a permanent stack of {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DEMONIC_SATIATION.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Cannot be gained when {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DEMONIC_SATIATION.Hyperlink} is at {amount3} stacks.[/bulletlist][bullet/]When pillaging a province, heal for {amount2}% of their maximum <<m:{GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@SKILL3@NAME"
msgstr "Demonic Hunger"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@SKILL3@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]When killing a non-{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.COMBAT_SUMMON.Hyperlink} enemy unit, gain a permanent stack of {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.GORGED.Hyperlink} which:[bulletlist][bullet/]At {amount} stacks turns into a permanent stack of {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DEMONIC_SATIATION.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Cannot be gained when {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DEMONIC_SATIATION.Hyperlink} is at {amount3} stacks.[/bulletlist][bullet/]When pillaging a province, heal for {amount2}% of their maximum <<m:{GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@SKILL4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target enemy sustains:[bulletlist][bullet/]{INFERNAL_JAWS_UNIT_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Physical} {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]{INFERNAL_JAWS_UNIT_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Fire} {GLOBAL.FireDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist][br/]If the enemy dies, adjacent friendly units:[bulletlist][bullet/]Heal {INFERNAL_JAWS_HEAL>NumHitpointsToRestore} <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]If they have {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DEMONIC_HUNGER_PROPERTY_GROUP.Hyperlink} or {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.IMPS_HUNGER.Hyperlink}, gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.GORGED.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@SKILL4@NAME"
msgstr "Infernal Jaws"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@SKILL5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target Free City:[bulletlist][bullet/]Has its {GLOBAL.IndependentCityRelationConcept.Hyperlink} to other rulers reduced by {amount}.[bullet/]{amount2}% of its {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink} income is given to your cities.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@SKILL5@NAME"
msgstr "Corrupt Pact"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@SPI@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]{amount}% of {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink} is converted to {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]When victorious in battle, this city gains {amount2} {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL.FarmConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@SPI@NAME"
msgstr "[farm/] Hungering Maw"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@TOME@GAMEPLAY"
msgstr "Gain control over the infernal domain of Gluttony, making your units harder to kill and stronger as they feed on mortal essences."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "\"You mortals believe you can deny your own nature. Yet you were born to feast, never satisfied when sated. A few of you come to understand this: your true desire does not lie in being fulfilled, but in the endless pursuit of fulfillment. Unleash your hunger, it will never be enough, not until you devour even the very Well of Creation.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Gluttony"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_GLUTTONY@UNIT@NAME"
msgstr "Gluttonous Imp"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@ABILITY1@CHAMPION_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target friendly unit and another within {MORNING_BOON_JUMP_TARGETER>MaxDistance} hexes:[bulletlist][bullet/]Gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.REGENERATION.Hyperlink} for {REGENERATION_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]Gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STRENGTHENED.Hyperlink} for {STRENGTHENED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]Has {amount} Negative Status Effect removed.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@ABILITY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target friendly unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Gains {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.REGENERATION.Hyperlink} for {REGENERATION_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]Gains {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STRENGTHENED.Hyperlink} for {STRENGTHENED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]Has {amount} Negative Status Effect removed.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Morning Boon"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@ABILITY1@NAME_CHAMPION"
msgstr "Champion Morning Boon"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@ABILITY1@RANK_CHAMPION"
msgstr "Morning Boon now targets another friendly unit within {amount} hexes."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@ABILITY2@CHAMPION_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target enemy unit and another within {EVENING_BANE_JUMP_TARGETER>MaxDistance} hexes:[bulletlist][bullet/]Become {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLINDED.Hyperlink} for {BLINDED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]Become {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SLOWED.Hyperlink} for {SLOWED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@ABILITY2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target enemy unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Becomes {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLINDED.Hyperlink} for {BLINDED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]Becomes {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SLOWED.Hyperlink} for {SLOWED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@ABILITY2@NAME"
msgstr "Evening Bane"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@ABILITY2@NAME_CHAMPION"
msgstr "Champion Evening Bane"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@ABILITY2@RANK_CHAMPION"
msgstr "Evening Bane now targets another enemy unit within {amount} hexes."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@ABILITY3@NAME"
msgstr "Fairies"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SKILL02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Enchanted units:[bulletlist][bullet/]On combat start, gain +{FEY_BOND_MORALE_CHANGE>Morale Change Absolute} {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]When at neutral morale, gain +{amount} {GLOBAL.StatusResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]When at high morale, gain +{amount2} {GLOBAL.StatusResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SKILL02@NAME"
msgstr "Fey Bond"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SKILL02@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "This unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]On combat start, gains +{FEY_BOND_MORALE_CHANGE>Morale Change Absolute} {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]When at neutral morale, gain +{amount} {GLOBAL.StatusResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]When at high morale, gain +{amount2} {GLOBAL.StatusResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SKILL03@ABILITY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target enemy unit has a base {SLOWED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of becoming {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISTRACTED.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLINDED.Hyperlink}, or {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SLOWED.Hyperlink} for {SLOWED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SKILL03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Enchanted units:[bulletlist][bullet/]Gain the {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FAIRY_DUST_ABILITY.Hyperlink} ability.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SKILL03@NAME"
msgstr "Fairy Dust"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SKILL03@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit has:[bulletlist][bullet/]Gain the {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FAIRY_DUST_ABILITY.Hyperlink} ability.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SKILL04@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target enemy unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Becomes {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISTRACTED.Hyperlink} for {DISTRACTED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]Has its {GLOBAL.DefenseModeConcept.Hyperlink} canceled.[bullet/]Has its <<m:{GLOBAL.RetaliationConcept.Hyperlink}>> removed.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SKILL04@NAME"
msgstr "Captivating Lights"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SKILL05@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target friendly army loses all their movement points then heals by {amount} <<m:{GLOBAL.HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>> per movement point lost."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SKILL05@NAME"
msgstr "Catnap"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SKILL1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Summon a {GLOBAL.UNITS.MORNING_SPRITE.Hyperlink} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SUPPORT_UNIT.Hyperlink} or an {GLOBAL.UNITS.EVENING_SPRITE.Hyperlink} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BATTLE_MAGE.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SKILL1@DIALOG_SUBHEADER_DEFAULT"
msgstr "Spirits of Nature come to your aid."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SKILL1@NAME"
msgstr "Summon Sprite"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SPI@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]+{amount2} {GLOBAL.UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]+{amount3} {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink} per adjacent {GLOBAL.ForesterConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL.ForesterConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@SPI@NAME"
msgstr "[forester/] Fey Woods"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@TOME@GAMEPLAY"
msgstr "Use the powers of small Fey to support your units and befuddle your enemies."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "\"For the Fey, the world bends to strange laws. Perplexing, yet filling them with potent magic. And it is equally surprising what they do with that power. For all that you hold dear, do not take a nap in the Fey woods. I have seen those Sprites play tricks that would make the Allfather blush.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of the Sprite"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@UNIT1@NAME"
msgstr "Morning Sprite^n"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_SPRITE@UNIT2@NAME"
msgstr "Evening Sprite^n"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Web Blast"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@ABILITY2@CHAMPION_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target friendly dead unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Revives into a Tier II random Spider unit if Tier II or I.[bullet/]Revives into a Tier IV random Spider unit otherwise.[/bulletlist][br/]If the revived unit survives, it can be acquired at the end of combat for a mana cost."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@ABILITY2@CHAMPION_NAME"
msgstr "Champion Spider Rebirth"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@ABILITY2@CHAMPION_TOOLTIP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Spider Rebirth now has a {amount} turn cooldown."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@ABILITY2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target friendly dead unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Revives into a {GLOBAL.UNITS.WEAVER_SPIDER.Hyperlink} or {GLOBAL.UNITS.HUNTER_SPIDER.Hyperlink} unit.[bullet/]If Tier IV or Tier V, revives into a {GLOBAL.UNITS.WEAVER_SPIDER_MATRIARCH.Hyperlink} or {GLOBAL.UNITS.HUNTER_SPIDER_MATRIARCH.Hyperlink} unit instead.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@ABILITY2@NAME"
msgstr "Spider Rebirth"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@ABILITY3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]Target friendly unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Heals {WEBBED_TRANSFUSION_HEAL>NumHitpointsToRestore} <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[bullet/]Has its Negative Status Effects removed.[/bulletlist][bullet/]Then an enemy unit within {WEBBED_TRANSFUSION_JUMP_TARGETER>MaxDistance} hexes:[bulletlist][bullet/]Sustains {WEBBED_TRANSFUSION_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Blight} {GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept.Hyperlink} and {WEBBED_TRANSFUSION_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Frost} {GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Has a base {IMMOBILIZED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of becoming {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.IMMOBILIZED.Hyperlink} for {IMMOBILIZED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist][/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@ABILITY3@NAME"
msgstr "Webbed Transfusion"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@SKILL1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SUPPORT_UNIT.Hyperlink} that can rebirth dead units as spiders and transfer negative effects from friendly units to enemies."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@SKILL1@NAME"
msgstr "Priest of the Weave"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@SKILL2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Target race weaves themselves with spiders gaining:[bulletlist][bullet/]The {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SPIDER.Hyperlink} unit type.[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FAST_MOVEMENT.Hyperlink}[bullet/]Base attacks gain a base {IMMOBILIZED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.IMMOBILIZED.Hyperlink} for {IMMOBILIZED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>. Increased for Single Shots.[/bulletlist][br/][br/]Mounted units lose their mounts.[br/][br/]Heroes lose their Mount and Leg equipment slots."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@SKILL2@NAME"
msgstr "Spider's Embrace"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@SKILL2@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit has:[bulletlist][bullet/]The {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SPIDER.Hyperlink} unit type.[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FAST_MOVEMENT.Hyperlink}[bullet/]Base attacks have a base {IMMOBILIZED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.IMMOBILIZED.Hyperlink} for {IMMOBILIZED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>. Increased for Single Shots.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@SKILL3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Enchanted units:[bulletlist][bullet/]Gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DEMORALIZER.Hyperlink}[bullet/]Attacks deal +{DREAD_HUNTERS_DAMAGE>ResolvedMultiplier}% damage against {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.IMMOBILIZED.Hyperlink} or {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FROZEN.Hyperlink} targets.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@SKILL3@NAME"
msgstr "Dread Hunters"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@SKILL3@PROP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Gains {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DEMORALIZER.Hyperlink}[bullet/]Attacks deal +{DREAD_HUNTERS_DAMAGE>ResolvedMultiplier}% damage against {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.IMMOBILIZED.Hyperlink} or {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FROZEN.Hyperlink} targets.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@SKILL4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Units in a {DREADFUL_BIND_UNIT_TARGETER_CIRCLE>AREA>Radius}-hex radius:[bulletlist][bullet/]Have a base {IMMOBILIZED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of becoming {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.IMMOBILIZED.Hyperlink} for {IMMOBILIZED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[bullet/]Gain {amount} {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.REMORSE.Hyperlink} for {REMORSE_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@SKILL4@NAME"
msgstr "Dreadful Bind"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@SKILL5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Conjure {amount} <<m:{GLOBAL.UNITS.WEAVER_SPIDER.Hyperlink}>> on target and adjacent hex.{LOC.CONCEPT@SUMMON_LIVE_SHARED}[br/][br/]{LOC.TACTICAL@ABILITY@NEVER_IN_WATER}"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@SKILL5@NAME"
msgstr "Conjure Weaver Spiders"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@SPI@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount} {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]+{amount2} {GLOBAL.UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink} per adjacent {GLOBAL.ForesterConcept.Hyperlink} or {GLOBAL.ForestConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Unlocks various {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SPIDER.Hyperlink} units.[bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL.ForesterConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@SPI@NAME"
msgstr "[forester/] Spider's Nest"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@TOME@GAMEPLAY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Inflict and exploit the {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.IMMOBILIZED.Hyperlink} status effect and strike fear into your enemies."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "\"My wither weaver spider spins a deadly trap\n"
"Waits for her prey and strikes a sudden rap\n"
"Puppet out her victim and ponder out the gain\n"
"And wither weaver spider spins her schemes again.\""

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of the Weaver"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOME_WEAVER@UNIT@NAME"
msgstr "Priest of the Weave^f"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOOLTIP_DEFINITIONS@BREACHED_ISLE_CONCEPT@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A breached isle is a handcrafted region which:[bulletlist][bullet/]Is only accessible through a portal on Surface or Underground.[bullet/]These portals are accessible at the start and are not guarded.[bullet/]Contains a {GLOBAL.STRUCTURES.BREACHED_ARCANUM.Hyperlink} and various other valuable <<m:{GLOBAL.LocationConcept.Hyperlink}>>[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOOLTIP_DEFINITIONS@BREACHED_ISLE_CONCEPT@HYPERLINK"
msgstr "[hyperlink,GLOBAL.BreachedIsleConcept]Breached Isle[/hyperlink]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOOLTIP_DEFINITIONS@BREACHED_ISLE_CONCEPT@NAME"
msgstr "Breached Isle"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOOLTIP_DEFINITIONS@SHROUDED_ISLE_CONCEPT@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A shrouded isle is a handcrafted region which:[bulletlist][bullet/]Is only accessible through a portal on Surface or Underground.[bullet/]These portals must be uncovered through a quest.[bullet/]These portals are guarded by inhabitants.[bullet/]Contains a {GLOBAL.STRUCTURES.SHROUDED_ARCANUM.Hyperlink}. Which unlocks a Secret {GLOBAL.SpellConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Contains other valuable <<m:{GLOBAL.LocationConcept.Hyperlink}>> in the region which are not guarded by {GLOBAL.MarauderConcept.Hyperlink} <<m:{GLOBAL.ArmyConcept.Hyperlink}>>.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TOOLTIP_DEFINITIONS@SHROUDED_ISLE_CONCEPT@NAME"
msgstr "Shrouded Isle"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM@AFFINITY_BUTTON_ORDER@YSARIEL"
msgstr "The Archons reward you with troops for your crusade."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to draw the energy pulsating from the Arcanum:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE@YSARIEL@FAILURE"
msgstr "The light of Order has not considered you worthy of its boon."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE@YSARIEL@HEADER"
msgstr "Call upon the energy of Order to put an end to this chaos."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE@YSARIEL@SUCCESS"
msgstr "Your units bask in the power of Order."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@YSARIEL@FAILURE"
msgstr "Your voice could not handle the raw strength of Chaos."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@YSARIEL@HEADER"
msgstr "Release a Scream of Chaos."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@YSARIEL@SUCCESS"
msgstr "Your scream empowers your units."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_ARTICA@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@FAILURE"
msgstr "You can muster no protection against the permafrost."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_ARTICA@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to protect your army from wintry attacks:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_ARTICA@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@SUCCESS"
msgstr "Your troops barely feel the ice-tipped blades of Artica's defenders."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_BELBEDOR@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@FAILURE"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit} shrugs off your influence. It is fully under control of the Duathadae."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_BELBEDOR@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to relax the Duathadae's hold over the {EnemyUnit}:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_BELBEDOR@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit} writhes in mental agony and lashes out against <<o:EnemyUnit>> masters."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_BHAJIF@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@FAILURE"
msgstr "Your connection with Bhajif's power did not succeed."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_BHAJIF@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@SUCCESS"
msgstr "A brief flare of Unmaker magic empowers your troops."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_CINREN@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@FAILURE"
msgstr "Your troops' minds are too clouded to become aroused."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_CINREN@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to boost the morale of your army:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_CINREN@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The thought of battle brings your warriors joy."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_FRIKKA@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@FAILURE"
msgstr "Your connection with Frikka's power did not succeed."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_FRIKKA@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@SUCCESS"
msgstr "You trick one of the reflections to turn into a {GLOBAL.UNITS.PIGLET.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_FRIKKA@TERRAFORM"
msgstr "The region will turn into {GLOBAL.AshlandsConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_KARISSA@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@FAILURE"
msgstr "Karissa's passion fails to kindle your warriors' souls."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_KARISSA@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@HEADER"
msgstr "Let Karissa's fiery passion overtake your warriors:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_KARISSA@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@SUCCESS"
msgstr "Karissa's vigorous power courses through your troops' veins, strengthening them."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_NIMUE@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@FAILURE"
msgstr "Nature did not hear your call."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_NIMUE@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@SUCCESS"
msgstr "Summon a {GLOBAL.UNITS.FLORAL_STINGER.Hyperlink} on your side during the battle."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_NOCTUS@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@FAILURE"
msgstr "You could not withstand the gaze of the abyss."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_NOCTUS@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@SUCCESS"
msgstr "Those who never rest answer your call."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_YAKA@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@FAILURE"
msgstr "Your connection with Yaka's power did not succeed."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_YAKA@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@SUCCESS"
msgstr "You embody the power of Yaka with fire on your hands, daunting the defenders."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_YAKA@BUTTON@SACRIFICE"
msgstr "{KilledUnit} will be sacrificed."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_YDGAARD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_MATERIUM@FAILURE"
msgstr "Ydgaard's power refuses to bend to your will."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_YDGAARD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_MATERIUM@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to replicate the gilding magic of Ydgaard Worldbender:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_YDGAARD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_MATERIUM@SUCCESS"
msgstr "Your warriors have a small chance to turn their enemies into gold."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_ZAETHYL@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@FAILURE"
msgstr "The roots are willing, but the Entwined march on regardless."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_ZAETHYL@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@HEADER"
msgstr "Encourage the Entwined warriors' feet to take root:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@ARCANUM_ZAETHYL@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The Entwined creatures are slowed down by the firm planting of their feet."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE@SEAL_GATE@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHARED@FAILURE"
msgstr "The {EventUnit}, aggrieved by your unsuccessful attempt to seal the gate, assails your army."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE@SEAL_GATE@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHARED@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to seal the gate and bind its Guardian to you:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE@SEAL_GATE@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHARED@SUCCESS"
msgstr "You permanently close off the gate. The {EventUnit} is astounded by your power."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_DRAFT@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@FAILURE"
msgstr "The visage of your warriors only provokes an attack from the {EnemyUnit}."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_DRAFT@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@HEADER"
msgstr "Show off your unbridled instruments of war:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_DRAFT@AFFINITY_CHOICE_CHAOS@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The Horwynd Protector yields to your display of frenzied power."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_FOOD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@FAILURE"
msgstr "Your plants wither. Insulted, the {EnemyUnit} orders an attack on your army."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_FOOD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@HEADER"
msgstr "Convince the {EnemyUnit} by growing food before <<o:EnemyUnit>> eyes:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_FOOD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_NATURE@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit} takes a bite from your produce and permits your warriors to enter."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_GOLD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_MATERIUM@FAILURE"
msgstr "You fail to create gold, which causes the {EnemyUnit} to enrage and attack your army."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_GOLD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_MATERIUM@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to produce bits of gold from dust:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_GOLD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_MATERIUM@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The winged defender nods in approval and steps aside."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_GOLD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@FAILURE"
msgstr "The heavens ignore your call. The aggravated {EnemyUnit} orders <<o:EnemyUnit>> {EventRace} to attack."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_GOLD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@HEADER"
msgstr "Call forth a heavenly light of gold:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_GOLD@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@SUCCESS"
msgstr "Bathing in a beam of gold, the Guardian permits your passage."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_IMPERIUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@FAILURE"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit} is offended by your attempt. The {EventRace} attack!"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_IMPERIUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to convince the {EnemyUnit} with your aura of modesty:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_IMPERIUM@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ORDER@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The chimera, awed by your majesty, permits you passage."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_KNOWLEDGE@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@FAILURE"
msgstr "Having failed to convince the {EnemyUnit}, it attacks you for your hubris."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_KNOWLEDGE@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@HEADER"
msgstr "Show off your vast knowledge to the {EnemyUnit}:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_KNOWLEDGE@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@SUCCESS"
msgstr "The Guardian is impressed and authorizes entry."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_KNOWLEDGE@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@FAILURE"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit} is disgusted by your shadowy rumors and assaults your warriors."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_KNOWLEDGE@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@HEADER"
msgstr "Offer hidden knowledge to sway the {EnemyUnit}:"

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_KNOWLEDGE@AFFINITY_CHOICE_SHADOW@SUCCESS"
msgstr "Your secrets successfully persuaded the sphinx-like creature to let you pass."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_MANA@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@FAILURE"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit} mistakes your gesture for an attack and lunges forward."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_MANA@AFFINITY_CHOICE_ASTRAL@HEADER"
msgstr "Attempt to materialize mana to solve the riddle:"

