msgstr "The mighty Guardian is appeased by your humane offering and lets you enter."

msgid "DLC@SECRETSOFTHEARCHMAGES@TRIGGER@TOOLTIP@SHROUDED_GATE_PRODUCTION@AFFINITY_CHOICE_MATERIUM@FAILURE"
msgstr "The {EnemyUnit} deems your spell not true labor and attacks."

