msgstr "{DOMINATED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% base de chance de infligir {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DOMINATED.Hyperlink} por {DOMINATED_TEMP>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>."

